ce utilisateur améliorée","Compatibilité avec CLI pour une mise en œuvre facile","Documentation détaillée pour une intégration facile"],"de":["Anpassbares Design von Portfolio-Ranking-Seiten","Integration mit React, Python und Node.js","KI-Funktionen für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Kompatibilität mit CLI für eine einfache Implementierung","Detaillierte Dokumentation für eine einfache Integration"],"pt":["Design de páginas de rank de membros","Criação de interfaces úteis","Ferramenta de AI para desenvolvedores","Otimização de layouts","Personalização de designs"],"ru":["Дизайн страницы рейтинга членов","Создание полезных интерфейсов","Инструмент ИИ для разработчиков","Оптимизация макетов","Настройка дизайна"],"ar":["تصميم صفحات تصنيف الأعضاء","إنشاء واجهات مفيدة","أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","تحسين التصميمات","تخصيص التصميم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Mermaid AI工具","会员持仓排行榜页面设计","页面设计自动化","开发效率提升","AI工具","页面设计灵活性","Mermaid AI工具安装","Mermaid AI工具设置指南"],"ja":["Mermaid AIエージェント","メンバーホールディングランキングページ設計","ページ設計の自動化","開発効率の向上","AIエージェント","ページ設計の柔軟性","Mermaid AIエージェントのインストール","Mermaid AIエージェントの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Mermaid AI 에이전트","회원 보유 순위 페이지 디자인","페이지 디자인 자동화","개발 효율성 향상","AI 에이전트","페이지 디자인의 유연성","Mermaid AI 에이전트 설치","Mermaid AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","diseño de página de ranking de cartera","mermaid vs otras herramientas de AI","cómo usar mermaid en proyectos de React","guía de instalación de mermaid","mermaid alternative para desarrolladores"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","conception de page de classement de portefeuille","mermaid vs autres outils d''IA","comment utiliser mermaid dans les projets React","guide d''installation de mermaid","alternative à mermaid pour les développeurs"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","Design von Portfolio-Ranking-Seiten","mermaid im Vergleich zu anderen KI-Tools","wie man mermaid in React-Projekten verwendet","mermaid-Installationsanleitung","mermaid-Alternative für Entwickler"],"pt":["ferramentas de AI para desenvolvedores","como usar Mermaid","o que é Mermaid","Mermaid vs outras ferramentas","guias de instalação do Mermaid","configuração do Mermaid"],"ru":["ИИ инструменты для разработчиков","как использовать Mermaid","что такое Mermaid","Mermaid против других инструментов","руководства по установке Mermaid","настройка Mermaid"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية استخدام Mermaid","ما هي Mermaid","Mermaid مقابل أدوات أخرى","دلائل تثبيت Mermaid","إعدادات Mermaid"]}},"owner":"shinnytech","repo":"caiwenqiang-member-rank","repoPath":"shinnytech/caiwenqiang-member-rank","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.812Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mermaid","description":"Guide for creating mermaid diagrams. This skill should be used when users want to create a mermaid diagram (or update an existing diagram).","bodyPreview":"# Mermaid Diagram Skill\n\nThis skill helps you create, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams from natural language descriptions, code analysis, or by editing existing diagrams.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nFollow these steps for every diagram creation/modification:\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n- Identify the diagram type needed (flowchart, sequence, class, etc.)\n- Extract key elements: entities, relationships, flow, hierarchy\n- Determine if creating new, editing existing, or generating from code\n\n### 2.","body":"# Mermaid Diagram Skill\n\nThis skill helps you create, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams from natural language descriptions, code analysis, or by editing existing diagrams.\n\n## Core Workflow\n\nFollow these steps for every diagram creation/modification:\n\n### 1. Understand the Request\n- Identify the diagram type needed (flowchart, sequence, class, etc.)\n- Extract key elements: entities, relationships, flow, hierarchy\n- Determine if creating new, editing existing, or generating from code\n\n### 2. Generate Mermaid Code\n- Create syntactically correct Mermaid diagram code\n- Use appropriate diagram type syntax\n- Apply consistent naming and styling\n- Refer to `examples/` directory for type-specific syntax (load on-demand)\n\n### 3. Save to File\n- Write code to `.mmd` file\n- Generate meaningful filename based on diagram purpose (e.g., `user-authentication-flow.mmd`, `database-schema.mmd`)\n- Use kebab-case for filenames\n\n### 4. Validate with CLI\n- **ALWAYS** validate using: `mmdc -i <filename>.mmd`\n- Check for syntax errors and warnings\n- If validation fails, proceed to step 5\n\n### 5. Auto-Correct Errors\n- Analyze error messages from `mmdc`\n- Common issues:\n  - Invalid syntax or keywords\n  - Missing quotes around labels with spaces\n  - Incorrect arrow syntax\n  - Malformed node definitions\n- Automatically fix the code\n- Re-save and re-validate\n- Repeat until validation succeeds\n\n### 6. Render on Request\n- Default format: **SVG**\n- Command: `mmdc -i <filename>.mmd -o <filename>.svg`\n- Alternative formats: PNG (`-o <filename>.png`), PDF (`-o <filename>.pdf`)\n- Only render when user explicitly requests a preview/image\n\n## Supported Diagram Types\n\nLoad examples from `examples/` directory as needed:\n\n**Basic Diagrams:**\n- Flowchart (`examples/flowchart.md`)\n- Sequence Diagram (`examples/sequence.md`)\n- Class Diagram (`examples/class.md`)\n- State Diagram (`examples/state.md`)\n- Entity Relationship (`examples/er.md`)\n\n**Planning & Management:**\n- Gantt Chart (`examples/gantt.md`)\n- User Journey (`examples/journey.md`)\n- Timeline (`examples/timeline.md`)\n- Kanban (`examples/kanban.md`)\n\n**Data Visualization:**\n- Pie Chart (`examples/pie.md`)\n- XY Chart (`examples/xy-chart.md`)\n- Quadrant Chart (`examples/quadrant.md`)\n- Sankey (`examples/sankey.md`)\n- Radar (`examples/radar.md`)\n- Treemap (`examples/treemap.md`)\n\n**Technical Diagrams:**\n- Git Graph (`examples/git.md`)\n- C4 Diagram (`examples/c4.md`)\n- Requirement Diagram (`examples/requirement.md`)\n- Architecture (`examples/architecture.md`)\n- Block Diagram (`examples/block.md`)\n- Packet (`examples/packet.md`)\n\n**Organizational:**\n- Mindmap (`examples/mindmap.md`)\n- ZenUML (`examples/zenuml.md`)\n\n## Code Analysis → Diagram\n\nWhen analyzing code to create diagrams:\n\n**Class Diagrams:**\n- Extract classes, methods, properties, inheritance, interfaces\n- Show relationships: inheritance, composition, aggregation\n\n**Sequence Diagrams:**\n- Track function calls, async operations, API interactions\n- Show actors, lifelines, activation boxes\n\n**Flowcharts:**\n- Map control flow, conditionals, loops\n- Show function entry/exit points\n\n**State Diagrams:**\n- Identify states from enums, state machines, status fields\n- Map transitions and events\n\n## Templates\n\nCommon patterns available in `templates/common-patterns.md` (load on-demand):\n- Standard flowchart structures\n- API sequence patterns\n- Database ER patterns\n- Microservice architecture layouts\n- State machine templates\n\n## Best Practices\n\n**Styling:**\n- Use meaningful node IDs\n- Add clear, concise labels\n- Apply subgraphs for grouping related elements\n- Use classDefs for visual consistency\n\n**Readability:**\n- Keep diagrams focused (split large diagrams into smaller ones)\n- Use top-to-bottom or left-to-right orientation consistently\n- Add comments in code for complex sections\n\n**Validation:**\n- NEVER skip validation step\n- Always fix errors before presenting to user\n- Test rendered output when in doubt\n\n## Error Handling\n\nIf `mmdc` validation fails:\n1. Read error message carefully\n2. Identify line number and issue\n3. Apply fix (common fixes in examples)\n4. Re-validate\n5. Inform user only if repeated attempts fail\n\n## Output Format\n\nPresent to user:\n```\nCreated: <filename>.mmd\n\n<Show the mermaid code in a code block>\n\n✓ Validated successfully with mermaid-cli\n```\n\nIf rendered:\n```\nCreated: <filename>.mmd\nRendered: <filename>.svg\n\n[Show file paths]\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- Assume `mmdc` (mermaid-cli) is installed and available\n- Default output format: SVG\n- Always validate before presenting\n- Fix errors autonomously\n- Only load example files when needed for specific diagram type\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:34:29.691Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing advanced diagram visualization and rendering capabilities through Mermaid diagrams.","zh":"非常适合需要高级图表可视化和渲染功能的开发代理，通过Mermaid图表实现。","ja":"開発エージェントがMermaid図を使用して高度なダイアグラムの視覚化とレンダリング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Mermaid 다이어그램을 통해 고급 차트 시각화 및 렌더링 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de visualización y renderizado de diagramas avanzados a través de diagramas Mermaid.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités de visualisation et de rendu de diagrammes avancées via des diagrammes Mermaid.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die erweiterte Diagrammvisualisierungs- und -renderingfunktionen über Mermaid-Diagramme benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de visualização avançada de diagramas e capacidades de renderização através de Mermaid diagrams.","ru":"Идеально для Development Agents, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации диаграммов и рендеринга через Mermaid diagrams.","ar":"مثالي ل Agentes من النوع Development الذين يحتاجون إلى واجهات diagram visualization ومحتوى rendering من خلال Mermaid diagrams."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, validate, and render Mermaid diagrams from natural language descriptions, code analysis, or by editing existing diagrams, supporting flowcharts, sequences, classes, and more, with output in SVG format.","zh":"使代理能够从自然语言描述、代码分析或编辑现有图表创建、验证和渲染Mermaid图表，支持流程图、序列图、类图等，输出SVG格式。","ja":"エージェントが自然言語の記述、コード分析、または既存の図の編集からMermaid図を生成、検証、レンダリングできるようにし、フローチャート、シーケンス図、クラス図などをサポートし、SVG形式で出力します。","ko":"에이전트가 자연어 설명, 코드 분석 또는 기존 다이어그램 편집에서 Mermaid 다이어그램을 생성, 확인 및 렌더링할 수 있도록 하며, 흐름図, 시퀀스 다이어그램, 클래스 다이어그램 등을 지원하며 SVG 형식으로 출력합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, validar y renderizar diagramas Mermaid a partir de descripciones de lenguaje natural, análisis de código o editando diagramas existentes, con soporte para diagramas de flujo, secuencias, clases y más, con salida en formato SVG.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, de valider et de renderiser des diagrammes Mermaid à partir de descriptions en langage naturel, d''analyse de code ou en éditant des diagrammes existants, en prenant en charge les diagrammes de flux, les séquences, les classes et plus encore, avec une sortie au format SVG.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Mermaid-Diagramme aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen, Codeanalysen oder durch Bearbeiten bestehender Diagramme zu erstellen, zu überprüfen und zu rendern, mit Unterstützung für Flussdiagramme, Sequenzen, Klassen und mehr, mit Ausgabe im SVG-Format.","pt":"Empodera os agentes a criar, validar e renderizar Mermaid diagrams a partir de descrições em linguagem natural, análise de código ou por editar diagramas existentes, com suporte a flowcharts, sequências, classes e mais, com saída em formato SVG.","ru":"Эмподерает агентов создавать, валидировать и рендерить Mermaid диаграммы из естественного языка описаний, кода анализа или редактирования существующих диаграмм, с поддержкой flowcharts, последовательностей, классов и более, с выводом в формате SVG.","ar":"يُمنِعُ واجهة agents بإنشاء، وتحقق، وترجمة Mermaid diagrams من وصفات في اللغة الطبيعية، أو من تحليلات للكود، أو من خلال تحرير Diagrams موجودة، مع دعم ل flowcharts، وsequences، وclasses، ومن أكثر، مع خرج في شكل SVG."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating flowcharts for process documentation","Creating sequence diagrams for API interactions","Editing class diagrams for software design"],"zh":["为流程文档生成流程图","为API交互创建序列图","通过编辑现有类图进行软件设计"],"ja":["プロセス文書化のためのフローチャートの生成","APIのやり取りのためのシーケンス図の作成","既存のクラス図の編集によるソフトウェア設計"],"ko":["프로세스 문서화를 위한 흐름圖 생성","API 상호 작용을 위한 시퀀스 다이어그램 생성","기존 클래스 다이어그램 편집을 통한 소프트웨어 설계"],"es":["Generación de diagramas de flujo para la documentación de procesos","Creación de diagramas de secuencia para interacciones de API","Edición de diagramas de clases para el diseño de software"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes de flux pour la documentation de processus","Création de diagrammes de séquence pour les interactions d''API","Édition de diagrammes de classes pour la conception de logiciels"],"de":["Generierung von Flussdiagrammen für die Prozessdokumentation","Erstellung von Sequenzdiagrammen für API-Interaktionen","Bearbeitung von Klassendiagrammen für die Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Gerando flowcharts para documentação de processos","Criando sequências de diagramas para interações de API","Editando diagramas de classe para design de software"],"ru":["Генерируя flowcharts для документации процессов","Создавая последовательности диаграмм для взаимодействия с API","Редактируя диаграммы классов для разработки программного обеспечения"],"ar":["توليد flowcharts لتوثيق عمليات","إنشاء diagrams من النوع sequence لتفاعلات API","تحرير diagrams من النوع class لتصميم البرامج"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Mermaid syntax understanding","Limited to Mermaid-supported diagram types"],"zh":["需要理解Mermaid语法","仅限Mermaid支持的图表类型"],"ja":["Mermaid構文の理解が必要","Mermaidでサポートされている図のタイプのみ"],"ko":["Mermaid 구문의 이해가 필요","Mermaid에서 지원하는 다이어그램 유형만 해당"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de la sintaxis Mermaid","Limitado a los tipos de diagramas compatibles con Mermaid"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension de la syntaxe Mermaid","Limité aux types de diagrammes pris en charge par Mermaid"],"de":["Benötigt Verständnis der Mermaid-Syntax","Begrenzt auf die von Mermaid unterstützten Diagrammtypen"],"pt":["Requer entendimento da sintaxe de Mermaid","Limitado a tipos de diagramas suportados pelo Mermaid"],"ru":["Требует понимания синтаксиса Mermaid","Ограничен только типами диаграмм, поддерживаемыми Mermaid"],"ar":["يتطلب فهما ل Mermaid syntax","محدود إلى أنواع Diagrams التي يدعمها Mermaid"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"30cca46e4a8e86a467cded4732d24c0eff4e2e584fb60800a23035ddf802f86a","qualityScore":55}');
