rstützung für mehrere Agenten und Aufgaben"],"pt":["Arquitetura de código aberto","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Suporte a CLI","Extensível e personalizável"],"ru":["Открытая архитектура кода","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Поддержка CLI","Расширяемый и настраиваемый"],"ar":["هيكل مفتوح المصدر","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","دعم CLI","قابل للتوسيع والتحديث"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能助手","bird使用教程","bird安装指南","bird与其他AI工具比较","如何使用bird","bird的特点和优势","bird CLI命令行接口","bird Agent扩展和自定义"],"ja":["AIエージェント","birdの使い方","birdのインストールガイド","birdと他のAIツールの比較","birdの特徴と利点","bird CLIコマンドラインインターフェース","birdエージェントの拡張とカスタマイズ"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","bird 사용법","bird 설치 가이드","bird와 다른 AI 도구 비교","bird의 특징과 장점","bird CLI 명령행 인터페이스","bird 에이전트 확장 및 사용자 지정"],"es":["cómo usar agente de IA","qué es un agente de IA","alternativas a Bird","Bird vs otros agentes de IA","instalación de Bird","guía de configuración de Bird","desarrollo de soluciones de IA con Bird"],"fr":["comment utiliser un agent d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un agent d''IA","alternatives à Bird","Bird vs autres agents d''IA","installation de Bird","guide de configuration de Bird","développement de solutions d''IA avec Bird"],"de":["wie man AI-Agenten verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","Alternativen zu Bird","Bird vs andere AI-Agents","Installation von Bird","Konfigurationshandbuch für Bird","Entwicklung von IA-Lösungen mit Bird"],"pt":["como usar assistente de IA","o que é assistente multiagente","alternativas ao Bird","Bird vs outros assistentes de IA","instalar Bird","guia de configuração do Bird"],"ru":["как использовать помощник ИИ","что такое многоагентный помощник","альтернативы Bird","Bird vs другие помощники ИИ","установить Bird","руководство по настройке Bird"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مساعد الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو مساعد متعدد الوكلاء","بديل لطائر","طائر مقابل مساعدين أخرين من الذكاء الاصطناعي","تثبيت طائر","دليل إعداد طائر"]}},"owner":"viralcode","repo":"openwhale","repoPath":"viralcode/openwhale","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.960Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"bird","description":"X/Twitter CLI for reading, searching, posting, and engagement via cookies.","bodyPreview":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth — no Twitter API keys needed!\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--ch","body":"# bird 🐦\n\nFast X/Twitter CLI using GraphQL + cookie auth.\n\n## Install\n\n```bash\n# npm/pnpm/bun\nnpm install -g @steipete/bird\n\n# Homebrew (macOS, prebuilt binary)\nbrew install steipete/tap/bird\n\n# One-shot (no install)\nbunx @steipete/bird whoami\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n`bird` uses cookie-based auth — no Twitter API keys needed!\n\nUse `--auth-token` / `--ct0` to pass cookies directly, or `--cookie-source` for browser cookies.\n\nRun `bird check` to see which source is active. For Arc/Brave, use `--chrome-profile-dir <path>`.\n\n## Commands\n\n### Account & Auth\n\n```bash\nbird whoami                    # Show logged-in account\nbird check                     # Show credential sources\nbird query-ids --fresh         # Refresh GraphQL query ID cache\n```\n\n### Reading Tweets\n\n```bash\nbird read <url-or-id>          # Read a single tweet\nbird <url-or-id>               # Shorthand for read\nbird thread <url-or-id>        # Full conversation thread\nbird replies <url-or-id>       # List replies to a tweet\n```\n\n### Timelines\n\n```bash\nbird home                      # Home timeline (For You)\nbird home --following          # Following timeline\nbird user-tweets @handle -n 20 # User''s profile timeline\nbird mentions                  # Tweets mentioning you\nbird mentions --user @handle   # Mentions of another user\n```\n\n### Search\n\n```bash\nbird search \"query\" -n 10\nbird search \"from:steipete\" --all --max-pages 3\n```\n\n### News & Trending\n\n```bash\nbird news -n 10                # AI-curated from Explore tabs\nbird news --ai-only            # Filter to AI-curated only\nbird news --sports             # Sports tab\nbird news --with-tweets        # Include related tweets\nbird trending                  # Alias for news\n```\n\n### Lists\n\n```bash\nbird lists                     # Your lists\nbird lists --member-of         # Lists you''re a member of\nbird list-timeline <id> -n 20  # Tweets from a list\n```\n\n### Bookmarks & Likes\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks -n 10\nbird bookmarks --folder-id <id>           # Specific folder\nbird bookmarks --include-parent           # Include parent tweet\nbird bookmarks --author-chain             # Author''s self-reply chain\nbird bookmarks --full-chain-only          # Full reply chain\nbird unbookmark <url-or-id>\nbird likes -n 10\n```\n\n### Social Graph\n\n```bash\nbird following -n 20           # Users you follow\nbird followers -n 20           # Users following you\nbird following --user <id>     # Another user''s following\nbird about @handle             # Account origin/location info\n```\n\n### Engagement Actions\n\n```bash\nbird follow @handle            # Follow a user\nbird unfollow @handle          # Unfollow a user\n```\n\n### Posting\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hello world\"\nbird reply <url-or-id> \"nice thread!\"\nbird tweet \"check this out\" --media image.png --alt \"description\"\n```\n\n**⚠️ Posting risks**: Posting is more likely to be rate limited; if blocked, use the browser tool instead.\n\n## Media Uploads\n\n```bash\nbird tweet \"hi\" --media img.png --alt \"description\"\nbird tweet \"pics\" --media a.jpg --media b.jpg  # Up to 4 images\nbird tweet \"video\" --media clip.mp4            # Or 1 video\n```\n\n## Pagination\n\nCommands supporting pagination: `replies`, `thread`, `search`, `bookmarks`, `likes`, `list-timeline`, `following`, `followers`, `user-tweets`\n\n```bash\nbird bookmarks --all                    # Fetch all pages\nbird bookmarks --max-pages 3            # Limit pages\nbird bookmarks --cursor <cursor>        # Resume from cursor\nbird replies <id> --all --delay 1000    # Delay between pages (ms)\n```\n\n## Output Options\n\n```bash\n--json          # JSON output\n--json-full     # JSON with raw API response\n--plain         # No emoji, no color (script-friendly)\n--no-emoji      # Disable emoji\n--no-color      # Disable ANSI colors (or set NO_COLOR=1)\n--quote-depth n # Max quoted tweet depth in JSON (default: 1)\n```\n\n## Global Options\n\n```bash\n--auth-token <token>       # Set auth_token cookie\n--ct0 <token>              # Set ct0 cookie\n--cookie-source <source>   # Cookie source for browser cookies (repeatable)\n--chrome-profile <name>    # Chrome profile name\n--chrome-profile-dir <path> # Chrome/Chromium profile dir or cookie DB path\n--firefox-profile <name>   # Firefox profile\n--timeout <ms>             # Request timeout\n--cookie-timeout <ms>      # Cookie extraction timeout\n```\n\n## Config File\n\n`~/.config/bird/config.json5` (global) or `./.birdrc.json5` (project):\n\n```json5\n{\n  cookieSource: [\"chrome\"],\n  chromeProfileDir: \"/path/to/Arc/Profile\",\n  timeoutMs: 20000,\n  quoteDepth: 1,\n}\n```\n\nEnvironment variables: `BIRD_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_COOKIE_TIMEOUT_MS`, `BIRD_QUOTE_DEPTH`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### Query IDs stale (404 errors)\n\n```bash\nbird query-ids --fresh\n```\n\n### Cookie extraction fails\n\n- Check browser is logged into X\n- Try different `--cookie-source`\n- For Arc/Brave: use `--chrome-profile-dir`\n\n---\n\n**TL;DR**: Read/search/engage with CLI. Post carefully or use browser. 🐦\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:13:44.885Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Social Media Agents requiring streamlined Twitter CLI interactions via GraphQL and cookie-based authentication.","zh":"适用于需要通过GraphQL和基于Cookie的身份验证简化Twitter CLI交互的社交媒体代理。","ja":"Twitter CLIのインタラクションをGraphQLとCookieベースの認証でストリームライン化する必要があるソーシャルメディアエージェントに最適。","ko":"GraphQL 및 쿠키 기반 인증을 통해 Twitter CLI 상호 작용을 간소화해야 하는 소셜 미디어 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Medios Sociales que requieren interacciones de Twitter CLI optimizadas a través de GraphQL y autenticación basada en cookies.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de médias sociaux nécessitant des interactions Twitter CLI optimisées via GraphQL et une authentification basée sur les cookies.","de":"Ideal für Social-Media-Agents, die optimierte Twitter-CLI-Interaktionen über GraphQL und Cookie-basierte Authentifizierung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Mídia Social que requerem interações de Twitter CLI otimizadas via GraphQL e autenticação baseada em cookies.","ru":"Идеально для Социальных Медиа Агентов, требующих оптимизированных взаимодействий с Twitter CLI через GraphQL и аутентификацию на основе cookies.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام الاجتماعية التي تتطلب تفاعلات Twitter CLI المُبسطة عبر GraphQL والتحقق من الهوية المعتمد على الكوكيز."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Twitter''s API using GraphQL queries and cookie auth, eliminating the need for Twitter API keys and enabling seamless interactions with the Twitter platform, including direct cookie authentication via --auth-token or --cookie-source.","zh":"赋予代理使用GraphQL查询和Cookie认证来利用Twitter的API的能力，消除了对Twitter API密钥的需求，并实现了与Twitter平台的无缝交互，包括通过--auth-token或--cookie-source进行直接Cookie认证。","ja":"エージェントがGraphQLクエリとCookie認証を使用してTwitterのAPIを利用できるようにし、Twitter APIキーが不要になり、Twitterプラットフォームとのシームレスなやり取りが可能になり、--auth-tokenまたは--cookie-sourceによる直接のCookie認証が可能になる。","ko":"에이전트가 GraphQL 쿼리 및 쿠키 인증을 사용하여 Twitter의 API를 활용할 수 있도록 하여 Twitter API 키가 필요 없게 하고 Twitter 플랫폼과 무제한 상호 작용을 가능하게 하며 --auth-token 또는 --cookie-source를 통해 직접 쿠키 인증을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar la API de Twitter utilizando consultas GraphQL y autenticación de cookies, eliminando la necesidad de claves de API de Twitter y permitiendo interacciones sin problemas con la plataforma de Twitter, incluida la autenticación de cookies directa a través de --auth-token o --cookie-source.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser l''API Twitter en utilisant des requêtes GraphQL et une authentification par cookies, éliminant ainsi le besoin de clés d''API Twitter et permettant des interactions sans problème avec la plateforme Twitter, y compris l''authentification par cookies directe via --auth-token ou --cookie-source.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Twitters API mithilfe von GraphQL-Abfragen und Cookie-Authentifizierung zu nutzen, wodurch der Bedarf an Twitter-API-Schlüsseln entfällt und eine nahtlose Interaktion mit der Twitter-Plattform ermöglicht wird, einschließlich direkter Cookie-Authentifizierung über --auth-token oder --cookie-source.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a aproveitar a API do Twitter usando consultas GraphQL e autenticação de cookie, eliminando a necessidade de chaves da API do Twitter e permitindo interações sem problemas com a plataforma do Twitter, incluindo autenticação direta de cookie via --auth-token ou --cookie-source.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью использовать API Twitter с помощью запросов GraphQL и аутентификации cookies, исключая необходимость в ключах API Twitter и обеспечивая беспрепятственные взаимодействия с платформой Twitter, включая прямую аутентификацию cookies через --auth-token или --cookie-source.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Twitter باستخدام استفسارات GraphQL والتحقق من الهوية المعتمد على الكوكيز، مما يُلغي الحاجة إلى مفاتيح واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Twitter ويمكن التفاعلات السلسة مع منصة Twitter، بما في ذلك التحقق المباشر من الكوكيز عبر --auth-token أو --cookie-source."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating Twitter profile management using bird''s whoami command","Generating Twitter content using GraphQL queries","Debugging Twitter API issues with bird''s check functionality"],"zh":["使用bird的whoami命令自动化Twitter个人资料管理","使用GraphQL查询生成Twitter内容","使用bird的check功能调试Twitter API问题"],"ja":["birdのwhoamiコマンドを使用してTwitterプロフィール管理を自動化する","GraphQLクエリを使用してTwitterコンテンツを生成する","birdのcheck機能を使用してTwitter APIの問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["bird의 whoami 명령을 사용하여 Twitter 프로필 관리 자동화","GraphQL 쿼리를 사용하여 Twitter 콘텐츠 생성","bird의 check 기능을 사용하여 Twitter API 문제 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de la gestión de perfiles de Twitter utilizando el comando whoami de bird","Generación de contenido de Twitter utilizando consultas GraphQL","Depuración de problemas de la API de Twitter con la funcionalidad de verificación de bird"],"fr":["Automatisation de la gestion de profils Twitter à l''aide de la commande whoami de bird","Génération de contenu Twitter en utilisant des requêtes GraphQL","Débogage des problèmes d''API Twitter avec la fonctionnalité de vérification de bird"],"de":["Automatisierung der Twitter-Profilverwaltung mithilfe des whoami-Befehls von bird","Generierung von Twitter-Inhalten mithilfe von GraphQL-Abfragen","Fehlerbehebung bei Twitter-API-Problemen mit der Überprüfungsfunktion von bird"],"pt":["Automatizar a gestão de perfis do Twitter usando o comando whoami do bird","Gerar conteúdo do Twitter usando consultas GraphQL","Depurar problemas da API do Twitter com a funcionalidade de verificação do bird"],"ru":["Автоматизация управления профилями Twitter с помощью команды whoami bird","Генерация контента Twitter с помощью запросов GraphQL","Отладка проблем API Twitter с функцией проверки bird"],"ar":["تحسين إدارة ملفات تعريف Twitter باستخدام أمر whoami للطائر","генерация محتوى Twitter باستخدام استفسارات GraphQL","تصحيح أخطاء واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Twitter باستخدام وظيفة التحقق من الطائر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires cookie-based authentication","Limited to Twitter API interactions","Dependent on external cookie sources or manual token passing"],"zh":["需要基于Cookie的身份验证","仅限Twitter API交互","依赖外部Cookie源或手动令牌传递"],"ja":["Cookieベースの認証が必要","Twitter APIのインタラクションのみ","外部Cookieソースまたは手動トークン伝達に依存"],"ko":["쿠키 기반 인증이 필요","Twitter API 상호 작용만","외부 쿠키 소스 또는 수동 토큰 전달에 의존"],"es":["Requiere autenticación basada en cookies","Limitado a interacciones con la API de Twitter","Dependiente de fuentes de cookies externas o de la transmisión manual de tokens"],"fr":["Nécessite une authentification basée sur les cookies","Limité aux interactions avec l''API Twitter","Dépendant de sources de cookies externes ou du passage manuel de jetons"],"de":["Erfordert Cookie-basierte Authentifizierung","Begrenzt auf Interaktionen mit der Twitter-API","Abhängig von externen Cookie-Quellen oder manueller Token-Übermittlung"],"pt":["Requer autenticação baseada em cookies","Limitado a interações com a API do Twitter","Depende de fontes de cookies externas ou passagem manual de token"],"ru":["Требует аутентификации на основе cookies","Ограничен взаимодействиями с API Twitter","Зависит от внешних источников cookies или ручной передачи токена"],"ar":["يتطلب التحقق من الهوية المعتمد على الكوكيز","محدود بالتفاعلات مع واجهة برمجة تطبيقات Twitter","يعتمد على مصادر الكوكيز الخارجية أو تمرير رمز التحقق يدويًا"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"62923add9ae1a3d6c907f3d6366dba698bd9c1c94e24f3710c70d84d170c7d2c","qualityScore":55}');
