دعات الخاصة","فهرسة المشاريع"]}},"owner":"sundial-org","repo":"awesome-openclaw-skills","repoPath":"sundial-org/awesome-openclaw-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.571Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-kb","description":"Manage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Use when users ask about repos, PRs, issues, request to clone GitHub repositories, explore codebases, or need information about GitHub projects. Supports searching GitHub via gh CLI and managing local KB with GITHUB_KB.md catalog. Configure via GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH environment variables.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GIT","body":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GITHUB_KB_PATH=\"/your/path/github-kb\"\n```\n\n**Token Privacy:** Never hardcode tokens. Inject via environment variables or container secrets.\n\n## GitHub CLI (gh)\n\n**Requirement:** GitHub CLI must be installed and authenticated.\n\n**Installation:**\n- **macOS:** `brew install gh`\n- **Linux:** `apt install gh` or see [official install guide](https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/docs/install_linux.md)\n- **Windows:** `winget install GitHub.cli`\n\n**Authentication:**\n```bash\n# Interactive login\ngh auth login\n\n# Or use token from GITHUB_TOKEN env var\ngh auth login --with-token <(echo \"$GITHUB_TOKEN\")\n```\n\n**Verify:** `gh auth status`\n\nIf `gh` is not installed or not authenticated, skip search operations and use only local KB features.\n\n### Searching Repos\n\n```bash\n# Search repos by keyword\ngh search repos <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search repos \"typescript cli\" --limit 10\ngh search repos \"language:python stars:>1000\" --limit 20\ngh search repos \"topic:mcp\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by programming language\n- `stars:<n>` or `stars:><n>` - Filter by star count\n- `topic:<name>` - Filter by topic\n- `user:<owner>` - Search within a user''s repos\n- `org:<org>` - Search within an organization\n\n### Searching Issues\n\n```bash\ngh search issues \"react hooks bug\" --limit 20\ngh search issues \"repo:facebook/react state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search issues \"language:typescript label:bug\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed` - Filter by issue state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `comments:<n>` or `comments:><n>` - Filter by comment count\n\n### Searching Pull Requests\n\n```bash\n# Search PRs\ngh search prs <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search prs \"repo:vercel/next.js state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search prs \"language:go is:merged\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed|merged` - Filter by PR state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `is:merged|unmerged` - Filter by merge status\n\n### Viewing PR/Issue Details\n\n```bash\n# View issue/PR details\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\n\n# View with comments\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\n```\n\n## Local Knowledge Base Workflow\n\n### Querying About a Repo in KB\n\n1. Read GITHUB_KB.md to understand what projects exist\n2. Locate the project directory under ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/\n\n### Cloning a New Repo to KB\n\n1. Search GitHub if the full repo name is not known\n2. Clone to KB directory:\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<name>.git ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/<name>\n   ```\n3. Generate project description: Read README or key files to understand the project\n4. Update GITHUB_KB.md: Add entry for the new repo following the existing format:\n   ```markdown\n   ### [<name>](/<name>)\n   Brief one-line description of what the project does. Additional context if useful (key features, tech stack, etc.).\n   ```\n5. Confirm completion: Tell user the repo was cloned and where to find it\n\n### Default Clone Location\n\nIf user says \"clone X\" without specifying a directory, default to ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/.\n\n## GITHUB_KB.md Format\n\nThe catalog file follows this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nThis directory contains X GitHub projects covering various domains.\n\n---\n\n## Category Name\n\n### [project-name](/project-name)\nBrief description of the project.\n```\n\nMaintain categorization and consistent formatting when updating.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:22:44.410Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Developer Agents needing GitHub repository management and search capabilities via gh CLI.","zh":"非常适合需要 GitHub 仓库管理和搜索功能的开发者代理，通过 gh CLI 实现。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの管理および検索機能を必要とする開発者エージェントに最適です。gh CLI を使用します。","ko":"GitHub 저장소 관리 및 검색 기능을 필요로 하는 개발자 에이전트에게 적합합니다. gh CLI를 통해 구현됩니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollador que necesitan administración de repositorios de GitHub y capacidades de búsqueda a través de gh CLI.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développeur ayant besoin de gestion de référentiels GitHub et de fonctionnalités de recherche via gh CLI.","de":"Perfekt für Entwickleragenten, die die Verwaltung von GitHub-Repositorys und Suchfunktionen über gh CLI benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que necessitam de gerenciamento de repositório do GitHub e capacidades de pesquisa via CLI do gh.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, которым необходимы функции управления репозиторием GitHub и возможности поиска через CLI gh.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المطورين الذين يحتاجون إلى إدارة مخازن GitHub وقدرات البحث من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر gh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage a local GitHub knowledge base, providing GitHub search capabilities and cataloging projects with brief descriptions using environment variables like GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH.","zh":"赋予代理管理本地 GitHub 知识库的能力，提供 GitHub 搜索功能，并使用环境变量（如 GITHUB_TOKEN 和 GITHUB_KB_PATH）对项目进行编目和简要描述。","ja":"エージェントがローカルの GitHub ナレッジ ベースを管理できるようにし、GitHub 検索機能を提供し、環境変数 (GITHUB_TOKEN、GITHUB_KB_PATH など) を使用してプロジェクトをカタログ化し、簡単な説明を付けることができる。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 GitHub 지식베이스를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, GitHub 검색 기능을 제공하고, 환경 변수(GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH 등)를 사용하여 프로젝트를 카탈로그화하고 간단한 설명을 추가할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a administrar una base de conocimientos local de GitHub, proporcionando capacidades de búsqueda de GitHub y catalogación de proyectos con descripciones breves utilizando variables de entorno como GITHUB_TOKEN y GITHUB_KB_PATH.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer une base de connaissances GitHub locale, fournissant des fonctionnalités de recherche GitHub et de catalogage de projets avec des descriptions brèves en utilisant des variables d''environnement comme GITHUB_TOKEN et GITHUB_KB_PATH.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine lokale GitHub-Wissensbasis zu verwalten, indem sie GitHub-Suchfunktionen und Projektverzeichnisse mit kurzen Beschreibungen bereitstellt, die Umgebungsvariablen wie GITHUB_TOKEN und GITHUB_KB_PATH verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar uma base de conhecimento local do GitHub, fornecendo capacidades de pesquisa do GitHub e catalogação de projetos com descrições breves usando variáveis de ambiente como GITHUB_TOKEN e GITHUB_KB_PATH.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять локальной базой знаний GitHub, предоставляя возможности поиска GitHub и каталогизации проектов с краткими описаниями с использованием переменных окружения, таких как GITHUB_TOKEN и GITHUB_KB_PATH.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة قاعدة معرفة محلية لموقع GitHub، وتوفير قدرات البحث في موقع GitHub وكتالوج المشاريع مع описات موجزة باستخدام متغيرات بيئة مثل GITHUB_TOKEN و GITHUB_KB_PATH."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GitHub repository searches","Generating project catalogs in GITHUB_KB.md","Debugging private repository access with GITHUB_TOKEN"],"zh":["自动执行 GitHub 仓库搜索","生成项目目录到 GITHUB_KB.md","使用 GITHUB_TOKEN 调试私有仓库访问"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリの検索を自動化する","GITHUB_KB.md にプロジェクト カタログを生成する","GITHUB_TOKEN を使用してプライベート リポジトリへのアクセスをデバッグする"],"ko":["GitHub 저장소 검색 자동화","GITHUB_KB.md에 프로젝트 카탈로그 생성","GITHUB_TOKEN을 사용하여 개인 저장소 액세스 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de búsquedas de repositorios de GitHub","Generación de catálogos de proyectos en GITHUB_KB.md","Depuración del acceso a repositorios privados con GITHUB_TOKEN"],"fr":["Automatisation des recherches de référentiels GitHub","Génération de catalogues de projets dans GITHUB_KB.md","Débogage de l''accès aux référentiels privés avec GITHUB_TOKEN"],"de":["Automatisierung von GitHub-Repository-Suchen","Erstellung von Projektverzeichnissen in GITHUB_KB.md","Fehlerbehebung bei der Zugriffsverwaltung privater Repositorys mit GITHUB_TOKEN"],"pt":["Automatizar pesquisas de repositório do GitHub","Gerar catálogos de projeto em GITHUB_KB.md","Depurar acesso a repositório privado com GITHUB_TOKEN"],"ru":["Автоматизация поиска репозиториев GitHub","Генерация каталогов проектов в GITHUB_KB.md","Отладка доступа к приватным репозиториям с помощью GITHUB_TOKEN"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات البحث في مخازن GitHub","إنشاء فهرس لمشاريع في GITHUB_KB.md","تصحيح أخطاء الوصول إلى المخازن الخاصة باستخدام GITHUB_TOKEN"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Personal Access Token for private repos","Needs environment variables set (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)","Dependent on gh CLI for GitHub interactions"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 个人访问令牌来访问私有仓库","需要设置环境变量（GITHUB_TOKEN、GITHUB_KB_PATH）","依赖于 gh CLI 来与 GitHub 交互"],"ja":["プライベート リポジトリにアクセスするには GitHub 個人用アクセス トークンが必要","環境変数 (GITHUB_TOKEN、GITHUB_KB_PATH) を設定する必要がある","GitHub とのやり取りには gh CLI に依存する"],"ko":["개인 저장소에 액세스하려면 GitHub 개인 액세스 토큰이 필요합니다","환경 변수(GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)를 설정해야 함","GitHub와의 상호 작용에는 gh CLI에 의존"],"es":["Requiere un Token de Acceso Personal de GitHub para repositorios privados","Necesita variables de entorno configuradas (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)","Dependiente de gh CLI para interacciones con GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un Jeton d''Accès Personnel GitHub pour les référentiels privés","Nécessite des variables d''environnement configurées (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)","Dépend de gh CLI pour les interactions avec GitHub"],"de":["Benötigt ein GitHub-Personal Access Token für private Repositorys","Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)","Abhängig von gh CLI für Interaktionen mit GitHub"],"pt":["Exige Token de Acesso Pessoal do GitHub para repositórios privados","Necessita variáveis de ambiente definidas (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)","Dependente da CLI do gh para interações com o GitHub"],"ru":["Требует Личный токен доступа GitHub для приватных репозиториев","Требует настроенных переменных окружения (GITHUB_TOKEN, GITHUB_KB_PATH)","Зависит от CLI gh для взаимодействия с GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز وصول شخصي لموقع GitHub للمخازن الخاصة","يحتاج إلى تعريف متغيرات البيئة (GITHUB_TOKEN و GITHUB_KB_PATH)","يعتمد على واجهة سطر الأوامر gh للتفاعل مع موقع GitHub"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8d62830e2d00b0b63fe36620febd451b583dbcfad38acf354a1d77942401e303","qualityScore":55}');
