,"description":{"zh":"github-kb技能用于管理本地GitHub知识库，并提供GitHub搜索功能","ja":"github-kbスキルはローカルGitHubナレッジベースを管理し、GitHub検索機能を提供","ko":"github-kb 스킬은 로컬 GitHub 지식베이스를 관리하고 GitHub 검색 기능을 제공","es":"La habilidad github-kb permite gestionar un repositorio de conocimientos de GitHub local y ofrecer capacidades de búsqueda en GitHub","fr":"La compétence github-kb permet de gérer un référentiel de connaissances GitHub local et d''offrir des capacités de recherche sur GitHub","de":"Die Fähigkeit github-kb ermöglicht die Verwaltung eines lokalen GitHub-Wissensrepositories und bietet GitHub-Suchfunktionen","pt":"O agente GitHub Knowledge Base permite gerenciar uma base de conhecimento local do GitHub e realizar pesquisas via CLI do GitHub.","ru":"Агент База Знаний GitHub позволяет управлять локальной базой знаний GitHub и выполнять поиск через CLI GitHub.","ar":"وكلاء قاعدة المعرفة جيثب يسمح بإدارة قاعدة معرفة جيثب المحلية والبحث من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر جيثب","en":"OpenClaw AI Agent Skills Directory - Discover 1700+ AI Agent Skills"},"definition":{"en":"OpenClaw AI Agent Skills Directory - Discover 1700+ AI Agent Skills"},"features":{"zh":["管理本地GitHub知识库","提供GitHub搜索功能","支持私有仓库","可配置环境变量","支持gh CLI"],"ja":["ローカルGitHubナレッジベースを管理","GitHub検索機能を提供","プライベートリポジトリをサポート","環境変数を設定可能","gh CLIをサポート"],"ko":["로컬 GitHub 지식베이스를 관리","GitHub 검색 기능을 제공","개인 저장소를 지원","환경 변수를 설정 가능","gh CLI를 지원"],"es":["Gestión de un repositorio de conocimientos de GitHub local","Búsqueda en GitHub mediante gh CLI","Configuración de variables de entorno para el token de acceso personal y la ruta del repositorio","Compatibilidad con repositorios privados","Documentación en formato Markdown"],"fr":["Gestion d''un référentiel de connaissances GitHub local","Recherche sur GitHub via gh CLI","Configuration des variables d''environnement pour le jeton d''accès personnel et le chemin du référentiel","Compatibilité avec les référentiels privés","Documentation au format Markdown"],"de":["Verwaltung eines lokalen GitHub-Wissensrepositories","Suche in GitHub über gh CLI","Konfiguration von Umgebungsvariablen für den persönlichen Zugriffstoken und den Repository-Pfad","Unterstützung für private Repositorys","Dokumentation im Markdown-Format"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de base de conhecimento local do GitHub","Pesquisa via CLI do GitHub","Configuração de variáveis de ambiente","Suporte a repositórios privados com token de acesso pessoal"],"ru":["Управление локальной базой знаний GitHub","Поиск через CLI GitHub","Настройка переменных окружения","Поддержка приватных репозиториев с личным токеном доступа"],"ar":["إدارة قاعدة معرفة جيثب المحلية","البحث من خلال واجهة سطر الأوامر جيثب","تكوين متغيرات البيئة","دعم مستودعات خاصة مع رمز وصول شخصي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["github-kb","GitHub知识库","gh CLI","本地知识库管理","GitHub搜索","私有仓库","环境变量"],"ja":["github-kb","GitHubナレッジベース","gh CLI","ローカルナレッジベース管理","GitHub検索","プライベートリポジトリ","環境変数"],"ko":["github-kb","GitHub 지식베이스","gh CLI","로컬 지식베이스 관리","GitHub 검색","개인 저장소","환경 변수"],"es":["github knowledge base","gestión de conocimientos","gh cli","búsqueda en github","token de acceso personal","repositorio local","markdown"],"fr":["base de connaissances github","gestion des connaissances","gh cli","recherche sur github","jeton d''accès personnel","référentiel local","markdown"],"de":["github knowledge base","wissensmanagement","gh cli","suche in github","persönlicher zugriffstoken","lokales repository","markdown"],"pt":["github knowledge base","gerenciamento de conhecimento","pesquisa github","cli github","token de acesso pessoal","repositórios privados"],"ru":["база знаний github","управление знаниями","поиск github","cli github","личный токен доступа","приватные репозитории"],"ar":["قاعدة المعرفة جيثب","إدارة المعرفة","البحث جيثب","واجهة سطر الأوامر جيثب","رمز وصول شخصي","مستودعات خاصة"]}},"owner":"Demerzels-lab","repo":"elsamultiskillagent","repoPath":"Demerzels-lab/elsamultiskillagent","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.571Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"github-kb","description":"Manage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Use when users ask about repos, PRs, issues, request to clone GitHub repositories, explore codebases, or need information about GitHub projects. Supports searching GitHub via gh CLI and managing local KB with GITHUB_KB.md catalog. Configure via GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH environment variables.","bodyPreview":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GIT","body":"# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nManage a local GitHub knowledge base and provide GitHub search capabilities via gh CLI. Key file: GITHUB_KB.md at the root of the KB directory catalogs all projects with brief descriptions.\n\n## Configuration\n\nSet environment variables before use:\n- `GITHUB_TOKEN` - GitHub Personal Access Token (optional, for private repos)\n- `GITHUB_KB_PATH` - Path to local KB directory (default: `/home/node/clawd/github-kb`)\n\nExample:\n```bash\nexport GITHUB_TOKEN=\"ghp_xxxx...\"\nexport GITHUB_KB_PATH=\"/your/path/github-kb\"\n```\n\n**Token Privacy:** Never hardcode tokens. Inject via environment variables or container secrets.\n\n## GitHub CLI (gh)\n\n**Requirement:** GitHub CLI must be installed and authenticated.\n\n**Installation:**\n- **macOS:** `brew install gh`\n- **Linux:** `apt install gh` or see [official install guide](https://github.com/cli/cli/blob/trunk/docs/install_linux.md)\n- **Windows:** `winget install GitHub.cli`\n\n**Authentication:**\n```bash\n# Interactive login\ngh auth login\n\n# Or use token from GITHUB_TOKEN env var\ngh auth login --with-token <(echo \"$GITHUB_TOKEN\")\n```\n\n**Verify:** `gh auth status`\n\nIf `gh` is not installed or not authenticated, skip search operations and use only local KB features.\n\n### Searching Repos\n\n```bash\n# Search repos by keyword\ngh search repos <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search repos \"typescript cli\" --limit 10\ngh search repos \"language:python stars:>1000\" --limit 20\ngh search repos \"topic:mcp\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by programming language\n- `stars:<n>` or `stars:><n>` - Filter by star count\n- `topic:<name>` - Filter by topic\n- `user:<owner>` - Search within a user''s repos\n- `org:<org>` - Search within an organization\n\n### Searching Issues\n\n```bash\ngh search issues \"react hooks bug\" --limit 20\ngh search issues \"repo:facebook/react state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search issues \"language:typescript label:bug\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed` - Filter by issue state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `comments:<n>` or `comments:><n>` - Filter by comment count\n\n### Searching Pull Requests\n\n```bash\n# Search PRs\ngh search prs <query> [--limit <n>]\n\n# Examples:\ngh search prs \"repo:vercel/next.js state:open\" --limit 30\ngh search prs \"language:go is:merged\" --limit 15\n```\n\n**Search qualifiers:**\n- `repo:<owner/repo>` - Search in specific repository\n- `state:open|closed|merged` - Filter by PR state\n- `author:<username>` - Filter by author\n- `label:<name>` - Filter by label\n- `language:<lang>` - Filter by repo language\n- `is:merged|unmerged` - Filter by merge status\n\n### Viewing PR/Issue Details\n\n```bash\n# View issue/PR details\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo>\n\n# View with comments\ngh issue view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\ngh pr view <number> --repo <owner/repo> --comments\n```\n\n## Local Knowledge Base Workflow\n\n### Querying About a Repo in KB\n\n1. Read GITHUB_KB.md to understand what projects exist\n2. Locate the project directory under ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/\n\n### Cloning a New Repo to KB\n\n1. Search GitHub if the full repo name is not known\n2. Clone to KB directory:\n   ```bash\n   git clone https://github.com/<owner>/<name>.git ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/<name>\n   ```\n3. Generate project description: Read README or key files to understand the project\n4. Update GITHUB_KB.md: Add entry for the new repo following the existing format:\n   ```markdown\n   ### [<name>](/<name>)\n   Brief one-line description of what the project does. Additional context if useful (key features, tech stack, etc.).\n   ```\n5. Confirm completion: Tell user the repo was cloned and where to find it\n\n### Default Clone Location\n\nIf user says \"clone X\" without specifying a directory, default to ${GITHUB_KB_PATH:-/home/node/clawd/github-kb}/.\n\n## GITHUB_KB.md Format\n\nThe catalog file follows this structure:\n\n```markdown\n# GitHub Knowledge Base\n\nThis directory contains X GitHub projects covering various domains.\n\n---\n\n## Category Name\n\n### [project-name](/project-name)\nBrief description of the project.\n```\n\nMaintain categorization and consistent formatting when updating.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:22:52.645Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless GitHub repository management and search functionality via the gh CLI.","zh":"适用于需要无缝管理 GitHub 仓库和通过 gh CLI 进行搜索的开发代理。","ja":"GitHub リポジトリの管理と、gh CLI 経由での検索機能を必要とする開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"gh CLI를 통해 GitHub 리포지토리 관리 및 검색 기능을无缝으로 필요로 하는 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren una gestión de repositorios de GitHub sin problemas y funcionalidad de búsqueda a través de la CLI de gh.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une gestion de référentiels GitHub transparente et une fonctionnalité de recherche via la CLI gh.","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine nahtlose GitHub-Repository-Verwaltung und Suchfunktion über die gh-CLI erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que requerem gerenciamento de repositórios do GitHub e funcionalidade de busca sem interrupções via o CLI gh.","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих бесшовного управления репозиториями GitHub и функциональности поиска через CLI gh.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تطوير الوكلاء التي تتطلب إدارة مستودعات GitHub وتوفر وظائف البحث عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر gh."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage a local GitHub knowledge base, providing advanced search capabilities and cataloging projects with brief descriptions using the GITHUB_KB.md file, all while leveraging environment variables like GITHUB_TOKEN for private repository access and GITHUB_KB_PATH for customizable directory paths.","zh":"赋予代理管理本地 GitHub 知识库的能力，提供高级搜索功能，并使用 GITHUB_KB.md 文件对项目进行编目和简要描述，同时利用环境变量，如 GITHUB_TOKEN 进行私有仓库访问和 GITHUB_KB_PATH 进行自定义目录路径。","ja":"エージェントがローカルの GitHub ナレッジベースを管理できるようにし、高度な検索機能を提供し、GITHUB_KB.md ファイルを使用してプロジェクトをカタログ化し、簡単な説明を付けることができます。さらに、GITHUB_TOKEN などの環境変数を利用して、プライベート リポジトリへのアクセスや GITHUB_KB_PATH によるカスタム ディレクトリ パスを実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 로컬 GitHub 지식베이스를 관리할 수 있도록 하며, 고급 검색 기능을 제공하고, GITHUB_KB.md 파일을 사용하여 프로젝트를 카탈로그화하고 간단한 설명을 추가할 수 있습니다. 또한 GITHUB_TOKEN과 같은 환경 변수를 활용하여, 프라이빗 리포지토리에 대한 액세스와 GITHUB_KB_PATH를 통한 사용자 지정 디렉토리 경로를 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar una base de conocimientos local de GitHub, proporcionando capacidades de búsqueda avanzadas y catalogando proyectos con descripciones breves utilizando el archivo GITHUB_KB.md, todo mientras aprovecha las variables de entorno como GITHUB_TOKEN para el acceso a repositorios privados y GITHUB_KB_PATH para rutas de directorios personalizables.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer une base de connaissances GitHub locale, offrant des capacités de recherche avancées et cataloguant des projets avec des descriptions brèves à l''aide du fichier GITHUB_KB.md, le tout en exploitant des variables d''environnement comme GITHUB_TOKEN pour l''accès aux référentiels privés et GITHUB_KB_PATH pour des chemins de répertoires personnalisables.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine lokale GitHub-Wissensbasis zu verwalten, indem erweiterte Suchfunktionen bereitgestellt und Projekte mit kurzen Beschreibungen unter Verwendung der Datei GITHUB_KB.md katalogisiert werden, all dies unter Ausnutzung von Umgebungsvariablen wie GITHUB_TOKEN für den Zugriff auf private Repositorys und GITHUB_KB_PATH für anpassbare Verzeichnispfade.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar uma base de conhecimento local do GitHub, fornecendo capacidades de busca avançadas e catalogando projetos com descrições breves usando o arquivo GITHUB_KB.md, tudo isso aproveitando variáveis de ambiente como GITHUB_TOKEN para acesso a repositórios privados e GITHUB_KB_PATH para caminhos de diretórios personalizáveis.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять локальной базой знаний GitHub, предоставляя расширенные возможности поиска и каталогизацию проектов с краткими описаниями с помощью файла GITHUB_KB.md, все это при использовании переменных окружения, таких как GITHUB_TOKEN для доступа к приватным репозиториям и GITHUB_KB_PATH для настраиваемых путей каталогов.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إدارة قاعدة معرفة محلية لجت هاب، وتوفير إمكانيات بحث متقدمة وتصنيف المشاريع مع описات موجزة باستخدام ملف GITHUB_KB.md، وكل ذلك بالاستفادة من متغيرات البيئة مثل GITHUB_TOKEN للوصول إلى المستودعات الخاصة و GITHUB_KB_PATH لمسارات الدلائل القابلة للتعديل."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating GitHub repository searches","Cataloging projects with brief descriptions in GITHUB_KB.md","Managing private repositories with GITHUB_TOKEN"],"zh":["自动化 GitHub 仓库搜索","在 GITHUB_KB.md 中对项目进行编目和简要描述","使用 GITHUB_TOKEN 管理私有仓库"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリの検索を自動化する","GITHUB_KB.md でプロジェクトをカタログ化し、簡単な説明を付ける","GITHUB_TOKEN を使用してプライベート リポジトリを管理する"],"ko":["GitHub 리포지토리 검색 자동화","GITHUB_KB.md에서 프로젝트를 카탈로그화하고, 간단한 설명 추가","GITHUB_TOKEN을 사용하여 프라이빗 리포지토리 관리"],"es":["Automatizar búsquedas de repositorios de GitHub","Catalogar proyectos con descripciones breves en GITHUB_KB.md","Gestionar repositorios privados con GITHUB_TOKEN"],"fr":["Automatiser les recherches de référentiels GitHub","Cataloguer des projets avec des descriptions brèves dans GITHUB_KB.md","Gérer des référentiels privés avec GITHUB_TOKEN"],"de":["Automatisierung von GitHub-Repository-Suchen","Katalogisierung von Projekten mit kurzen Beschreibungen in GITHUB_KB.md","Verwaltung von privaten Repositorys mit GITHUB_TOKEN"],"pt":["Automatizar buscas de repositórios do GitHub","Catalogar projetos com descrições breves no arquivo GITHUB_KB.md","Gerenciar repositórios privados com GITHUB_TOKEN"],"ru":["Автоматизация поиска репозиториев GitHub","Каталогизация проектов с краткими описаниями в файле GITHUB_KB.md","Управление приватными репозиториями с помощью GITHUB_TOKEN"],"ar":["أتمتة عمليات البحث في مستودعات جت هاب","تصنيف المشاريع مع описات موجزة في ملف GITHUB_KB.md","إدارة المستودعات الخاصة باستخدام GITHUB_TOKEN"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub Personal Access Token for private repos","Needs environment variables GITHUB_TOKEN and GITHUB_KB_PATH set","Dependent on gh CLI for GitHub interactions"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 个人访问令牌来访问私有仓库","需要设置 GITHUB_TOKEN 和 GITHUB_KB_PATH 环境变量","依赖于 gh CLI 进行 GitHub 交互"],"ja":["プライベート リポジトリへのアクセスには GitHub パーソナル アクセス トークンが必要","GITHUB_TOKEN と GITHUB_KB_PATH の環境変数を設定する必要がある","GitHub とのやり取りには gh CLI への依存がある"],"ko":["프라이빗 리포지토리에 대한 액세스에는 GitHub 개인 액세스 토큰이 필요","GITHUB_TOKEN 및 GITHUB_KB_PATH 환경 변수를 설정해야 함","GitHub와의 상호 작용은 gh CLI에 의존"],"es":["Requiere GitHub Token de acceso personal para repositorios privados","Necesita variables de entorno GITHUB_TOKEN y GITHUB_KB_PATH establecidas","Dependiente de la CLI de gh para interacciones con GitHub"],"fr":["Nécessite un jeton d''accès personnel GitHub pour les référentiels privés","Nécessite les variables d''environnement GITHUB_TOKEN et GITHUB_KB_PATH définies","Dépend de la CLI gh pour les interactions avec GitHub"],"de":["Erfordert GitHub-Personal Access Token für private Repositorys","Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen GITHUB_TOKEN und GITHUB_KB_PATH","Abhängig von der gh-CLI für GitHub-Interaktionen"],"pt":["Exige Token de Acesso Pessoal do GitHub para repositórios privados","Necessita de variáveis de ambiente GITHUB_TOKEN e GITHUB_KB_PATH definidas","Depende do CLI gh para interações com o GitHub"],"ru":["Требует личного токена доступа GitHub для приватных репозиториев","Требует настроенных переменных окружения GITHUB_TOKEN и GITHUB_KB_PATH","Зависит от CLI gh для взаимодействия с GitHub"],"ar":["يتطلب رمز الوصول الشخصي لجت هاب للمستودعات الخاصة","يحتاج إلى تعريف متغيرات البيئة GITHUB_TOKEN و GITHUB_KB_PATH","يعتمد على واجهة سطر الأوامر gh للتفاعل مع جت هاب"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8d62830e2d00b0b63fe36620febd451b583dbcfad38acf354a1d77942401e303","qualityScore":55}');
