ndos","fr":"Ce guide couvre les opérations essentielles de traitement de PDF à l''aide de bibliothèques Python et d''outils de ligne de commande","de":"Diese Anleitung deckt grundlegende PDF-Verarbeitungsvorgänge mit Python-Bibliotheken und Kommandozeilen-Tools ab","pt":"Este guia aborda operações essenciais de processamento de PDF usando bibliotecas Python e ferramentas de linha de comando","ru":"Это руководство охватывает основные операции обработки PDF с помощью библиотек Python и командной строки","ar":"يهذا الدليل يتناول عمليات معالجة PDF الأساسية باستخدام مكتبات Python وأدوات سطر الأوامر","en":"OS for Agents: 130+ Agentic Skills, Gemini Protocols, and Autonomous Workflows. (Antigravity System)"},"definition":{"en":"OS for Agents: 130+ Agentic Skills, Gemini Protocols, and Autonomous Workflows. (Antigravity System)"},"features":{"zh":["PDF ","Python "," ","JS "," "," "],"ja":["PDF ","Python "," ","JS "," "," "],"ko":["PDF ","Python "," ","JS "," "," "],"es":["Lectura y escritura de archivos PDF","Extracción de texto de archivos PDF","Llenado de formularios PDF","Uso de bibliotecas de Python como pypdf","Uso de herramientas de línea de comandos para el procesamiento de PDF"],"fr":["Lecture et écriture de fichiers PDF","Extraction de texte de fichiers PDF","Remplissage de formulaires PDF","Utilisation de bibliothèques Python comme pypdf","Utilisation d''outils de ligne de commande pour le traitement de PDF"],"de":["Lesen und Schreiben von PDF-Dateien","Extraktion von Text aus PDF-Dateien","Ausfüllen von PDF-Formularen","Verwendung von Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf","Verwendung von Kommandozeilen-Tools für die PDF-Verarbeitung"],"pt":["Leitura de arquivos PDF","Extração de texto de arquivos PDF","Preenchimento de formulários PDF","Uso de bibliotecas Python para processamento de PDF","Uso de ferramentas de linha de comando para processamento de PDF"],"ru":["Чтение файлов PDF","Извлечение текста из файлов PDF","Заполнение форм PDF","Использование библиотек Python для обработки PDF","Использование командной строки для обработки PDF"],"ar":["قراءة ملفات PDF","استخراج النص من ملفات PDF","ملء استمارات PDF","استخدام مكتبات Python لمعالجة PDF","استخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر لمعالجة PDF"]},"keywords":{"zh":["PDF ","PDF Python","PDF ","PDF JS","PDF ","PDF "],"ja":["PDF ","PDF Python","PDF ","PDF JS","PDF ","PDF "],"ko":["PDF ","PDF Python","PDF ","PDF JS","PDF ","PDF "],"es":["procesamiento de pdf","python pdf","lector de pdf","extractor de texto pdf","formularios pdf","pypdf","herramientas de línea de comandos para pdf"],"fr":["traitement de pdf","python pdf","lecteur de pdf","extracteur de texte pdf","formulaires pdf","pypdf","outils de ligne de commande pour pdf"],"de":["pdf-verarbeitung","python pdf","pdf-leser","text-extraktor pdf","pdf-formulare","pypdf","kommandozeilen-tools für pdf"],"pt":["processamento de pdf","bibliotecas python pdf","ferramentas de linha de comando pdf","extração de texto pdf","preenchimento de formulários pdf","desenvolvimento de pdf","manipulação de pdf"],"ru":["обработка pdf","библиотеки python pdf","командная строка pdf","извлечение текста pdf","zapолнение форм pdf","разработка pdf","манипуляция с pdf"],"ar":["معالجة pdf","مكتبات python pdf","أدوات سطر الأوامر pdf","استخراج النص pdf","ملء استمارات pdf","تطوير pdf","التعامل مع pdf"]}},"owner":"vuralserhat86","repo":"antigravity-agentic-skills","repoPath":"vuralserhat86/antigravity-agentic-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.574Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pdf","description":"Comprehensive PDF manipulation toolkit for extracting text and tables, creating new PDFs, merging/splitting documents, and handling forms. When Claude needs to fill in a PDF form or programmatically process, generate, or analyze PDF documents at scale.","tags":["big data","cleaning","csv","data analysis","data engineering","data science","database","document","etl pipelines","export","generation","import","json","layout","machine learning basics","migration","nosql","numpy","pandas","parsing","pdf","python data stack","query optimization","report","reporting","schema design","sql","statistics","transformation","visualization"],"bodyPreview":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.","body":"# PDF Processing Guide\n\n## Overview\n\nThis guide covers essential PDF processing operations using Python libraries and command-line tools. For advanced features, JavaScript libraries, and detailed examples, see reference.md. If you need to fill out a PDF form, read forms.md and follow its instructions.\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Read a PDF\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nprint(f\"Pages: {len(reader.pages)}\")\n\n# Extract text\ntext = \"\"\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    text += page.extract_text()\n```\n\n## Python Libraries\n\n### pypdf - Basic Operations\n\n#### Merge PDFs\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfWriter, PdfReader\n\nwriter = PdfWriter()\nfor pdf_file in [\"doc1.pdf\", \"doc2.pdf\", \"doc3.pdf\"]:\n    reader = PdfReader(pdf_file)\n    for page in reader.pages:\n        writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"merged.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Split PDF\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nfor i, page in enumerate(reader.pages):\n    writer = PdfWriter()\n    writer.add_page(page)\n    with open(f\"page_{i+1}.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n        writer.write(output)\n```\n\n#### Extract Metadata\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nmeta = reader.metadata\nprint(f\"Title: {meta.title}\")\nprint(f\"Author: {meta.author}\")\nprint(f\"Subject: {meta.subject}\")\nprint(f\"Creator: {meta.creator}\")\n```\n\n#### Rotate Pages\n```python\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\npage = reader.pages[0]\npage.rotate(90)  # Rotate 90 degrees clockwise\nwriter.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"rotated.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### pdfplumber - Text and Table Extraction\n\n#### Extract Text with Layout\n```python\nimport pdfplumber\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        text = page.extract_text()\n        print(text)\n```\n\n#### Extract Tables\n```python\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    for i, page in enumerate(pdf.pages):\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for j, table in enumerate(tables):\n            print(f\"Table {j+1} on page {i+1}:\")\n            for row in table:\n                print(row)\n```\n\n#### Advanced Table Extraction\n```python\nimport pandas as pd\n\nwith pdfplumber.open(\"document.pdf\") as pdf:\n    all_tables = []\n    for page in pdf.pages:\n        tables = page.extract_tables()\n        for table in tables:\n            if table:  # Check if table is not empty\n                df = pd.DataFrame(table[1:], columns=table[0])\n                all_tables.append(df)\n\n# Combine all tables\nif all_tables:\n    combined_df = pd.concat(all_tables, ignore_index=True)\n    combined_df.to_excel(\"extracted_tables.xlsx\", index=False)\n```\n\n### reportlab - Create PDFs\n\n#### Basic PDF Creation\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.pdfgen import canvas\n\nc = canvas.Canvas(\"hello.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nwidth, height = letter\n\n# Add text\nc.drawString(100, height - 100, \"Hello World!\")\nc.drawString(100, height - 120, \"This is a PDF created with reportlab\")\n\n# Add a line\nc.line(100, height - 140, 400, height - 140)\n\n# Save\nc.save()\n```\n\n#### Create PDF with Multiple Pages\n```python\nfrom reportlab.lib.pagesizes import letter\nfrom reportlab.platypus import SimpleDocTemplate, Paragraph, Spacer, PageBreak\nfrom reportlab.lib.styles import getSampleStyleSheet\n\ndoc = SimpleDocTemplate(\"report.pdf\", pagesize=letter)\nstyles = getSampleStyleSheet()\nstory = []\n\n# Add content\ntitle = Paragraph(\"Report Title\", styles[''Title''])\nstory.append(title)\nstory.append(Spacer(1, 12))\n\nbody = Paragraph(\"This is the body of the report. \" * 20, styles[''Normal''])\nstory.append(body)\nstory.append(PageBreak())\n\n# Page 2\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Page 2\", styles[''Heading1'']))\nstory.append(Paragraph(\"Content for page 2\", styles[''Normal'']))\n\n# Build PDF\ndoc.build(story)\n```\n\n## Command-Line Tools\n\n### pdftotext (poppler-utils)\n```bash\n# Extract text\npdftotext input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract text preserving layout\npdftotext -layout input.pdf output.txt\n\n# Extract specific pages\npdftotext -f 1 -l 5 input.pdf output.txt  # Pages 1-5\n```\n\n### qpdf\n```bash\n# Merge PDFs\nqpdf --empty --pages file1.pdf file2.pdf -- merged.pdf\n\n# Split pages\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 1-5 -- pages1-5.pdf\nqpdf input.pdf --pages . 6-10 -- pages6-10.pdf\n\n# Rotate pages\nqpdf input.pdf output.pdf --rotate=+90:1  # Rotate page 1 by 90 degrees\n\n# Remove password\nqpdf --password=mypassword --decrypt encrypted.pdf decrypted.pdf\n```\n\n### pdftk (if available)\n```bash\n# Merge\npdftk file1.pdf file2.pdf cat output merged.pdf\n\n# Split\npdftk input.pdf burst\n\n# Rotate\npdftk input.pdf rotate 1east output rotated.pdf\n```\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Extract Text from Scanned PDFs\n```python\n# Requires: pip install pytesseract pdf2image\nimport pytesseract\nfrom pdf2image import convert_from_path\n\n# Convert PDF to images\nimages = convert_from_path(''scanned.pdf'')\n\n# OCR each page\ntext = \"\"\nfor i, image in enumerate(images):\n    text += f\"Page {i+1}:\\n\"\n    text += pytesseract.image_to_string(image)\n    text += \"\\n\\n\"\n\nprint(text)\n```\n\n### Add Watermark\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\n# Create watermark (or load existing)\nwatermark = PdfReader(\"watermark.pdf\").pages[0]\n\n# Apply to all pages\nreader = PdfReader(\"document.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    page.merge_page(watermark)\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\nwith open(\"watermarked.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n### Extract Images\n```bash\n# Using pdfimages (poppler-utils)\npdfimages -j input.pdf output_prefix\n\n# This extracts all images as output_prefix-000.jpg, output_prefix-001.jpg, etc.\n```\n\n### Password Protection\n```python\nfrom pypdf import PdfReader, PdfWriter\n\nreader = PdfReader(\"input.pdf\")\nwriter = PdfWriter()\n\nfor page in reader.pages:\n    writer.add_page(page)\n\n# Add password\nwriter.encrypt(\"userpassword\", \"ownerpassword\")\n\nwith open(\"encrypted.pdf\", \"wb\") as output:\n    writer.write(output)\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Best Tool | Command/Code |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| Merge PDFs | pypdf | `writer.add_page(page)` |\n| Split PDFs | pypdf | One page per file |\n| Extract text | pdfplumber | `page.extract_text()` |\n| Extract tables | pdfplumber | `page.extract_tables()` |\n| Create PDFs | reportlab | Canvas or Platypus |\n| Command line merge | qpdf | `qpdf --empty --pages ...` |\n| OCR scanned PDFs | pytesseract | Convert to image first |\n| Fill PDF forms | pdf-lib or pypdf (see forms.md) | See forms.md |\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- For advanced pypdfium2 usage, see reference.md\n- For JavaScript libraries (pdf-lib), see reference.md\n- If you need to fill out a PDF form, follow the instructions in forms.md\n- *PDF Processing v1.1 - Enhanced*\n\n## 🔄 Workflow\n\n> **Kaynak:** [pypdf Documentation](https://pypdf.readthedocs.io/en/stable/) & [pdfplumber Guide](https://github.com/jsvine/pdfplumber)\n\n### Aşama 1: Analysis & Selection\n- [ ] **Library Choice**: Metin çıkarma için `pdfplumber`, manipülasyon (merge/split) için `pypdf`, oluşturma için `reportlab` seç.\n- [ ] **Encryption Check**: Dosya şifreli mi? `reader.is_encrypted` kontrolü yap.\n- [ ] **Layout Inspection**: PDF \"text-based\" mi yoksa \"image-based\" (scanned) mi? OCR gerekebilir mi?\n\n### Aşama 2: Processing\n- [ ] **Extraction**: Metni sayfa sayfa (lazy loading) işle, belleği şişirme.\n- [ ] **Table Handling**: Tablo çıkarımı için `extract_tables()` kullan ve pandas DataFrame''e dönüştür.\n- [ ] **Transformation**: Sayfa döndürme veya birleştirme işlemlerini `PdfWriter` objesi üzerinde bellekte yap.\n\n### Aşama 3: Validation & Output\n- [ ] **Integrity**: Oluşturulan PDF bozuk mu? (Basit bir `PdfReader(output)` testi yap).\n- [ ] **Metadata**: Yazar, Konu gibi metadata bilgilerini temizle veya güncelle.\n- [ ] **Access**: Hassas veriler içeren PDF''leri şifrele (`encrypt`).\n\n### Kontrol Noktaları\n| Aşama | Doğrulama |\n|-------|-----------|\n| 1 | OCR gerekiyorsa `tesseract` yüklü mü? |\n| 2 | Tablo çıkarımında sütun kaymaları (misalignment) var mı? |\n| 3 | Büyük dosyalarda (100MB+) memory leak oluşuyor mu? |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:34:09.776Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Document Analysis Agents needing advanced PDF processing capabilities with Python libraries like pypdf.","zh":"适合需要高级PDF处理能力的文档分析代理，尤其是那些使用pypdf等Python库的代理。","ja":"Pythonライブラリのpypdfなどの高度なPDF処理機能を必要とするドキュメント分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 PDF 처리 기능이 필요한 문서 분석 에이전트에게 적합하며, pypdf와 같은 Python 라이브러리를 사용하는 에이전트에게 특히 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Análisis de Documentos que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de PDF avanzadas con bibliotecas de Python como pypdf.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de documents nécessitant des fonctionnalités de traitement de PDF avancées avec des bibliothèques Python comme pypdf.","de":"Perfekt für Dokumentenanalyse-Agenten, die erweiterte PDF-Verarbeitungsfunktionen mit Python-Bibliotheken wie pypdf benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Documentos que precisam de capacidades avançadas de processamento de PDF com bibliotecas Python como pypdf.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Документов, которым необходимы расширенные возможности обработки PDF с помощью библиотек Python, таких как pypdf.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل المستندات الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لمعالجة PDF باستخدام مكتبات بايثون مثل pypdf."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to extract text from PDFs, read PDF pages, and utilize command-line tools for advanced features, leveraging Python libraries for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理从PDF中提取文本、读取PDF页面以及利用命令行工具进行高级功能的能力，同时利用Python库实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントにPDFからテキストを抽出、PDFページを読み取り、コマンドラインツールを使用して高度な機能を利用する機能を提供し、Pythonライブラリを使用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트에게 PDF에서 텍스트를 추출하고, PDF 페이지를 읽고, 명령줄 도구를 사용하여 고급 기능을 활용할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, Python 라이브러리를 사용하여 부드러운 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a extraer texto de los PDF, leer páginas de PDF y utilizar herramientas de línea de comandos para funciones avanzadas, aprovechando las bibliotecas de Python para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''extraire du texte à partir de PDF, de lire des pages de PDF et d''utiliser des outils de ligne de commande pour des fonctionnalités avancées, en exploitant les bibliothèques Python pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Text aus PDFs zu extrahieren, PDF-Seiten zu lesen und Befehlszeilentools für erweiterte Funktionen zu nutzen, indem Python-Bibliotheken für eine nahtlose Integration genutzt werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a extrair texto de PDFs, ler estruturas de página de PDF e utilizar ferramentas de linha de comando para recursos avançados, aproveitando bibliotecas Python para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью извлекать текст из PDF, читать структуры страниц PDF и использовать инструменты командной строки для расширенных функций, используя библиотеки Python для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على استخراج النص من ملفات PDF ، وقراءة هيكل صفحات PDF ، واستخدام أدوات سطر الأوامر للميزات المتقدمة ، واستخدام مكتبات بايثون للتكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Extracting text from PDF documents","Reading and analyzing PDF page structures","Automating PDF form filling using JavaScript libraries"],"zh":["从PDF文档中提取文本","读取和分析PDF页面结构","使用JavaScript库自动填充PDF表单"],"ja":["PDFドキュメントからテキストを抽出","PDFページ構造を読み取り分析","JavaScriptライブラリを使用してPDFフォームを自動で埋める"],"ko":["PDF 문서에서 텍스트를 추출하기","PDF 페이지 구조를 읽고 분석하기","JavaScript 라이브러리를 사용하여 PDF 폼 자동 채우기"],"es":["Extraer texto de documentos PDF","Lectura y análisis de estructuras de páginas de PDF","Automatización del llenado de formularios de PDF utilizando bibliotecas de JavaScript"],"fr":["Extraction de texte à partir de documents PDF","Lecture et analyse de structures de pages de PDF","Automatisation du remplissage de formulaires de PDF à l''aide de bibliothèques JavaScript"],"de":["Extrahieren von Text aus PDF-Dokumenten","Lesen und Analysieren von PDF-Seitenstrukturen","Automatisierung des Ausfüllens von PDF-Formularen unter Verwendung von JavaScript-Bibliotheken"],"pt":["Extrair texto de documentos PDF","Ler e analisar estruturas de página de PDF","Automatizar preenchimento de formulários PDF usando bibliotecas JavaScript"],"ru":["Извлечение текста из документов PDF","Чтение и анализ структур страниц PDF","Автоматизация заполнения форм PDF с помощью библиотек JavaScript"],"ar":["استخراج النص من مستندات PDF","قراءة وتحليل هيكل صفحات PDF","التحكم الآلي في ملء استمارات PDF باستخدام مكتبات جافا سكريبت"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Python environment","Limited to PDF file format","Advanced features require reference to external documentation like reference.md and forms.md"],"zh":["需要Python环境","仅限PDF文件格式","高级功能需要参考外部文档，如reference.md和forms.md"],"ja":["Python環境が必要","PDFファイル形式のみ対応","高度な機能を使用するには、reference.mdやforms.mdなどの外部ドキュメントを参照する必要がある"],"ko":["Python 환경이 필요합니다.","PDF 파일 형식만 지원합니다.","고급 기능을 사용하려면 reference.md 및 forms.md와 같은 외부 문서를 참조해야 합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de Python","Limitado al formato de archivo de PDF","Funciones avanzadas requieren referencia a la documentación externa como reference.md y forms.md"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Python","Limité au format de fichier PDF","Fonctions avancées nécessitent une référence à la documentation externe telle que reference.md et forms.md"],"de":["Benötigt Python-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf PDF-Dateiformat","Erweiterte Funktionen erfordern einen Verweis auf externe Dokumentation wie reference.md und forms.md"],"pt":["Requer ambiente Python","Limitado ao formato de arquivo PDF","Recursos avançados requerem referência à documentação externa como reference.md e forms.md"],"ru":["Требуется среда Python","Ограничен форматом файла PDF","Расширенные функции требуют ссылки на внешнюю документацию, такую как reference.md и forms.md"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة بايثون","محدود بتنسيق ملف PDF","الت đòiات المتقدمة تتطلب الإشارة إلى الوثائق الخارجية مثل reference.md و forms.md"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e90473fa135c34e3e4c6d24d439bffdaa4e59e78335050e0be47db1ae0e9ef08","qualityScore":55}');
