owered applications and agents "},"definition":{"en":"The AI Toolkit for TypeScript. From the creators of Next.js, the AI SDK is a free open-source library for building AI-powered applications and agents "},"features":{"zh":["提供 TypeScript 开发示例","支持 AI 驱动的应用和代理构建","免费开源","跨提供商的 AI SDK 函数验证和测试","非流式文本生成"],"ja":["TypeScript 開発例を提供","AI ドリブンのアプリケーションとエージェントの構築をサポート","無料のオープンソース","プロバイダー間の AI SDK 関数の検証とテスト","非ストリーミング テキスト生成"],"ko":["TypeScript 개발 예시 제공","AI 구동 애플리케이션과 에이전트 구축 지원","무료 오픈소스","제공자 간의 AI SDK 함수 검증 및 테스트","비스트림 텍스트 생성"],"es":["Ejemplos de funciones de IA para validar y probar","Generación de texto no en streaming con generateText()","Compatibilidad con múltiples proveedores de IA","Código abierto y gratuito","Integración con Next.js"],"fr":["Exemples de fonctions d''IA pour valider et tester","Génération de texte non en streaming avec generateText()","Compatibilité avec plusieurs fournisseurs d''IA","Code open source et gratuit","Intégration avec Next.js"],"de":["Beispiele für IA-Funktionen zur Überprüfung und zum Testen","Textgenerierung ohne Streaming mit generateText()","Kompatibilität mit mehreren IA-Anbietern","Open-Source-Code und kostenlos","Integration mit Next.js"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações e agentes com capacidades de IA","Uso de exemplos de funções de IA para validar e testar aplicações","Biblioteca de código aberto para TypeScript","Geração de texto não em streaming com generateText()","Organização de exemplos por categoria de função de IA"],"ru":["Разработка приложений и агентов с возможностями ИИ","Использование примеров функций ИИ для проверки и тестирования приложений","Открытая библиотека для TypeScript","Генерация текста не в потоке с generateText()","Организация примеров по категориям функций ИИ"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات والوكلاء ذوي قدرات الإي الأي","استخدام أمثلة الدوال الإي الأي لتحقق واختبار التطبيقات","مكتبة مفتوحة المصدر لغة TypeScript","توليد النص غير المتدفق مع generateText()","تنظيم الأمثلة حسب فئة الدوال الإي الأي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI Toolkit","TypeScript","AI 驱动的应用","AI 代理","开源库","免费开发库"],"ja":["AI Toolkit","TypeScript","AI ドリブンのアプリケーション","AI エージェント","オープンソース ライブラリ","無料開発ライブラリ"],"ko":["AI Toolkit","TypeScript","AI 구동 애플리케이션","AI 에이전트","오픈소스 라이브러리","무료 개발 라이브러리"],"es":["IA","AI Toolkit","TypeScript","desarrollo de aplicaciones","agentes con IA","generación de texto","Next.js"],"fr":["IA","AI Toolkit","TypeScript","développement d''applications","agents avec IA","génération de texte","Next.js"],"de":["IA","AI Toolkit","TypeScript","Anwendungsentwicklung","Agenten mit IA","Textgenerierung","Next.js"],"pt":["AI Toolkit","TypeScript","Desenvolvimento de IA","Funções de IA","Geração de texto","Aplicações de IA","Agentes de IA","Biblioteca de código aberto"],"ru":["AI Toolkit","TypeScript","Разработка ИИ","Функции ИИ","Генерация текста","Приложения ИИ","Агенты ИИ","Открытая библиотека"],"ar":["أداة AI Toolkit","TypeScript","تطوير الإي الأي","دوال الإي الأي","توليد النص","تطبيقات الإي الأي","وكلاء الإي الأي","مكتبة مفتوحة المصدر"]}},"owner":"vercel","repo":"ai","repoPath":"vercel/ai","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.576Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"develop-ai-functions-example","description":"Develop examples for AI SDK functions. Use when creating, running, or modifying examples under examples/ai-functions/src to validate provider support, demonstrate features, or create test fixtures.","bodyPreview":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stre","body":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stream-text/`     | Streaming text generation with `streamText()`        |\n| `generate-object/` | Structured output generation with `generateObject()` |\n| `stream-object/`   | Streaming structured output with `streamObject()`    |\n| `agent/`           | `ToolLoopAgent` examples for agentic workflows       |\n| `embed/`           | Single embedding generation with `embed()`           |\n| `embed-many/`      | Batch embedding generation with `embedMany()`        |\n| `generate-image/`  | Image generation with `generateImage()`              |\n| `generate-speech/` | Text-to-speech with `generateSpeech()`               |\n| `transcribe/`      | Audio transcription with `transcribe()`              |\n| `rerank/`          | Document reranking with `rerank()`                   |\n| `middleware/`      | Custom middleware implementations                    |\n| `registry/`        | Provider registry setup and usage                    |\n| `telemetry/`       | OpenTelemetry integration                            |\n| `complex/`         | Multi-component examples (agents, routers)           |\n| `lib/`             | Shared utilities (not examples)                      |\n| `tools/`           | Reusable tool definitions                            |\n\n## File Naming Convention\n\nExamples follow the pattern: `{provider}-{feature}.ts`\n\n| Pattern                                  | Example                                    | Description                |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `{provider}.ts`                          | `openai.ts`                                | Basic provider usage       |\n| `{provider}-{feature}.ts`                | `openai-tool-call.ts`                      | Specific feature           |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}.ts`           | `amazon-bedrock-anthropic.ts`              | Provider with sub-provider |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}-{feature}.ts` | `google-vertex-anthropic-cache-control.ts` | Sub-provider with feature  |\n\n## Example Structure\n\nAll examples use the `run()` wrapper from `lib/run.ts` which:\n\n- Loads environment variables from `.env`\n- Provides error handling with detailed API error logging\n\n### Basic Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateText } from ''ai'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    prompt: ''Your prompt here.'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(result.text);\n  console.log(''Token usage:'', result.usage);\n  console.log(''Finish reason:'', result.finishReason);\n});\n```\n\n### Streaming Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { streamText } from ''ai'';\nimport { printFullStream } from ''../lib/print-full-stream'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = streamText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    prompt: ''Your prompt here.'',\n  });\n\n  await printFullStream({ result });\n});\n```\n\n### Tool Calling Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateText, tool } from ''ai'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    tools: {\n      myTool: tool({\n        description: ''Tool description'',\n        inputSchema: z.object({\n          param: z.string().describe(''Parameter description''),\n        }),\n        execute: async ({ param }) => {\n          return { result: `Processed: ${param}` };\n        },\n      }),\n    },\n    prompt: ''Use the tool to...'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(result, null, 2));\n});\n```\n\n### Structured Output Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateObject } from ''ai'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateObject({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    schema: z.object({\n      name: z.string(),\n      items: z.array(z.string()),\n    }),\n    prompt: ''Generate a...'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(result.object, null, 2));\n  console.log(''Token usage:'', result.usage);\n});\n```\n\n## Running Examples\n\nFrom the `examples/ai-functions` directory:\n\n```bash\npnpm tsx src/generate-text/openai.ts\npnpm tsx src/stream-text/openai-tool-call.ts\npnpm tsx src/agent/openai-generate.ts\n```\n\n## When to Write Examples\n\nWrite examples when:\n\n1. **Adding a new provider**: Create basic examples for each supported API (`generateText`, `streamText`, `generateObject`, etc.)\n\n2. **Implementing a new feature**: Demonstrate the feature with at least one provider example\n\n3. **Reproducing a bug**: Create an example that shows the issue for debugging\n\n4. **Adding provider-specific options**: Show how to use `providerOptions` for provider-specific settings\n\n5. **Creating test fixtures**: Use examples to generate API response fixtures (see `capture-api-response-test-fixture` skill)\n\n## Utility Helpers\n\nThe `lib/` directory contains shared utilities:\n\n| File                   | Purpose                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `run.ts`               | Error-handling wrapper with `.env` loading               |\n| `print.ts`             | Clean object printing (removes undefined values)         |\n| `print-full-stream.ts` | Colored streaming output for tool calls, reasoning, text |\n| `save-raw-chunks.ts`   | Save streaming chunks for test fixtures                  |\n| `present-image.ts`     | Display images in terminal                               |\n| `save-audio.ts`        | Save audio files to disk                                 |\n\n### Using print utilities\n\n```typescript\nimport { print } from ''../lib/print'';\n\n// Pretty print objects without undefined values\nprint(''Result:'', result);\nprint(''Usage:'', result.usage, { depth: 2 });\n```\n\n### Using printFullStream\n\n```typescript\nimport { printFullStream } from ''../lib/print-full-stream'';\n\nconst result = streamText({ ... });\nawait printFullStream({ result }); // Colored output for text, tool calls, reasoning\n```\n\n## Reusable Tools\n\nThe `tools/` directory contains reusable tool definitions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { weatherTool } from ''../tools/weather-tool'';\n\nconst result = await generateText({\n  model: openai(''gpt-4o''),\n  tools: { weather: weatherTool },\n  prompt: ''What is the weather in San Francisco?'',\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep examples focused**: Each example should demonstrate one feature or use case\n\n2. **Use descriptive prompts**: Make it clear what the example is testing\n\n3. **Handle errors gracefully**: The `run()` wrapper handles this automatically\n\n4. **Use realistic model IDs**: Use actual model IDs that work with the provider\n\n5. **Add comments for complex logic**: Explain non-obvious code patterns\n\n6. **Reuse tools when appropriate**: Use `weatherTool` or create new reusable tools in `tools/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:42:59.873Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced AI-powered application development with TypeScript and Next.js","zh":"非常适合需要使用TypeScript和Next.js进行高级AI驱动应用开发的AI代理","ja":"TypeScriptとNext.jsを使用した高度なAI駆動アプリケーション開発を必要とするAIエージェントに最適","ko":"TypeScript와 Next.js를 사용한 고급 AI 구동 애플리케이션 개발이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 완벽함","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan desarrollo de aplicaciones avanzadas con TypeScript y Next.js","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA ayant besoin de développement d''applications avancées avec TypeScript et Next.js","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte KI-gesteuerte Anwendungsentwicklung mit TypeScript und Next.js benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que precisam de desenvolvimento de aplicativos avançados com TypeScript e Next.js","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходим разработка приложений на основе ИИ с помощью TypeScript и Next.js","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الويب التي تحتاج إلى تطوير تطبيقات متقدمة مدعومة بالذكاء الاصطناعي مع TypeScript و Next.js"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build AI-powered applications and agents with the AI SDK, utilizing libraries like the AI Toolkit for TypeScript, and generating text with `generateText()` across providers, supporting protocols like non-streaming text generation","zh":"赋予代理构建AI驱动应用和代理的能力，利用AI SDK，使用诸如TypeScript的AI工具包等库，并使用`generateText()`跨提供者生成文本，支持诸如非流式文本生成的协议","ja":"エージェントにAI SDKを使用してAI駆動アプリケーションやエージェントを構築する能力を与え、TypeScriptのAI_TOOLKITなどのライブラリを利用し、`generateText()`を使用してプロバイダー間でテキストを生成し、非ストリーミングテキスト生成などのプロトコルをサポート","ko":"에이전트가 AI SDK를 사용하여 AI 구동 애플리케이션 및 에이전트를 구축할 수 있는 기능을 부여하며, TypeScript의 AI 툴킷 등의 라이브러리를 활용하고, `generateText()`를 사용하여 공급자 간에 텍스트를 생성하며, 비스트림 텍스트 생성 등의 프로토콜을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a construir aplicaciones y agentes con tecnología de IA mediante el SDK de IA, utilizando bibliotecas como la herramienta de IA para TypeScript y generando texto con `generateText()` en varios proveedores, admitiendo protocolos como la generación de texto no en streaming","fr":"Permet aux agents de construire des applications et des agents alimentés par l''IA avec le SDK IA, en utilisant des bibliothèques comme l''outil de kit de développement de l''IA pour TypeScript et en générant du texte avec `generateText()` sur plusieurs fournisseurs, en prenant en charge des protocoles tels que la génération de texte non en streaming","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, KI-gesteuerte Anwendungen und Agents mit dem KI-SDK zu erstellen, indem Bibliotheken wie das KI-Toolkit für TypeScript verwendet und Text mit `generateText()` über Anbieter generiert werden, wobei Protokolle wie die nicht-streaming Textgenerierung unterstützt werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos e agentes baseados em IA com o SDK de IA, utilizando bibliotecas como o Kit de Ferramentas de IA para TypeScript e gerando texto com `generateText()` em vários provedores, suportando protocolos como geração de texto não em streaming","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать приложения и агентов на основе ИИ с помощью ИИ SDK, используя библиотеки like ИИ Toolkit для TypeScript и генерируя текст с `generateText()` по различным провайдерам, поддерживая протоколы, такие как нестримовая генерация текста","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من بناء التطبيقات والوكلاء التي تعمل بالذكاء الاصطناعي مع SDK الاصطناعي، واستخدام المكتبات مثل أداة تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي لنظام TypeScript، وتوليد النص مع `generateText()` عبر مختلف المزودين، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل توليد النص غير المتدفق"},"useCases":{"en":["Validating AI SDK functions across providers","Testing and iterating on AI-powered applications","Generating non-streaming text with `generateText()`","Building custom AI functions with the AI Toolkit"],"zh":["跨提供者验证AI SDK函数","测试和迭代AI驱动应用","使用`generateText()`生成非流式文本","使用AI工具包构建自定义AI函数"],"ja":["プロバイダー間でAI SDKの関数を検証する","AI駆動アプリケーションのテストとイテレーション","`generateText()`を使用して非ストリーミングテキストを生成する","AI_TOOLKITを使用してカスタムAI関数を構築する"],"ko":["공급자 간에 AI SDK 함수를 검증","AI 구동 애플리케이션 테스트 및 반복","`generateText()`를 사용하여 비스트림 텍스트 생성","AI 툴킷을 사용하여 사용자 정의 AI 함수 구축"],"es":["Validar funciones del SDK de IA en varios proveedores","Probar e iterar sobre aplicaciones con tecnología de IA","Generar texto no en streaming con `generateText()`","Crear funciones personalizadas de IA con la herramienta de kit de desarrollo de IA"],"fr":["Valider les fonctions du SDK IA sur plusieurs fournisseurs","Tester et itérer sur des applications alimentées par l''IA","Générer du texte non en streaming avec `generateText()`","Construire des fonctions personnalisées d''IA avec l''outil de kit de développement d''IA"],"de":["KI-SDK-Funktionen über Anbieter hinweg überprüfen","KI-gesteuerte Anwendungen testen und iterieren","Nicht-streaming-Text mit `generateText()` generieren","Benutzerdefinierte KI-Funktionen mit dem KI-Toolkit erstellen"],"pt":["Validar funções do SDK de IA em vários provedores","Testar e iterar em aplicativos baseados em IA","Gerar texto não em streaming com `generateText()`","Construir funções personalizadas de IA com o Kit de Ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Проверка функций ИИ SDK на различных провайдерах","Тестирование и итерация приложений на основе ИИ","Генерация нестримового текста с `generateText()`","Создание пользовательских функций ИИ с помощью ИИ Toolkit"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة وظائف SDK الاصطناعي عبر مختلف المزودين","اختبار وتكرار التطبيقات التي تعمل بالذكاء الاصطناعي","توليد نص غير متدفق مع `generateText()`","بناء دوال مخصصة للذكاء الاصطناعي مع أداة تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires TypeScript and Next.js setup","Limited to AI SDK functions and providers"],"zh":["需要TypeScript和Next.js设置","仅限AI SDK函数和提供者"],"ja":["TypeScriptとNext.jsの設定が必要","AI SDKの関数とプロバイダーに限定"],"ko":["TypeScript와 Next.js 설정이 필요","AI SDK 함수 및 공급자에 한정"],"es":["Requiere configuración de TypeScript y Next.js","Limitado a funciones y proveedores del SDK de IA"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de TypeScript et Next.js","Limité aux fonctions et fournisseurs du SDK IA"],"de":["Benötigt eine Konfiguration von TypeScript und Next.js","Begrenzt auf KI-SDK-Funktionen und Anbieter"],"pt":["Requer configuração do TypeScript e Next.js","Limitado a funções e provedores do SDK de IA"],"ru":["Требует настройки TypeScript и Next.js","Ограничен функциями и провайдерами ИИ SDK"],"ar":["يتطلب إعدادًا لنظام TypeScript و Next.js","محدود بالوظائف والمزودين ل SDK الاصطناعي"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9d77f7652e8edda503bb95db8032db3ce781904c4444ec22ecdc307e3ac7fc0d","qualityScore":55}');
