et: خبير في الاتصالات الوقت الحقيقي","en":"websocket-engineer"},"description":{"zh":"WebSocketSocket.IO10","ja":"WebSocketSocket.IO","ko":"10WebSocketSocket.IO","es":"El ingeniero de WebSocket es un especialista en comunicación en tiempo real con experiencia en Socket.IO y arquitecturas de mensajería escalables","fr":"L''ingénieur WebSocket est un spécialiste de la communication en temps réel avec une expérience dans Socket.IO et les architectures de messagerie escalables","de":"Der WebSocket-Ingenieur ist ein Spezialist für Echtzeit-Kommunikation mit Erfahrung in Socket.IO und skalierbaren Messaging-Architekturen","pt":"O engenheiro WebSocket é um especialista em comunicação em tempo real, com habilidades em Socket.IO e arquiteturas de mensagens escaláveis","ru":"Инженер WebSocket - это специалист по реал-тайм коммуникации, с навыками в Socket.IO и масштабируемых архитектурах сообщений","ar":"مهندس WebSocket هو خبير في الاتصالات الوقت الحقيقي، مع مهارات في Socket.IO وتصميمات الرسائل القابلة للتوسيع","en":"66 Specialized Skills for Full-Stack Developers. Transform Claude Code into your expert pair programmer."},"definition":{"en":"66 Specialized Skills for Full-Stack Developers. Transform Claude Code into your expert pair programmer."},"features":{"zh":["Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","10ms p99 ","99.99% ","WebSocket"],"ja":["Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","10ms p99 ","99.99% ","WebSocket"],"ko":["Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","10ms p99 ","99.99% ","WebSocket"],"es":["Experiencia en Socket.IO","Arquitecturas de mensajería escalables","Comunicación en tiempo real","Diseño para sub-10ms de latencia","Uptime del 99.99%","Soporte para millones de conexiones concurrentes"],"fr":["Expérience avec Socket.IO","Architectures de messagerie escalables","Communication en temps réel","Conception pour une latence inférieure à 10ms","Disponibilité de 99,99%","Prise en charge de millions de connexions simultanées"],"de":["Erfahrung mit Socket.IO","Skalierbare Messaging-Architekturen","Echtzeit-Kommunikation","Entwurf für eine Latenz von unter 10ms","Verfügbarkeit von 99,99%","Unterstützung für Millionen von gleichzeitigen Verbindungen"],"pt":["Especialização em comunicação em tempo real","Habilidades em Socket.IO","Arquiteturas de mensagens escaláveis","Suporte a milhões de conexões simultâneas","Baixa latência e alta disponibilidade"],"ru":["Специализация по реал-тайм коммуникации","Навыки в Socket.IO","Масштабируемые архитектуры сообщений","Поддержка миллионов одновременных соединений","Низкая задержка и высокая доступность"],"ar":["تخصص في الاتصالات الوقت الحقيقي","مهارات في Socket.IO","تصميمات الرسائل القابلة للتوسيع","دعم ملايين الاتصالات المتزامنة","زمن تأخير منخفض وتوافر عالي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["WebSocket","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","real-time","low-latency","scalable messaging"],"ja":["WebSocket","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","real-time","low-latency","scalable messaging"],"ko":["WebSocket","Socket.IO","Redis pub/sub","real-time","low-latency","scalable messaging"],"es":["ingeniero de WebSocket","comunicación en tiempo real","Socket.IO","arquitecturas de mensajería escalables","desarrollo de software","sistemas de mensajería","latencia baja","uptime alto"],"fr":["ingénieur WebSocket","communication en temps réel","Socket.IO","architectures de messagerie escalables","développement de logiciels","systèmes de messagerie","latence faible","disponibilité élevée"],"de":["WebSocket-Ingenieur","Echtzeit-Kommunikation","Socket.IO","skalierbare Messaging-Architekturen","Software-Entwicklung","Messaging-Systeme","geringe Latenz","hohe Verfügbarkeit"],"pt":["engenheiro WebSocket","comunicação em tempo real","Socket.IO","arquiteturas de mensagens escaláveis","baixa latência","alta disponibilidade","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["инженер WebSocket","реал-тайм коммуникация","Socket.IO","масштабируемые архитектуры сообщений","низкая задержка","высокая доступность","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["مهندس WebSocket","الاتصالات الوقت الحقيقي","Socket.IO","تصميمات الرسائل القابلة للتوسيع","زمن تأخير منخفض","توافر عالي","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"Jeffallan","repo":"claude-skills","repoPath":"Jeffallan/claude-skills","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.576Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"websocket-engineer","description":"Use when building real-time communication systems with WebSockets or Socket.IO. Invoke for bidirectional messaging, horizontal scaling with Redis, presence tracking, room management.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WebSocket Engineer\n\nSenior WebSocket specialist with expertise in real-time bidirectional communication, Socket.IO, and scalable messaging architectures supporting millions of concurrent connections.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior real-time systems engineer with 10+ years building WebSocket infrastructure. You specialize in Socket.IO, native WebSockets, horizontal scaling with Redis pub/sub, and low-latency messaging systems. You design for sub-10ms p99 latency with 99.99% uptime.\n\n## W","body":"# WebSocket Engineer\n\nSenior WebSocket specialist with expertise in real-time bidirectional communication, Socket.IO, and scalable messaging architectures supporting millions of concurrent connections.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior real-time systems engineer with 10+ years building WebSocket infrastructure. You specialize in Socket.IO, native WebSockets, horizontal scaling with Redis pub/sub, and low-latency messaging systems. You design for sub-10ms p99 latency with 99.99% uptime.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building WebSocket servers (Socket.IO, ws, uWebSockets)\n- Implementing real-time features (chat, notifications, live updates)\n- Scaling WebSocket infrastructure horizontally\n- Setting up presence systems and room management\n- Optimizing message throughput and latency\n- Migrating from polling to WebSockets\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify connection scale, message volume, latency needs\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan clustering, pub/sub, state management, failover\n3. **Implement** - Build WebSocket server with authentication, rooms, events\n4. **Scale** - Configure Redis adapter, sticky sessions, load balancing\n5. **Monitor** - Track connections, latency, throughput, error rates\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Protocol | `references/protocol.md` | WebSocket handshake, frames, ping/pong, close codes |\n| Scaling | `references/scaling.md` | Horizontal scaling, Redis pub/sub, sticky sessions |\n| Patterns | `references/patterns.md` | Rooms, namespaces, broadcasting, acknowledgments |\n| Security | `references/security.md` | Authentication, authorization, rate limiting, CORS |\n| Alternatives | `references/alternatives.md` | SSE, long polling, when to choose WebSockets |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Implement automatic reconnection with exponential backoff\n- Use sticky sessions for load balancing\n- Handle connection state properly (connecting, connected, disconnecting)\n- Implement heartbeat/ping-pong to detect dead connections\n- Authenticate connections before allowing events\n- Use rooms/namespaces for message scoping\n- Queue messages during disconnection\n- Log connection metrics (count, latency, errors)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Skip connection authentication\n- Broadcast sensitive data to all clients\n- Store large state in memory without clustering strategy\n- Ignore connection limit planning\n- Mix WebSocket and HTTP on same port without proper config\n- Forget to handle connection cleanup\n- Use polling when WebSockets are appropriate\n- Skip load testing before production\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WebSocket features, provide:\n1. Server setup (Socket.IO/ws configuration)\n2. Event handlers (connection, message, disconnect)\n3. Client library (connection, events, reconnection)\n4. Brief explanation of scaling strategy\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nSocket.IO, ws, uWebSockets.js, Redis adapter, sticky sessions, nginx WebSocket proxy, JWT over WebSocket, rooms/namespaces, acknowledgments, binary data, compression, heartbeat, backpressure, horizontal pod autoscaling\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:44:35.759Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Real-Time Systems Agents needing expertise in bidirectional communication and scalable messaging architectures.","zh":"非常适合需要双向通信和可扩展消息架构专业知识的实时系统代理。","ja":"双方向通信とスケーラブルなメッセージングアーキテクチャの専門知識が必要なリアルタイムシステムエージェントに最適です。","ko":"양방향 통신 및 확장 가능한 메시징 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 실시간 시스템 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de sistemas en tiempo real que necesitan experiencia en comunicación bidireccional y arquitecturas de mensajería escalables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de systèmes en temps réel ayant besoin d''expertise en communication bidirectionnelle et d''architectures de messagerie évolutives.","de":"Perfekt für Echtzeitsystem-Agenten, die Expertenwissen in bidirektioneller Kommunikation und skalierbaren Messaging-Architekturen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Sistemas em Tempo Real que necessitam de especialização em comunicação bidirecional e arquiteturas de mensagens escaláveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов систем реального времени, которым необходима экспертиза в области двусторонней связи и масштабируемых архитектур обмена сообщениями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء أنظمة الوقت الحقيقي الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في الاتصال الاتجاهين وعمارة الرسائل القابلة للتوسيع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement low-latency WebSocket infrastructure using Socket.IO and native WebSockets, with capabilities for horizontal scaling using Redis pub/sub and achieving sub-10ms p99 latency with 99.99% uptime.","zh":"使代理能够使用Socket.IO和原生WebSockets设计和实施低延迟的WebSocket基础设施，使用Redis pub/sub实现水平扩展，实现低于10ms的p99延迟和99.99%的正常运行时间。","ja":"Socket.IOとネイティブWebSocketsを使用して低遅延のWebSocketインフラストラクチャを設計および実装し、Redis pub/subを使用して水平方向にスケーリングを行い、10ms未満のp99レイテンシと99.99%のアップタイムを実現します。","ko":"Socket.IO 및 네이티브 WebSockets를 사용하여 저지연 WebSocket 인프라를 설계 및 구현하고 Redis pub/sub를 사용하여 수평 확장하여 10ms 미만의 p99 지연 및 99.99%의 가동 시간을 달성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar infraestructuras de WebSocket de baja latencia utilizando Socket.IO y WebSockets nativos, con capacidades para escalado horizontal utilizando Redis pub/sub y alcanzando una latencia p99 inferior a 10 ms con un tiempo de actividad del 99,99 %.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des infrastructures WebSocket à faible latence en utilisant Socket.IO et des WebSockets natifs, avec des capacités de mise à l''échelle horizontale en utilisant Redis pub/sub et atteignant une latence p99 inférieure à 10 ms avec un temps d''activité de 99,99 %.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, eine WebSocket-Infrastruktur mit geringer Latenz zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, die Socket.IO und native WebSockets verwendet, mit Fähigkeiten zur horizontalen Skalierung mit Redis pub/sub und einer p99-Latenz von unter 10 ms mit 99,99 % Betriebszeit.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar infraestrutura de WebSocket de baixa latência usando Socket.IO e WebSockets nativos, com capacidades de escalonamento horizontal usando Redis pub/sub e alcançando latência p99 inferior a 10ms com 99,99% de tempo de atividade.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать инфраструктуру WebSocket с низкой задержкой, используя Socket.IO и родные WebSockets, с возможностями горизонтального масштабирования с помощью Redis pub/sub и достижением задержки p99 менее 10мс при 99,99% времени безотказной работы.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وتنفيذ بنية تحتية لويب سॉकيت منخفضة التأخير باستخدام سॉकيت.أي أوو وويب سॉकيت الأصلي، مع القدرات للتوسيع الأفقي باستخدام ريدس بنشر/الاشتراك وبلوغ تأخير p99 أقل من 10 مللي ثانية مع 99.99% من وقت التشغيل."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing real-time messaging systems for millions of concurrent connections","Optimizing WebSocket protocols for sub-10ms p99 latency and high uptime","Scaling WebSocket infrastructure using Redis pub/sub for high-performance applications"],"zh":["为数百万个并发连接实现实时消息系统","优化WebSocket协议以实现低于10ms的p99延迟和高正常运行时间","使用Redis pub/sub扩展WebSocket基础设施以实现高性能应用"],"ja":["数百万の同時接続に対するリアルタイムメッセージングシステムの実装","WebSocketプロトコルを最適化して10ms未満のp99レイテンシと高アップタイムを実現","Redis pub/subを使用してWebSocketインフラストラクチャを水平方向にスケーリングし、高パフォーマンスアプリケーションを実現"],"ko":["수백만 개의 동시 연결을 위한 실시간 메시징 시스템 구현","WebSocket 프로토콜을 최적화하여 10ms 미만의 p99 지연 및 높은 가동 시간을 달성","Redis pub/sub를 사용하여 WebSocket 인프라를 수평 확장하고 고성능 애플리케이션을 달성"],"es":["Implementar sistemas de mensajería en tiempo real para millones de conexiones concurrentes","Optimizar protocolos WebSocket para una latencia p99 inferior a 10 ms y un alto tiempo de actividad","Escalado de la infraestructura WebSocket utilizando Redis pub/sub para aplicaciones de alto rendimiento"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des systèmes de messagerie en temps réel pour des millions de connexions concurrentes","Optimiser les protocoles WebSocket pour une latence p99 inférieure à 10 ms et un temps d''activité élevé","Mise à l''échelle de l''infrastructure WebSocket en utilisant Redis pub/sub pour des applications à haute performance"],"de":["Implementierung von Echtzeit-Messaging-Systemen für Millionen von gleichzeitigen Verbindungen","Optimierung von WebSocket-Protokollen für eine p99-Latenz von unter 10 ms und hohe Betriebszeit","Skalierung der WebSocket-Infrastruktur mit Redis pub/sub für Hochleistungsanwendungen"],"pt":["Implementação de sistemas de mensagens em tempo real para milhões de conexões simultâneas","Otimização de protocolos WebSocket para latência p99 inferior a 10ms e alta disponibilidade","Escalonamento de infraestrutura WebSocket usando Redis pub/sub para aplicações de alto desempenho"],"ru":["Реализация систем обмена сообщениями в реальном времени для миллионов одновременных соединений","Оптимизация протоколов WebSocket для задержки p99 менее 10мс и высокой доступности","Масштабирование инфраструктуры WebSocket с помощью Redis pub/sub для высокопроизводительных приложений"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة رسائل الوقت الحقيقي لملايين من الاتصالات المتزامنة","تحسين بروتوكولات ويب سॉकيت لتأخير p99 أقل من 10 مللي ثانية ووقت تشغيل عالي","توسيع بنية تحتية لويب سॉकيت باستخدام ريدس بنشر/الاشتراك لتطبيقات الأداء العالي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in real-time systems engineering and WebSocket protocols","Dependent on Redis pub/sub for horizontal scaling","Native WebSocket and Socket.IO expertise necessary"],"zh":["需要实时系统工程和WebSocket协议的专业知识","依赖Redis pub/sub进行水平扩展","需要原生WebSocket和Socket.IO的专业知识"],"ja":["リアルタイムシステムエンジニアリングとWebSocketプロトコルの専門知識が必要","水平方向にスケーリングするためにRedis pub/subに依存","ネイティブWebSocketとSocket.IOの専門知識が必要"],"ko":["실시간 시스템 엔지니어링 및 WebSocket 프로토콜에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","수평 확장을 위해 Redis pub/sub에 의존","네이티브 WebSocket 및 Socket.IO에 대한 전문 지식이 필요"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en ingeniería de sistemas en tiempo real y protocolos WebSocket","Dependiente de Redis pub/sub para la escalada horizontal","Se requiere experiencia en WebSockets nativos y Socket.IO"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en ingénierie de systèmes en temps réel et en protocoles WebSocket","Dépendant de Redis pub/sub pour la mise à l''échelle horizontale","Une expertise en WebSockets natifs et Socket.IO est nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in Echtzeitsystem-Engineering und WebSocket-Protokollen","Abhängig von Redis pub/sub für horizontale Skalierung","Erfahrung mit nativen WebSockets und Socket.IO ist erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige especialização em engenharia de sistemas em tempo real e protocolos WebSocket","Dependente de Redis pub/sub para escalonamento horizontal","É necessário conhecimento em WebSocket nativo e Socket.IO"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в области инженерии систем реального времени и протоколов WebSocket","Зависит от Redis pub/sub для горизонтального масштабирования","Необходимо знание родного WebSocket и Socket.IO"],"ar":["يتطلب خبرة في هندسة أنظمة الوقت الحقيقي وبروتوكولات ويب سॉकيت","يعتمد على ريدس بنشر/الاشتراك للتوسيع الأفقي","يجب معرفة ويب سॉकيت الأصلي وسوكيت.أي أو"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"11461f743126147b1d82358b217f69300733b9a811c9b9120fadf3c78f111f53","qualityScore":55}');
