de composants lourds","Optimisation des images avec NgOptimizedImage","Préparation pour Zoneless Angular","Utilisation de Signals au lieu de Zone.runOutsideAngular","Fournir un suivi avec TrackBy"],"de":["Verwendung von ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Aufgeschobene Ladung von schweren Komponenten","Optimierung von Bildern mit NgOptimizedImage","Vorbereitung auf Zoneless Angular","Verwendung von Signals anstelle von Zone.runOutsideAngular","Bereitstellung einer Nachverfolgung mit TrackBy"],"pt":["Uso de ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Deferrable views para carregar componentes pesados","Imagens otimizadas com NgOptimizedImage","Preparação para Zoneless Angular","Uso de Signals em vez de Zone.runOutsideAngular","Fornecimento de tracking com TrackBy"],"ru":["Использование ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Отложенные представления для загрузки тяжёлых компонентов","Оптимизированные изображения с помощью NgOptimizedImage","Подготовка к Zoneless Angular","Использование сигналов вместо Zone.runOutsideAngular","Предоставление отслеживания с помощью TrackBy"],"ar":["استخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","تصورات مؤجلة لتحميل المكونات الثقيلة","صور مُختزنة باستخدام NgOptimizedImage","الاستعداد لمنطقة Angular الخالية","استخدام الإشارات بدلاً من Zone.runOutsideAngular","توفير التتبع باستخدام TrackBy"]},"keywords":{"zh":["性能优化","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images优化","Zoneless","TrackBy","Angular性能优化"],"ja":["パフォーマンス最適化","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images最適化","Zoneless","TrackBy","Angularパフォーマンス最適化"],"ko":["성능 최적화","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images 최적화","Zoneless","TrackBy","Angular 성능 최적화"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento","desarrollo de aplicaciones","programación","frameworks","Angular","Zoneless","Signals","TrackBy","NgOptimizedImage"],"fr":["optimisation des performances","développement d''applications","programmation","frameworks","Angular","Zoneless","Signals","TrackBy","NgOptimizedImage"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung","Anwendungsentwicklung","Programmierung","Frameworks","Angular","Zoneless","Signals","TrackBy","NgOptimizedImage"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","angular","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","deferrable views","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","Signals","TrackBy"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","angular","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","отложенные представления","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","сигналы","TrackBy"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","angular","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","تصورات مؤجلة","NgOptimizedImage","منطقة Angular الخالية","الإشارات","TrackBy"]}},"owner":"HoangNguyen0403","repo":"agent-skills-standard","repoPath":"HoangNguyen0403/agent-skills-standard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.578Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Performance","description":"Optimization techniques including OnPush, @defer, and Image Optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Performance\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **OnPush**: Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`. Components should only update when Inputs change or Signals fire.\n- **Deferrable Views**: Use `@defer` to lazy load heavy components/chunks below the fold.\n- **Images**: Use `NgOptimizedImage` (`ngSrc`) for LCP optimization.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Zoneless**: Prepare for Zoneless Angular by avoiding `Zone.runOutsideAngular` hacks. Use Signals.\n- **TrackBy**: Always provide a tracking","body":"# Performance\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **OnPush**: Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`. Components should only update when Inputs change or Signals fire.\n- **Deferrable Views**: Use `@defer` to lazy load heavy components/chunks below the fold.\n- **Images**: Use `NgOptimizedImage` (`ngSrc`) for LCP optimization.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Zoneless**: Prepare for Zoneless Angular by avoiding `Zone.runOutsideAngular` hacks. Use Signals.\n- **TrackBy**: Always provide a tracking function in loops (`@for (item of items; track item.id)`).\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Functions in Template**: `{{ calculate() }}` causes re-evaluation on every change detection cycle. Use `computed()` signals or pure pipes.\n- **Heavy Constructors**: Keep constructors empty. Use `ngOnInit` or effects.\n\n## References\n\n- [Defer Usage](references/defer-usage.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T04:53:53.224Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Angular-based AI Agents needing high-performance rendering and optimization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能渲染和优化能力的基于 Angular 的 AI 代理。","ja":"Angular ベースの AI エージェントが高性能レンダリングと最適化機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고성능 렌더링 및 최적화 기능이 필요한 Angular 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de AI basados en Angular que requieren capacidades de renderizado y optimización de alto rendimiento.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Angular nécessitant des capacités de rendu et d''optimisation haute performance.","de":"Perfekt für Angular-basierte KI-Agents, die hochleistungsfähige Render- und Optimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Angular que necessitam de capacidades de renderização e otimização de alto desempenho.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Angular, которым необходимы возможности высокопроизводительной отрисовки и оптимизации.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يعتمدون على Angular و kteří يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات تقديم أداء عالي والتحسين."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize Change Detection Strategy using OnPush, leverage deferrable views with @defer, and enhance image loading with NgOptimizedImage for improved LCP optimization, all while preparing for Zoneless Angular and utilizing Signals.","zh":"赋予代理优化更改检测策略，使用 OnPush，利用 @defer 实现可延迟视图，并使用 NgOptimizedImage 提高图像加载性能，改进 LCP 优化，同时为无区域 Angular 做准备并利用信号。","ja":"エージェントに変更検出戦略を最適化する権限を与え、OnPush を使用し、@defer で遅延可能なビューを実現し、NgOptimizedImage で画像読み込みのパフォーマンスを向上させ、LCP の最適化を改善し、Zoneless Angular を準備し、シグナルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 변경 감지 전략을 최적화하고 OnPush를 사용하여 지연 가능한 뷰를 구현하고 NgOptimizedImage로 이미지 로딩 성능을 향상시키고 LCP 최적화를 개선하고 영역 없는 Angular을 준비하고 신호를 활용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar la estrategia de detección de cambios utilizando OnPush, aprovechar vistas diferibles con @defer y mejorar la carga de imágenes con NgOptimizedImage para una mejor optimización de LCP, todo mientras se prepara para Zoneless Angular y utiliza señales","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser la stratégie de détection des modifications en utilisant OnPush, de tirer parti des vues différables avec @defer et d''améliorer le chargement d''images avec NgOptimizedImage pour une meilleure optimisation de LCP, le tout tout en se préparant à Angular sans zone et en utilisant des signaux.","de":"Ermöglich es den Agents, die Änderungserkennungsstrategie mit OnPush zu optimieren, deferrable Views mit @defer zu nutzen und die Bildladeleistung mit NgOptimizedImage für eine verbesserte LCP-Optimierung zu verbessern, während sie sich auf Zoneless Angular vorbereiten und Signale nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar a Estratégia de Detecção de Alterações usando OnPush, aproveitar vistas adiáveis com @defer e melhorar o carregamento de imagens com NgOptimizedImage para melhor otimização do LCP, preparando-se para o Angular sem Zonas e utilizando Sinais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать Стратегию Обнаружения Изменений с помощью OnPush, использовать отложенные представления с @defer и улучшить загрузку изображений с помощью NgOptimizedImage для улучшения оптимизации LCP, готовясь к Беззонному Angular и используя Сигналы.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحسين استراتيجية اكتشاف التغيير باستخدام OnPush، واستخدام المشاهدات القابلة للتأجيل مع @defer، وتحسين أداء تحميل الصور مع NgOptimizedImage من أجل تحسين تحسين LCP، مع الاستعداد للانتقال إلى Angular بدون مناطق وتحقيق الإشارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing component updates with ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Implementing deferrable views for lazy loading heavy components","Enhancing image loading performance with NgOptimizedImage"],"zh":["使用 ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush 优化组件更新","实现可延迟视图以延迟加载重型组件","使用 NgOptimizedImage 提高图像加载性能"],"ja":["ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush を使用してコンポーネントの更新を最適化する","遅延可能なビューを実現して重いコンポーネントの読み込みを遅延する","NgOptimizedImage を使用して画像読み込みのパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush를 사용하여 컴포넌트 업데이트를 최적화하는 것","지연 가능한 뷰를 구현하여 무거운 컴포넌트의 로딩을 지연하는 것","NgOptimizedImage를 사용하여 이미지 로딩 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Optimizar las actualizaciones de componentes con ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Implementar vistas diferibles para la carga diferida de componentes pesados","Mejorar el rendimiento de carga de imágenes con NgOptimizedImage"],"fr":["Optimiser les mises à jour de composants avec ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Mettre en œuvre des vues différables pour le chargement différé de composants lourds","Améliorer les performances de chargement d''images avec NgOptimizedImage"],"de":["Optimieren von Komponenten-Updates mit ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Implementieren von deferrable Views für die lazy Loading schwerer Komponenten","Verbessern der Bildladeleistung mit NgOptimizedImage"],"pt":["Otimizando atualizações de componentes com ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Implementando vistas adiáveis para carregamento lento de componentes pesados","Melhorando o desempenho de carregamento de imagens com NgOptimizedImage"],"ru":["Оптимизация обновлений компонентов с помощью ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Реализация отложенных представлений для ленивой загрузки тяжелых компонентов","Улучшение производительности загрузки изображений с помощью NgOptimizedImage"],"ar":["تحسين تحديثات المكونات باستخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","تنفيذ مشاهد قابلة للتأجيل لتحميل مكونات ثقيلة بطيء","تحسين أداء تحميل الصور مع NgOptimizedImage"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular framework","Limited to components that support OnPush strategy","NgOptimizedImage dependency required"],"zh":["需要 Angular 框架","仅限支持 OnPush 策略的组件","需要 NgOptimizedImage 依赖"],"ja":["Angular フレームワークが必要","OnPush 戦略をサポートするコンポーネントのみ","NgOptimizedImage 依存関係が必要"],"ko":["Angular 프레임워크가 필요합니다.","OnPush 전략을 지원하는 컴포넌트만 해당됩니다.","NgOptimizedImage 종속성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere el framework Angular","Limitado a componentes que admiten la estrategia OnPush","Se requiere la dependencia NgOptimizedImage"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Angular","Limité aux composants qui prennent en charge la stratégie OnPush","Dépendance NgOptimizedImage requise"],"de":["Benötigt das Angular-Framework","Begrenzt auf Komponenten, die die OnPush-Strategie unterstützen","NgOptimizedImage-Abhängigkeit erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer o framework Angular","Limitado a componentes que suportam a estratégia OnPush","Requer dependência de NgOptimizedImage"],"ru":["Требует фреймворка Angular","Ограничен компонентами, поддерживающими стратегию OnPush","Требует зависимости от NgOptimizedImage"],"ar":["يتطلب الإطار Angular","محدود بالمكونات التي تدعم استراتيجية OnPush","يتطلب تبعية NgOptimizedImage"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"430b6d4b302f7276424b89ed0b11a8b59e9fb9c672db17b69b40a700266a1775","qualityScore":55}');
