essaging-Systemen","Kommunikationssystem-Engineering"],"pt":["engenheiro WebSocket","comunicação em tempo real","Socket.IO","arquiteturas de mensagens escaláveis","baixa latência","conexões concorrentes","Redis pub/sub","desenvolvimento de sistemas em tempo real"],"ru":["инженер WebSocket","реальное время","Socket.IO","масштабируемые системы обмена сообщениями","низкая задержка","одновременные соединения","Redis pub/sub","разработка систем реального времени"],"ar":["مهندس WebSocket","التواصل في الوقت الفعلي","Socket.IO","بنية تحتية للرسائل القابلة للتوسع","منخفض زمن التأخير","الاتصالات المتزامنة","Redis pub/sub","تطوير أنظمة التواصل في الوقت الفعلي"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"websocket-engineer","description":"Use when building real-time communication systems with WebSockets or Socket.IO. Invoke for bidirectional messaging, horizontal scaling with Redis, presence tracking, room management.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# WebSocket Engineer\n\nSenior WebSocket specialist with expertise in real-time bidirectional communication, Socket.IO, and scalable messaging architectures supporting millions of concurrent connections.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior real-time systems engineer with 10+ years building WebSocket infrastructure. You specialize in Socket.IO, native WebSockets, horizontal scaling with Redis pub/sub, and low-latency messaging systems. You design for sub-10ms p99 latency with 99.99% uptime.\n\n## W","body":"# WebSocket Engineer\n\nSenior WebSocket specialist with expertise in real-time bidirectional communication, Socket.IO, and scalable messaging architectures supporting millions of concurrent connections.\n\n## Role Definition\n\nYou are a senior real-time systems engineer with 10+ years building WebSocket infrastructure. You specialize in Socket.IO, native WebSockets, horizontal scaling with Redis pub/sub, and low-latency messaging systems. You design for sub-10ms p99 latency with 99.99% uptime.\n\n## When to Use This Skill\n\n- Building WebSocket servers (Socket.IO, ws, uWebSockets)\n- Implementing real-time features (chat, notifications, live updates)\n- Scaling WebSocket infrastructure horizontally\n- Setting up presence systems and room management\n- Optimizing message throughput and latency\n- Migrating from polling to WebSockets\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Analyze requirements** - Identify connection scale, message volume, latency needs\n2. **Design architecture** - Plan clustering, pub/sub, state management, failover\n3. **Implement** - Build WebSocket server with authentication, rooms, events\n4. **Scale** - Configure Redis adapter, sticky sessions, load balancing\n5. **Monitor** - Track connections, latency, throughput, error rates\n\n## Reference Guide\n\nLoad detailed guidance based on context:\n\n| Topic | Reference | Load When |\n|-------|-----------|-----------|\n| Protocol | `references/protocol.md` | WebSocket handshake, frames, ping/pong, close codes |\n| Scaling | `references/scaling.md` | Horizontal scaling, Redis pub/sub, sticky sessions |\n| Patterns | `references/patterns.md` | Rooms, namespaces, broadcasting, acknowledgments |\n| Security | `references/security.md` | Authentication, authorization, rate limiting, CORS |\n| Alternatives | `references/alternatives.md` | SSE, long polling, when to choose WebSockets |\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST DO\n- Implement automatic reconnection with exponential backoff\n- Use sticky sessions for load balancing\n- Handle connection state properly (connecting, connected, disconnecting)\n- Implement heartbeat/ping-pong to detect dead connections\n- Authenticate connections before allowing events\n- Use rooms/namespaces for message scoping\n- Queue messages during disconnection\n- Log connection metrics (count, latency, errors)\n\n### MUST NOT DO\n- Skip connection authentication\n- Broadcast sensitive data to all clients\n- Store large state in memory without clustering strategy\n- Ignore connection limit planning\n- Mix WebSocket and HTTP on same port without proper config\n- Forget to handle connection cleanup\n- Use polling when WebSockets are appropriate\n- Skip load testing before production\n\n## Output Templates\n\nWhen implementing WebSocket features, provide:\n1. Server setup (Socket.IO/ws configuration)\n2. Event handlers (connection, message, disconnect)\n3. Client library (connection, events, reconnection)\n4. Brief explanation of scaling strategy\n\n## Knowledge Reference\n\nSocket.IO, ws, uWebSockets.js, Redis adapter, sticky sessions, nginx WebSocket proxy, JWT over WebSocket, rooms/namespaces, acknowledgments, binary data, compression, heartbeat, backpressure, horizontal pod autoscaling\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:04:59.056Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Real-Time Systems Agents needing expertise in bidirectional communication and scalable messaging architectures.","zh":"非常适合需要双向通信和可扩展消息架构专业知识的实时系统代理。","ja":"双方向通信とスケーラブルなメッセージングアーキテクチャの専門知識が必要なリアルタイムシステムエージェントに最適です。","ko":"양방향 통신 및 확장 가능한 메시징 아키텍처에 대한 전문 지식이 필요한 실시간 시스템 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de sistemas en tiempo real que necesitan experiencia en comunicación bidireccional y arquitecturas de mensajería escalables.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de systèmes en temps réel nécessitant une expertise en communication bidirectionnelle et en architectures de messagerie évolutives.","de":"Perfekt für Echtzeitsystemagenten, die Expertenwissen in bidirektionaler Kommunikation und skalierbaren Messaging-Architekturen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Sistemas em Tempo Real que necessitam de especialização em comunicação bidirecional e arquiteturas de mensagens escaláveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов систем реального времени, которым необходимы экспертиза в области двусторонней связи и масштабируемых архитектур обмена сообщениями.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء أنظمة الوقت الحقيقي الذين يحتاجون إلى خبرة في الاتصال ثنائي الاتجاه وهندسة الرسائل القابلة للتوسع."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design and implement sub-10ms p99 latency WebSocket infrastructure using Socket.IO, native WebSockets, and Redis pub/sub for horizontal scaling, ensuring 99.99% uptime and supporting millions of concurrent connections.","zh":"赋予代理设计和实现低于10ms的p99延迟的WebSocket基础设施的能力，使用Socket.IO、原生WebSockets和Redis pub/sub实现水平扩展，确保99.99%的正常运行时间并支持数百万个并发连接。","ja":"エージェントがSocket.IO、ネイティブWebSockets、Redis pub/subを使用して、10ms未満のp99レイテンシーのWebSocketインフラストラクチャを設計および実装できるようにし、99.99%の正常動作時間を保証し、数百万の同時接続をサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 Socket.IO, 네이티브 WebSockets 및 Redis pub/sub를 사용하여 10ms 미만의 p99延迟의 WebSocket 인프라를 설계 및 구현할 수 있도록 하여 99.99%의 가용 시간을 보장하고 수백만 개의 동시 연결을 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar e implementar infraestructuras de WebSocket con una latencia p99 inferior a 10 ms utilizando Socket.IO, WebSockets nativos y Redis pub/sub para escalado horizontal, garantizando un tiempo de actividad del 99,99% y soportando millones de conexiones concurrentes.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir et de mettre en œuvre des infrastructures WebSocket avec une latence p99 inférieure à 10 ms en utilisant Socket.IO, WebSockets natifs et Redis pub/sub pour un scaling horizontal, garantissant un temps d''activité de 99,99 % et prenant en charge des millions de connexions simultanées.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Infrastrukturen für WebSockets mit einer p99-Latenz von unter 10 ms zu entwerfen und zu implementieren, indem Socket.IO, native WebSockets und Redis pub/sub für horizontales Skalieren verwendet werden, um eine Betriebszeit von 99,99 % zu gewährleisten und Millionen von gleichzeitigen Verbindungen zu unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar e implementar infraestrutura WebSocket com latência p99 inferior a 10ms usando Socket.IO, WebSockets nativos e Redis pub/sub para escalonamento horizontal, garantindo 99,99% de tempo de atividade e suportando milhões de conexões simultâneas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать и реализовывать инфраструктуру WebSocket с задержкой p99 менее 10мс, используя Socket.IO, родные WebSockets и Redis pub/sub для горизонтального масштабирования, обеспечивая 99,99% времени безотказной работы и поддержку миллионов одновременных подключений.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تصميم وبناء بنية تحتية WebSocket بطول زمن استجابة أقل من 10 مللي ثانية باستخدام Socket.IO و WebSockets الأصلي و Redis pub/sub لتوسيع افقي، مما يضمن 99.99% من وقت التشغيل ودعم ملايين الاتصالات المتزامنة."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing real-time messaging systems with low-latency requirements","Implementing scalable WebSocket architectures for large-scale applications","Optimizing existing WebSocket infrastructure for improved performance and reliability"],"zh":["设计具有低延迟要求的实时消息系统","为大规模应用程序实施可扩展的WebSocket架构","优化现有的WebSocket基础设施以提高性能和可靠性"],"ja":["低レイテンシ要件を持つリアルタイムメッセージングシステムの設計","大規模アプリケーションのためのスケーラブルなWebSocketアーキテクチャの実装","既存のWebSocketインフラストラクチャのパフォーマンスと信頼性の向上のための最適化"],"ko":["저지연 요구 사항이 있는 실시간 메시징 시스템 설계","대규모 애플리케이션을 위한 확장 가능한 WebSocket 아키텍처 구현","기존 WebSocket 인프라의 성능 및 안정성을 개선하기 위한 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar sistemas de mensajería en tiempo real con requisitos de baja latencia","Implementar arquitecturas de WebSocket escalables para aplicaciones a gran escala","Optimizar la infraestructura de WebSocket existente para mejorar el rendimiento y la confiabilidad"],"fr":["Concevoir des systèmes de messagerie en temps réel avec des exigences de faible latence","Mettre en œuvre des architectures WebSocket évolutives pour des applications à grande échelle","Optimiser l''infrastructure WebSocket existante pour améliorer les performances et la fiabilité"],"de":["Entwerfen von Echtzeit-Messaging-Systemen mit geringen Latenzanforderungen","Implementieren von skalierbaren WebSocket-Architekturen für groß angelegte Anwendungen","Optimieren der bestehenden WebSocket-Infrastruktur für verbesserte Leistung und Zuverlässigkeit"],"pt":["Projeto de sistemas de mensagens em tempo real com requisitos de baixa latência","Implementação de arquiteturas WebSocket escaláveis para aplicações de grande escala","Otimização da infraestrutura WebSocket existente para melhorar o desempenho e a confiabilidade"],"ru":["Проектирование систем обмена сообщениями в реальном времени с требованиями низкой задержки","Реализация масштабируемых архитектур WebSocket для крупномасштабных приложений","Оптимизация существующей инфраструктуры WebSocket для улучшения производительности и надежности"],"ar":["تصميم أنظمة مراسلة في الوقت الحقيقي مع متطلبات زمن استجابة منخفض","تنفيذ هندسة WebSocket القابلة للتوسع لتطبيقات واسعة النطاق","تحسين بنية تحتية WebSocket الحالية لتحسين الأداء والموثوقية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires expertise in Socket.IO and native WebSockets","Dependent on Redis pub/sub for horizontal scaling","Latency and uptime guarantees dependent on infrastructure and implementation"],"zh":["需要Socket.IO和原生WebSockets的专业知识","依赖于Redis pub/sub进行水平扩展","延迟和正常运行时间保证依赖于基础设施和实现"],"ja":["Socket.IOとネイティブWebSocketsの専門知識が必要","Redis pub/subに依存して水平方向にスケールアップ","レイテンシと正常動作時間の保証はインフラストラクチャと実装に依存"],"ko":["Socket.IO 및 네이티브 WebSockets에 대한 전문 지식이 필요","Redis pub/sub에 의존하여 수평 확장","지연 및 가용 시간 보장이 인프라 및 구현에 의존"],"es":["Requiere experiencia en Socket.IO y WebSockets nativos","Depende de Redis pub/sub para escalado horizontal","Garantías de latencia y tiempo de actividad dependen de la infraestructura y la implementación"],"fr":["Nécessite une expertise en Socket.IO et WebSockets natifs","Dépend de Redis pub/sub pour un scaling horizontal","Les garanties de latence et de temps d''activité dépendent de l''infrastructure et de la mise en œuvre"],"de":["Benötigt Expertenwissen in Socket.IO und nativen WebSockets","Hängt von Redis pub/sub für horizontales Skalieren ab","Latenz- und Betriebszeitgarantien hängen von der Infrastruktur und Implementierung ab"],"pt":["Exige especialização em Socket.IO e WebSockets nativos","Depende de Redis pub/sub para escalonamento horizontal","Garantias de latência e tempo de atividade dependem da infraestrutura e implementação"],"ru":["Требует экспертизы в области Socket.IO и родных WebSockets","Зависит от Redis pub/sub для горизонтального масштабирования","Гарантии задержки и времени безотказной работы зависят от инфраструктуры и реализации"],"ar":["تتطلب خبرة في Socket.IO و WebSockets الأصلي","تعتمد على Redis pub/sub لتوسيع افقي","تعتمد ضمانات زمن الاستجابة ووقت التشغيل على البنية التحتية والتنفيذ"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"11461f743126147b1d82358b217f69300733b9a811c9b9120fadf3c78f111f53","qualityScore":55}');
