servidores MCP personalizados","Integrações de API","Autenticação OAuth","Otimização de resposta","Instalação adequada no Claude Code e Claude Desktop"],"ru":["Создание настраиваемых серверов MCP","Интеграции с API","Аутентификация OAuth","Оптимизация ответа","Правильная установка в Claude Code и Claude Desktop"],"ar":["إنشاء خوادم MCP مخصصة","تطبيقات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","مصادقة OAuth","تحسين الاستجابة","تركيب صحيح في Claude Code وClaude Desktop"]},"keywords":{"zh":["MCP服务器","Claude","API集成","OAuth认证","响应优化","生产就绪","Claude Code","Claude Desktop"],"ja":["MCPサーバー","Claude","API統合","OAuth認証","レスポンスの最適化","本番環境対応","Claude Code","Claude Desktop"],"ko":["MCP 서버","Claude","API 통합","OAuth 인증","응답 최적화","생산 준비가 된","Claude Code","Claude Desktop"],"es":["servidores MCP","Claude","API","OAuth","optimización de respuestas","seguridad","desarrollo de servidores","integraciones de API","autenticación"],"fr":["serveurs MCP","Claude","API","OAuth","optimisation des réponses","sécurité","développement de serveurs","intégrations d''API","authentification"],"de":["MCP-Server","Claude","API","OAuth","Antwortoptimierung","Sicherheit","Serverentwicklung","API-Integrationen","Authentifizierung"],"pt":["servidores MCP","criação de servidores MCP","integrações de API","autenticação OAuth","otimização de resposta","Claude Code","Claude Desktop"],"ru":["серверы MCP","создание серверов MCP","интеграции с API","аутентификация OAuth","оптимизация ответа","Claude Code","Claude Desktop"],"ar":["خوادم MCP","إنشاء خوادم MCP","تطبيقات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","مصادقة OAuth","تحسين الاستجابة","Claude Code","Claude Desktop"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.580Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-mcp-servers","description":"Create Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers that expose tools, resources, and prompts to Claude. Use when building custom integrations, APIs, data sources, or any server that Claude should interact with via the MCP protocol. Supports both TypeScript and Python implementations.","bodyPreview":"<objective>\nMCP servers extend Claude''s capabilities by exposing tools, resources, and prompts. This skill guides creation of production-ready MCP servers with API integrations, OAuth authentication, response optimization, and proper installation in Claude Code and Claude Desktop.\n</objective>\n\n<essential_principles>\n\n<the_5_rules>\nEvery MCP server must follow these:\n\n1. **Never Hardcode Secrets** - Use `${VAR}` expansion in configs, environment variables in code\n2. **Use `cwd` Property** - Isol","body":"<objective>\nMCP servers extend Claude''s capabilities by exposing tools, resources, and prompts. This skill guides creation of production-ready MCP servers with API integrations, OAuth authentication, response optimization, and proper installation in Claude Code and Claude Desktop.\n</objective>\n\n<essential_principles>\n\n<the_5_rules>\nEvery MCP server must follow these:\n\n1. **Never Hardcode Secrets** - Use `${VAR}` expansion in configs, environment variables in code\n2. **Use `cwd` Property** - Isolates dependencies (not `--cwd` in args)\n3. **Always Absolute Paths** - `which uv` to find paths, never relative\n4. **One Server Per Directory** - `~/Developer/mcp/{server-name}/`\n5. **Use `uv` for Python** - Better than pip, handles venvs automatically\n</the_5_rules>\n\n<security_checklist>\n- Never ask user to paste secrets into chat\n- Always use environment variables for credentials\n- Use ${VAR} expansion in configs\n- Provide exact commands for user to run in terminal\n- Verify environment variable existence without showing values\n- Never hardcode API keys in code or configs\n</security_checklist>\n\n<architecture_decision>\nOperation count determines architecture:\n\n- **1-2 operations** → Traditional pattern (flat tools)\n- **3+ operations** → On-demand discovery pattern (meta-tools)\n\nTraditional: Each operation is a separate tool\nOn-demand: 4 meta-tools (discover, get_schema, execute, continue) + operations.json\n</architecture_decision>\n\n<context>\nMCP servers expose:\n- **Tools**: Functions Claude can call (API requests, file operations, calculations)\n- **Resources**: Data Claude can read (files, database records, API responses)\n- **Prompts**: Reusable prompt templates with arguments\n\nStandard location: `~/Developer/mcp/{server-name}/`\n</context>\n\n</essential_principles>\n\n<routing>\nBased on user intent, route to appropriate workflow:\n\n**No context provided** (skill invoked without description):\nUse AskUserQuestion:\n- header: \"Mode\"\n- question: \"What would you like to do?\"\n- options:\n  - \"Create a new MCP server\" → workflows/create-new-server.md\n  - \"Update an existing MCP server\" → workflows/update-existing-server.md\n  - \"Troubleshoot a server\" → workflows/troubleshoot-server.md\n\n**Context provided** (user described what they want):\nRoute directly to workflows/create-new-server.md\n</routing>\n\n<workflows_index>\n| Workflow | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| create-new-server.md | Full 8-step workflow from intake to verification |\n| update-existing-server.md | Modify or extend an existing server |\n| troubleshoot-server.md | Diagnose and fix connection/runtime issues |\n</workflows_index>\n\n<templates_index>\n| Template | Purpose |\n|----------|---------|\n| python-server.py | Traditional pattern starter for Python |\n| typescript-server.ts | Traditional pattern starter for TypeScript |\n| operations.json | On-demand discovery operations definition |\n</templates_index>\n\n<scripts_index>\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| setup-python-project.sh | Initialize Python MCP project with uv |\n| setup-typescript-project.sh | Initialize TypeScript MCP project with npm |\n</scripts_index>\n\n<references_index>\n**Core workflow:**\n- creation-workflow.md - Complete step-by-step with exact commands\n\n**Architecture patterns:**\n- traditional-pattern.md - For 1-2 operations (flat tools)\n- large-api-pattern.md - For 3+ operations (on-demand discovery)\n\n**Language-specific:**\n- python-implementation.md - Async patterns, type hints\n- typescript-implementation.md - Type safety, SDK features\n\n**Advanced topics:**\n- oauth-implementation.md - OAuth with stdio isolation\n- response-optimization.md - Field truncation, pagination\n- tools-and-resources.md - Resources API, prompts, streaming\n- testing-and-deployment.md - Unit tests, packaging, publishing\n- validation-checkpoints.md - All validation checks\n- adaptive-questioning-guide.md - Question templates for intake\n- api-research-template.md - API research document format\n</references_index>\n\n<quick_reference>\n```bash\n# List servers\nclaude mcp list\n\n# Add server (Python)\nclaude mcp add --transport stdio <name> \\\n  --env API_KEY=''${API_KEY}'' \\\n  -- uv --directory ~/Developer/mcp/<name> run python -m src.server\n\n# Add server (TypeScript)\nclaude mcp add --transport stdio <name> \\\n  --env API_KEY=''${API_KEY}'' \\\n  -- node ~/Developer/mcp/<name>/build/index.js\n\n# Remove server\nclaude mcp remove <name>\n\n# Check logs\ntail -f ~/Library/Logs/Claude/mcp-server-<name>.log\n\n# Find paths\nwhich uv && which node && which python\n```\n</quick_reference>\n\n<troubleshooting_quick>\n**Server not appearing:** Check `claude mcp list`, verify config in `~/.claude/settings.json`\n\n**\"command not found\":** Use absolute paths from `which uv` / `which node`\n\n**Environment variable not found:**\n```bash\necho $MY_API_KEY  # Check if set\necho ''export MY_API_KEY=\"value\"'' >> ~/.zshrc && source ~/.zshrc\n```\n\n**Secrets visible in conversation:** STOP. Delete conversation. Rotate credentials. Never paste secrets in chat.\n\nFull troubleshooting: workflows/troubleshoot-server.md\n</troubleshooting_quick>\n\n<success_criteria>\nA production-ready MCP server has:\n- Valid configuration in Claude Code (`claude mcp list` shows ✓ Connected)\n- Valid configuration in Claude Desktop config\n- Environment variables set securely in ~/.zshrc\n- Architecture matches operation count\n- OAuth stdio isolation if applicable\n- Response optimization for list/search operations\n- All validation checkpoints passed\n- No errors in logs\n</success_criteria>\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:07:53.309Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Advanced Agents needing to extend capabilities with production-ready MCP servers and API integrations.","zh":"适合需要使用生产就绪的MCP服务器和API集成来扩展功能的高级代理。","ja":"Advanced Agentが機能を拡張するために、生产就绪のMCPサーバーとAPI統合を使用する必要がある場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 에이전트가 생산 준비된 MCP 서버 및 API 통합으로 기능을 확장해야 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes avanzados que necesitan ampliar sus capacidades con servidores MCP listos para producción y integraciones de API.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents avancés qui ont besoin d''étendre leurs capacités avec des serveurs MCP prêts pour la production et des intégrations d''API.","de":"Perfekt für erweiterte Agenten, die ihre Fähigkeiten mit produktionsreifen MCP-Servern und API-Integrationen erweitern müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Avançados que necessitam estender suas capacidades com servidores MCP de produção e integrações de API prontas para uso.","ru":"Идеально для продвинутых агентов, которым необходимо расширить возможности с помощью серверов MCP, готовых к производству, и интеграций API.","ar":"مثالي لعميل متقدم يحتاج إلى توسيع قدراته بخوادرمك ممتازة وإعدادات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to expose tools and resources via MCP servers with OAuth authentication, response optimization, and proper installation in Claude Code and Claude Desktop, utilizing environment variables and API integrations.","zh":"使代理能够通过MCP服务器、OAuth身份验证、响应优化以及在Claude Code和Claude Desktop中正确安装来暴露工具和资源，利用环境变量和API集成。","ja":"エージェントがMCPサーバー、OAuth認証、レスポンスタイムの最適化、およびClaude CodeとClaude Desktopへの正しいインストールを使用してツールとリソースを公開できるようにし、環境変数とAPI統合を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 MCP 서버, OAuth 인증, 응답 시간 최적화 및 Claude Code 및 Claude Desktop에서 올바른 설치를 사용하여 도구 및 리소스를 노출할 수 있도록 하며, 환경 변수 및 API 통합을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para exponer herramientas y recursos a través de servidores MCP con autenticación OAuth, optimización de respuestas y configuración adecuada en Claude Code y Claude Desktop, utilizando variables de entorno y integraciones de API.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exposer des outils et des ressources via des serveurs MCP avec une authentification OAuth, une optimisation des réponses et une installation appropriée dans Claude Code et Claude Desktop, en utilisant des variables d''environnement et des intégrations d''API.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Tools und Ressourcen über MCP-Server mit OAuth-Authentifizierung, Response-Optimierung und ordnungsgemäßer Installation in Claude Code und Claude Desktop bereitzustellen, indem Umgebungsvariablen und API-Integrationen verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a expor ferramentas e recursos por meio de servidores MCP com autenticação OAuth, otimização de resposta e instalação adequada no Claude Code e Claude Desktop, utilizando variáveis de ambiente e integrações de API.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью экспонировать инструменты и ресурсы через серверы MCP с аутентификацией OAuth, оптимизацией ответов и правильной установкой в Claude Code и Claude Desktop, используя переменные окружения и интеграции API.","ar":"يمكن للعميل من خلاله إظهار الأدوات والموارد من خلال خوادرمك مع مصادقة أوث وضبط الاستجابة بشكل جيد وتثبيت مناسب في كلود كود وكلود ديستوب، باستخدام متغيرات البيئة وإعدادات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating production-ready MCP servers with secure OAuth authentication","Optimizing response times for MCP server integrations","Installing and configuring MCP servers in Claude Code and Claude Desktop"],"zh":["创建具有安全OAuth身份验证的生产就绪MCP服务器","优化MCP服务器集成的响应时间","在Claude Code和Claude Desktop中安装和配置MCP服务器"],"ja":["セキュアなOAuth認証を備えた生産就绪のMCPサーバーの作成","MCPサーバー統合のレスポンスタイムの最適化","Claude CodeおよびClaude DesktopへのMCPサーバーのインストールと設定"],"ko":["보안 OAuth 인증을 갖춘 생산 준비된 MCP 서버 생성","MCP 서버 통합의 응답 시간 최적화","Claude Code 및 Claude Desktop에서 MCP 서버 설치 및 구성"],"es":["Crear servidores MCP listos para producción con autenticación OAuth segura","Optimizar los tiempos de respuesta para las integraciones de servidores MCP","Instalar y configurar servidores MCP en Claude Code y Claude Desktop"],"fr":["Créer des serveurs MCP prêts pour la production avec une authentification OAuth sécurisée","Optimiser les temps de réponse pour les intégrations de serveurs MCP","Installer et configurer des serveurs MCP dans Claude Code et Claude Desktop"],"de":["Erstellung von produktionsreifen MCP-Servern mit sicherer OAuth-Authentifizierung","Optimieren der Responsezeiten für MCP-Server-Integrationen","Installation und Konfiguration von MCP-Servern in Claude Code und Claude Desktop"],"pt":["Criar servidores MCP de produção com autenticação OAuth segura","Otimizar tempos de resposta para integrações de servidor MCP","Instalar e configurar servidores MCP no Claude Code e Claude Desktop"],"ru":["Создание серверов MCP, готовых к производству, с безопасной аутентификацией OAuth","Оптимизация времени ответа для интеграций сервера MCP","Установка и настройка серверов MCP в Claude Code и Claude Desktop"],"ar":["إنشاء خوادرمك جاهزة للإنتاج مع مصادقة أوث آمنة","تحسين أوقات الاستجابة لإعدادات تكامل الخوادرمك","تثبيت وتكوين خوادرمك في كلود كود وكلود ديستوب"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires proper installation in Claude Code and Claude Desktop","Must follow the 5 rules, including never hardcoding secrets and using the `cwd` property","Needs environment variables in code for secure configuration"],"zh":["需要在Claude Code和Claude Desktop中正确安装","必须遵循5条规则，包括绝不硬编码秘密并使用`cwd`属性","需要在代码中使用环境变量以实现安全配置"],"ja":["Claude CodeおよびClaude Desktopへの正しいインストールが必要","5つのルールに従う必要があり、秘密をハードコードしないことと`cwd`プロパティを使用することが含まれる","コード内で環境変数を使用してセキュアな設定を実現する必要がある"],"ko":["Claude Code 및 Claude Desktop에서 올바른 설치가 필요합니다.","5가지 규칙을 따라야 하며, 비밀을 하드코딩하지 않고 `cwd` 속성을 사용하는 것이 포함됩니다.","코드 내에서 환경 변수를 사용하여 보안 구성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere una instalación adecuada en Claude Code y Claude Desktop","Debe seguir las 5 reglas, incluyendo nunca codificar secretos de manera dura y utilizar la propiedad `cwd`","Necesita variables de entorno en el código para una configuración segura"],"fr":["Nécessite une installation appropriée dans Claude Code et Claude Desktop","Doit suivre les 5 règles, y compris ne jamais durcir les secrets et utiliser la propriété `cwd`","Besoin de variables d''environnement dans le code pour une configuration sécurisée"],"de":["Benötigt eine ordnungsgemäße Installation in Claude Code und Claude Desktop","Muss den 5 Regeln folgen, einschließlich niemals Geheimnisse hartcodieren und die Eigenschaft `cwd` verwenden","Benötigt Umgebungsvariablen im Code für eine sichere Konfiguration"],"pt":["Exige instalação adequada no Claude Code e Claude Desktop","Deve seguir as 5 regras, incluindo nunca codificar segredos e usar a propriedade `cwd`","Necessita de variáveis de ambiente no código para configuração segura"],"ru":["Требует правильной установки в Claude Code и Claude Desktop","Должно следовать 5 правилам, включая никогда не硬кодить секреты и использовать свойство `cwd`","Требует переменных окружения в коде для безопасной конфигурации"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيتًا مناسبًا في كلود كود وكلود ديستوب","يجب اتباع 5 قواعد، بما في ذلك أبدًا لا تحدد الأسرار وتستخدم خاصية `cwd`","يتطلب متغيرات البيئة في الكود لتكوين آمن"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c774949f6c1b714f2817149634f40343628cdd8946edea9d38801b68b7830089","qualityScore":55}');
