ées et planification","Exécution et gestion de sessions","Préservation de contexte et mise en production","Économie de 35-55 minutes par cycle de vie du projet"],"de":["9 integrierte Befehle zur Automatisierung des Arbeitsflusses","Ideenvalidierung und Planung","Ausführung und Sitzungsverwaltung","Kontexterhaltung und Release","Sparen von 35-55 Minuten pro Projekt-Lebenszyklus"],"pt":["9 comandos integrados para automação do ciclo de vida do projeto","Validação de ideias","Planejamento","Execução","Gerenciamento de sessões","Preservação de contexto","Lançamento"],"ru":["9 интегрированных команд для автоматизации цикла жизни проекта","Проверка идей","Планирование","Выполнение","Управление сессиями","Сохранение контекста","Выпуск"],"ar":["9 أوامر متكاملة لآليّة دورة حياة المشروع","التحقق من الأفكار","التخطيط","التنفيذ","إدارة الجلسات","الحفاظ على السياق","الإصدار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["项目工作流程自动化","project-workflow技能","斜杠命令","项目生命周期","自动化工具","开发效率","节省时间"],"ja":["プロジェクトワークフローの自動化","project-workflowスキル","スラッシュコマンド","プロジェクトライフサイクル","自動化ツール","開発効率","時間の節約"],"ko":["프로젝트 워크플로 자동화","project-workflow 스킬","슬래시 명령어","프로젝트 라이프사이클","자동화 도구","개발 효율","시간 절약"],"es":["automatización de flujo de trabajo","gestión de proyectos","ciclo de vida del proyecto","validación de ideas","planificación de proyectos","ejecución de proyectos"],"fr":["automatisation de flux de travail","gestion de projets","cycle de vie du projet","validation des idées","planification de projets","exécution de projets"],"de":["Automatisierung des Arbeitsflusses","Projektmanagement","Projekt-Lebenszyklus","Ideenvalidierung","Projektplanung","Projektausführung"],"pt":["fluxo de projeto","automação de projeto","validação de ideias","planejamento de projeto","execução de projeto","gerenciamento de sessões","preservação de contexto","lançamento de projeto","desenvolvimento de software"],"ru":["рабочий процесс проекта","автоматизация проекта","проверка идей","планирование проекта","выполнение проекта","управление сессиями","сохранение контекста","выпуск проекта","разработка программного обеспечения"],"ar":["Fluxo دي المشروع","آليّة المشروع","التحقق من الأفكار","تخطيط المشروع","تنفيذ المشروع","إدارة الجلسات","الحفاظ على السياق","إصدار المشروع","تطوير البرمجيات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"project-workflow","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Project Workflow Skill\n\n9 integrated slash commands for complete project lifecycle automation: idea validation → planning → execution → session management → context preservation → release.\n\n**Time savings**: 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle\n\n## Installation\n\n**Marketplace**: `/plugin install project-workflow@jezweb-skills`\n\n**Manual**: Copy `commands/*.md` to `~/.claude/commands/`\n\n## The 9 Commands\n\n### 1. `/explore-idea` - Pre-Planning Exploration\n\n**Use when**: Rough idea that needs tech","body":"# Project Workflow Skill\n\n9 integrated slash commands for complete project lifecycle automation: idea validation → planning → execution → session management → context preservation → release.\n\n**Time savings**: 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle\n\n## Installation\n\n**Marketplace**: `/plugin install project-workflow@jezweb-skills`\n\n**Manual**: Copy `commands/*.md` to `~/.claude/commands/`\n\n## The 9 Commands\n\n### 1. `/explore-idea` - Pre-Planning Exploration\n\n**Use when**: Rough idea that needs tech stack validation, scope management, or research before planning.\n\n**Creates**: PROJECT_BRIEF.md with validated decisions → hands off to /plan-project\n\n**Time savings**: 10-15 min\n\n---\n\n### 2. `/plan-project` - Generate Project Planning Docs\n\n**Use when**: Starting new project with clear requirements, or after /explore-idea.\n\n**Creates**: IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, SESSION.md, DATABASE_SCHEMA.md (if needed), API_ENDPOINTS.md (if needed), ARCHITECTURE.md\n\n**Invokes**: project-planning skill\n\n**Time savings**: 5-7 min\n\n---\n\n### 3. `/plan-feature` - Add Features to Existing Projects\n\n**Use when**: Adding feature to existing project with SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md.\n\n**Does**: Generates new phases via project-planning skill, integrates into IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md with renumbering, updates SESSION.md.\n\n**Time savings**: 7-10 min\n\n---\n\n### 4. `/wrap-session` - End-of-Session Checkpoint\n\n**Use when**: Context full (>150k tokens), end of work session, or before task switch.\n\n**Does**: Task agent analyzes session → updates SESSION.md (progress, Next Action, blockers) → git checkpoint commit → formatted handoff summary.\n\n**Time savings**: 2-3 min\n\n---\n\n### 5. `/continue-session` - Start-of-Session Context Loading\n\n**Use when**: Starting new session or after /wrap-session checkpoint.\n\n**Does**: Explore agent loads SESSION.md + planning docs → shows git history + session summary (phase, progress, Next Action, blockers) → optionally opens file → asks permission to continue.\n\n**Time savings**: 1-2 min\n\n---\n\n### 6. `/workflow` - Interactive Workflow Guide\n\n**Use when**: First time user, unsure which command to use, or need quick reference.\n\n**Does**: Shows all 9 commands → context-aware guidance with decision trees → offers to execute appropriate command.\n\n---\n\n### 7. `/release` - Pre-Release Safety Checks\n\n**Use when**: Ready to push to public GitHub or create release.\n\n**8 Phases**:\n1. **Critical Safety** (BLOCKERS): Secrets scan (gitleaks), personal artifacts check, git remote verification\n2. **Documentation** (REQUIRED): LICENSE, README (>100 words), CONTRIBUTING.md (>500 LOC), CODE_OF_CONDUCT (>1000 LOC)\n3. **Configuration**: .gitignore, package.json, git branch warning\n4. **Quality** (NON-BLOCKING): Build test, npm audit, large files (>1MB)\n5. **Report**: Blockers/warnings/recommendations + safe to release verdict\n6-8. **Auto-Fix & Publish**: Fix issues, release prep commit, optional git tag + GitHub release\n\n**Time savings**: 10-15 min\n\n---\n\n### 8. `/brief` - Context Preservation Document\n\n**Use when**: Before clearing context, to preserve key decisions and requirements for future sessions.\n\n**Creates**: `docs/brief-[slug].md` with extracted information from current conversation.\n\n**Does**: Analyzes conversation → extracts what''s being built, decisions made, technical details → creates organized markdown file → optionally creates GitHub issue for tracking.\n\n**Time savings**: 3-5 min\n\n---\n\n### 9. `/reflect` - Capture Operational Knowledge\n\n**Use when**: Before context compaction, after completing significant work, or when valuable learnings accumulated.\n\n**Does**: Reviews conversation → identifies workflows discovered, patterns learned, tool sequences, corrections made → routes each learning to appropriate destination (rules, CLAUDE.md, skills, docs) → optionally suggests automation (scripts, commands, custom agents).\n\n**Key Feature**: Considers whether processes should become custom agents when they require reasoning/decisions, benefit from parallel execution, or involve research/exploration.\n\n**Time savings**: 5-10 min\n\n---\n\n## Workflow Examples\n\n**Full**: /explore-idea → /plan-project → work → /wrap-session → /continue-session → /plan-feature (if needed) → repeat → /reflect → /release\n\n**Quick** (clear requirements): /plan-project → work → /wrap-session → /continue-session → /release\n\n**Context Preservation**: /brief (before clearing context), /reflect (capture learnings)\n\n**Helpers**: /workflow (guidance), /plan-feature (add feature), /release (publish)\n\n---\n\n## Integration\n\n**project-planning**: Invoked by /plan-project and /plan-feature (generates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md, DATABASE_SCHEMA.md, API_ENDPOINTS.md)\n\n**project-session-management**: SESSION.md protocol for /wrap-session and /continue-session\n\n**Claude Code agents**: /wrap-session (Task agent), /continue-session + /explore-idea (Explore agent)\n\n---\n\n## Command Relationships\n\n```\nEXPLORATION PHASE\n/explore-idea (optional)\n    ↓\n    Creates PROJECT_BRIEF.md\n    ↓\nPLANNING PHASE\n/plan-project (reads PROJECT_BRIEF.md if exists)\n    ↓\n    Creates IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md + SESSION.md\n    ↓\nEXECUTION PHASE\nWork on phases\n    ↓\n/wrap-session (when context full)\n    ↓\n    Updates SESSION.md, git checkpoint\n    ↓\n/continue-session (new session)\n    ↓\n    Loads SESSION.md, continues work\n    ↓\n/plan-feature (when need new features)\n    ↓\n    Adds phases to IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n    ↓\nContinue wrap → resume cycle\n    ↓\nCONTEXT PRESERVATION\n/brief (before clearing context)\n    ↓\n    Creates docs/brief-[slug].md\n    ↓\n/reflect (capture learnings)\n    ↓\n    Routes knowledge to rules, docs, CLAUDE.md\n    ↓\nRELEASE PHASE\n/release (when ready to publish)\n    ↓\n    Safety checks → GitHub release\n\nHELPER\n/workflow (anytime)\n    ↓\n    Interactive guidance\n```\n\n---\n\n## Time Savings Breakdown\n\n| Command | Time Saved | Tasks Automated |\n|---------|------------|-----------------|\n| `/explore-idea` | 10-15 min | Research, validation, scope management, tech stack evaluation |\n| `/plan-project` | 5-7 min | Planning doc generation, git setup, phase structuring |\n| `/plan-feature` | 7-10 min | Feature planning, phase integration, doc updates |\n| `/wrap-session` | 2-3 min | SESSION.md updates, git checkpoint, handoff summary |\n| `/continue-session` | 1-2 min | Context loading, git history review, next action display |\n| `/workflow` | Instant | Navigation, decision trees, command selection |\n| `/release` | 10-15 min | Secret scanning, doc validation, build testing, release creation |\n| `/brief` | 3-5 min | Context extraction, decisions capture, markdown generation |\n| `/reflect` | 5-10 min | Learning extraction, knowledge routing, automation suggestions |\n\n**Total per project lifecycle:** 45-70 minutes\n\n---\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**All**: Claude Code CLI, git repo (recommended)\n\n**/plan-feature**: Existing SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md\n\n**/wrap-session, /continue-session**: SESSION.md (created by /plan-project)\n\n**/release**: Git repo with commits, package.json (Node.js), remote URL (for publishing)\n\n---\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**/plan-project \"No project description\"**: Use /explore-idea first or discuss project with Claude\n\n**/plan-feature \"Prerequisites not met\"**: Run /plan-project first (creates SESSION.md + IMPLEMENTATION_PHASES.md)\n\n**/wrap-session \"No git repository\"**: Run `git init`\n\n**/continue-session \"SESSION.md not found\"**: Run /plan-project\n\n**/release \"Secrets detected\"**: Add to .gitignore, remove from git history\n\n---\n\n## Version History\n\n**1.1.0** (2026-01-11)\n- Added `/brief` command for context preservation\n- Added `/reflect` command for capturing operational knowledge\n- `/reflect` now suggests custom agents for processes requiring reasoning\n- Total commands: 9\n\n**1.0.0** (2025-11-12)\n- Initial release\n- 7 integrated slash commands\n- Plugin marketplace distribution\n- Command bundling via plugin.json\n\n---\n\n**Issues**: https://github.com/jezweb/claude-skills/issues | **Author**: Jeremy Dawes (jeremy@jezweb.net) | **License**: MIT\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:09:56.551Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Productivity Agents needing comprehensive project lifecycle automation and workflow management.","zh":"非常适合需要全面项目生命周期自动化和工作流管理的生产力代理。","ja":"プロダクティビティエージェントが包括的なプロジェクトライフサイクル自動化とワークフローマネジメントを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"전체 프로젝트 生命周期 자동화 및 워크플로우 관리가 필요한 생산성 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de productividad que necesitan una automatización y gestión de flujos de trabajo integral del ciclo de vida del proyecto.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de productivité qui ont besoin d''une automatisation et d''une gestion de flux de travail complètes du cycle de vie du projet.","de":"Perfekt für Produktivitätsagenten, die eine umfassende Automatisierung und Workflow-Verwaltung des gesamten Projekt-Lebenszyklus benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Produtividade que necessitam de automação abrangente do ciclo de vida do projeto e gerenciamento de fluxo de trabalho.","ru":"Идеально для агентов производительности, которым требуется всесторонняя автоматизация жизненного цикла проекта и управление рабочим процессом.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الإنتاجية الذين يحتاجون إلى ت автомatisation شاملة لدورة حياة المشروع وإدارة سير العمل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate project workflows using 9 integrated slash commands, streamlining idea validation, planning, execution, and release, while preserving context and saving 35-55 minutes per project lifecycle, utilizing protocols like manual installation and marketplace plugins.","zh":"使代理能够使用 9 个集成的斜杠命令来自动化项目工作流，简化想法验证、规划、执行和发布，同时保持上下文并节省每个项目生命周期 35-55 分钟，利用手动安装和市场插件等协议。","ja":"エージェントが 9 つの統合スラッシュコマンドを使用してプロジェクトのワークフローを自動化できるようにし、アイデアの検証、計画、実行、リリースを簡素化し、コンテキストを保持しながら、プロジェクトライフサイクルごとに 35 〜 55 分を節約し、手動インストールやマーケットプレイグインなどのプロトコルを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 9개의 통합 슬래시 명령을 사용하여 프로젝트 워크플ロー 자동화를 가능하게 하여 아이디어 검증, 계획, 실행, 출시를 간소화하고, 컨텍스트를 유지하며 각 프로젝트 生命周期당 35〜55분을 절약하며, 수동 설치 및 시장 플러그인과 같은 프로토콜을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de trabajo de proyectos utilizando 9 comandos integrados de barra, racionalizando la validación de ideas, la planificación, la ejecución y la publicación, mientras se conserva el contexto y se ahorran 35-55 minutos por ciclo de vida del proyecto, utilizando protocolos como la instalación manual y los plugins del marketplace.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les flux de travail de projet en utilisant 9 commandes intégrées de barre oblique, rationalisant la validation des idées, la planification, l''exécution et la publication, tout en préservant le contexte et en économisant 35-55 minutes par cycle de vie du projet, en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''installation manuelle et les plugins du marketplace.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Projekt-Workflows mit 9 integrierten Schrägstrich-Befehlen zu automatisieren, die Ideenvalidierung, Planung, Ausführung und Veröffentlichung zu rationalisieren und den Kontext zu erhalten und 35-55 Minuten pro Projekt-Lebenszyklus zu sparen, indem Protokolle wie manuelle Installation und Marketplace-Plugins verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de trabalho de projeto usando 9 comandos de barra integrados, simplificando a validação de ideias, planejamento, execução e lançamento, preservando o contexto e economizando 35-55 minutos por ciclo de vida do projeto, utilizando protocolos como instalação manual e plugins de marketplace.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать рабочие процессы проекта с помощью 9 интегрированных команд-слэшей, упрощая проверку идей, планирование, выполнение и выпуск, сохраняя контекст и экономя 35-55 минут на жизненный цикл проекта, используя протоколы, такие как ручная установка и плагины рынка.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ت자동 hoá سير عمل المشروع باستخدام 9 أوامر منقطة متكاملة، مبسطّة التحقق من الفكر والتخطيط والتنفيذ والإصدار، والحفاظ على السياق واقتصاد 35-55 دقيقة لكل دورة حياة للمشروع، مستخدمة بروتوكولات مثل التثبيت اليدوي وإضافات السوق."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating project lifecycles with idea validation and planning","Streamlining execution and session management","Preserving context for efficient project release"],"zh":["使用想法验证和规划自动化项目生命周期","简化执行和会话管理","为高效的项目发布保留上下文"],"ja":["アイデアの検証と計画を使用したプロジェクトライフサイクルの自動化","実行とセッションの管理を簡素化する","効率的なプロジェクトのリリースのためにコンテキストを保持する"],"ko":["아이디어 검증 및 계획을 사용한 프로젝트 生命周期 자동화","실행 및 세션 관리를 간소화","효율적인 프로젝트 출시를 위한 컨텍스트 유지"],"es":["Automatización de ciclos de vida de proyectos con validación y planificación de ideas","Racionalización de la ejecución y la gestión de sesiones","Conservación del contexto para una publicación de proyecto eficiente"],"fr":["Automatisation des cycles de vie de projet avec validation et planification d''idées","Rationalisation de l''exécution et de la gestion de sessions","Préservation du contexte pour une publication de projet efficace"],"de":["Automatisierung von Projekt-Lebenszyklen mit Ideenvalidierung und -planung","Rationalisierung der Ausführung und Sitzungsverwaltung","Erhaltung des Kontexts für eine effiziente Projektveröffentlichung"],"pt":["Automatizar ciclos de vida de projetos com validação e planejamento de ideias","Simplificar a execução e gerenciamento de sessão","Preservar o contexto para uma liberação eficiente de projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать жизненные циклы проектов с проверкой и планированием идей","Упростить выполнение и управление сессиями","Сохранять контекст для эффективного выпуска проекта"],"ar":["ت خودوم أتية دورة حياة المشروع مع التحقق من الفكر والتخطيط","تبسيط التنفيذ وإدارة الجلسة","الحفاظ على السياق من أجل إصدارโครงการ有效"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Claude Code compatibility","Manual installation or marketplace plugin required"],"zh":["需要 Claude 代码兼容性","需要手动安装或市场插件"],"ja":["Claude コードの互換性が必要","手動インストールまたはマーケットプレイグインが必要"],"ko":["Claude 코드 호환성 필요","수동 설치 또는 시장 플러그인이 필요"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Claude Code","Se requiere instalación manual o plugin del marketplace"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Claude Code","L''installation manuelle ou le plugin du marketplace est requis"],"de":["Benötigt Claude-Code-Kompatibilität","Manuelle Installation oder Marketplace-Plugin erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com o Código Claude","Instalação manual ou plugin de marketplace necessário"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Кодом Claude","Требуется ручная установка или плагин рынка"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع كود كلود","يتطلب تثبيت يدويا أو إضافة سوق"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"fccd42a49848b65d2902f2c5361f5d6df35e8f3576742d0df7874ef4b1fda9ff","qualityScore":55}');
