와줍니다","es":"Aprende a optimizar el rendimiento de tus aplicaciones Angular con técnicas como OnPush y carga diferida","fr":"Découvrez comment optimiser les performances de vos applications Angular avec des techniques comme OnPush et chargement différé","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie die Leistung Ihrer Angular-Anwendungen mit Techniken wie OnPush und verzögerter Ladung optimieren","pt":"Otimização de desempenho em Angular para melhorar a velocidade e eficiência do seu aplicativo","ru":"Оптимизация производительности в Angular для улучшения скорости и эффективности вашего приложения","ar":"تحسين الأداء في أنجولار لتحسين السرعة والكفاءة لتطبيقك","en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"definition":{"en":"The most comprehensive Claude Code skills registry | Web Search: https://skills-registry-web.vercel.app"},"features":{"zh":["OnPush变更检测策略","Deferrable Views延迟加载","Images优化","Zoneless Angular支持","TrackBy功能"],"ja":["OnPush変化検出戦略","Deferrable Views遅延ロード","Images最適化","Zoneless Angularサポート","TrackBy機能"],"ko":["OnPush 변경 감지 전략","Deferrable Views 지연 로딩","Images 최적화","Zoneless Angular 지원","TrackBy 기능"],"es":["Estrategia de detección de cambios OnPush","Carga diferida de componentes pesados","Optimización de imágenes con NgOptimizedImage","Preparación para Zoneless Angular","Uso de Signals para evitar hacks de Zone.runOutsideAngular","Implementación de TrackBy para mejorar el rendimiento"],"fr":["Stratégie de détection de changements OnPush","Chargement différé de composants lourds","Optimisation d''images avec NgOptimizedImage","Préparation pour Zoneless Angular","Utilisation de Signals pour éviter les hacks de Zone.runOutsideAngular","Implémentation de TrackBy pour améliorer les performances"],"de":["Änderungserkennungsstrategie OnPush","Verzögerte Ladung von schweren Komponenten","Optimierung von Bildern mit NgOptimizedImage","Vorbereitung auf Zoneless Angular","Verwendung von Signals, um Zone.runOutsideAngular-Hacks zu vermeiden","Implementierung von TrackBy zur Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["Uso de ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Carregamento lento de componentes com @defer","Otimização de imagens com NgOptimizedImage","Preparação para Zoneless Angular","Uso de TrackBy para melhorar a performance"],"ru":["Использование ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","Ленивая загрузка компонентов с @defer","Оптимизация изображений с NgOptimizedImage","Подготовка к Zoneless Angular","Использование TrackBy для улучшения производительности"],"ar":["استخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","تحميل متأخر للمكونات باستخدام @defer","تحسين الصور باستخدام NgOptimizedImage","الاستعداد ل Zoneless Angular","استخدام TrackBy لتحسين الأداء"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Angular性能优化","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images优化","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy","Angular开发","性能优化最佳实践"],"ja":["Angularパフォーマンス最適化","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images最適化","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy","Angular開発","パフォーマンス最適化ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Angular 성능 최적화","OnPush","Deferrable Views","Images 최적화","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy","Angular 개발","성능 최적화最佳 실천 방법"],"es":["optimización de rendimiento","Angular","OnPush","carga diferida","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","Signals","TrackBy","desarrollo de aplicaciones","mejora del rendimiento"],"fr":["optimisation des performances","Angular","OnPush","chargement différé","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","Signals","TrackBy","développement d''applications","amélioration des performances"],"de":["Leistungsoptimierung","Angular","OnPush","verzögerte Ladung","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","Signals","TrackBy","Anwendungsentwicklung","Leistungsverbesserung"],"pt":["otimização de desempenho","angular","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","carregamento lento","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy"],"ru":["оптимизация производительности","angular","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","ленивая загрузка","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy"],"ar":["تحسين الأداء","أنجولار","ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush","تحميل متأخر","NgOptimizedImage","Zoneless Angular","TrackBy"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.581Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"Performance","description":"Optimization techniques including OnPush, @defer, and Image Optimization.","bodyPreview":"# Performance\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **OnPush**: Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`. Components should only update when Inputs change or Signals fire.\n- **Deferrable Views**: Use `@defer` to lazy load heavy components/chunks below the fold.\n- **Images**: Use `NgOptimizedImage` (`ngSrc`) for LCP optimization.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Zoneless**: Prepare for Zoneless Angular by avoiding `Zone.runOutsideAngular` hacks. Use Signals.\n- **TrackBy**: Always provide a tracking","body":"# Performance\n\n## **Priority: P1 (HIGH)**\n\n## Principles\n\n- **OnPush**: Always use `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`. Components should only update when Inputs change or Signals fire.\n- **Deferrable Views**: Use `@defer` to lazy load heavy components/chunks below the fold.\n- **Images**: Use `NgOptimizedImage` (`ngSrc`) for LCP optimization.\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **Zoneless**: Prepare for Zoneless Angular by avoiding `Zone.runOutsideAngular` hacks. Use Signals.\n- **TrackBy**: Always provide a tracking function in loops (`@for (item of items; track item.id)`).\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Functions in Template**: `{{ calculate() }}` causes re-evaluation on every change detection cycle. Use `computed()` signals or pure pipes.\n- **Heavy Constructors**: Keep constructors empty. Use `ngOnInit` or effects.\n\n## References\n\n- [Defer Usage](references/defer-usage.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-20T05:12:05.337Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Angular-based AI Agents requiring optimized rendering and change detection strategies.","zh":"适用于需要优化渲染和变更检测策略的 Angular 基础 AI 代理。","ja":"Angular ベースの AI エージェントが最適なレンダリングと変更検出戦略を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"최적화된 렌더링 및 변경 감지 전략이 필요한 Angular 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Angular que requieren estrategias de renderizado y detección de cambios optimizadas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA basés sur Angular nécessitant des stratégies de rendu et de détection de modifications optimisées.","de":"Ideal für Angular-basierte KI-Agents, die optimierte Rendering- und Änderungserkennungsstrategien erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em Angular que necessitam de renderização otimizada e estratégias de detecção de alterações.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Angular, требующих оптимизированного рендеринга и стратегий обнаружения изменений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى Angular الذي يتطلب تصييرًا محسّنًا واستراتيجيات كشف التغييرات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize component updates using ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, lazy load heavy components with @defer, and leverage NgOptimizedImage for LCP optimization, ensuring seamless user experiences with reduced latency.","zh":"赋予代理使用 ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush 优化组件更新，使用 @defer 延迟加载重组件，并利用 NgOptimizedImage 进行 LCP 优化，从而确保用户体验顺畅，延迟减少。","ja":"ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush を使用してコンポーネントの更新を最適化し、@defer を使用して重いコンポーネントを遅延ロードし、NgOptimizedImage を使用して LCP を最適化することで、ユーザー エクスペリエンスがスムーズになり、待ち時間が短縮されるようにエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"에이전트가 ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush를 사용하여 컴포넌트 업데이트를 최적화하고, @defer를 사용하여 무거운 컴포넌트를 지연 로딩하며, NgOptimizedImage를 사용하여 LCP를 최적화하여 사용자 경험을 개선하고 대기 시간을 줄이는 데 도움이 됩니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar las actualizaciones de componentes utilizando ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, cargar con retraso componentes pesados con @defer y aprovechar NgOptimizedImage para la optimización de LCP, garantizando experiencias de usuario fluidas con latencia reducida.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les mises à jour de composants en utilisant ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, de charger avec retard les composants lourds avec @defer et d''utiliser NgOptimizedImage pour l''optimisation de LCP, garantissant ainsi des expériences utilisateur fluides avec une latence réduite.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Komponenten-Updates mit ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush zu optimieren, schwere Komponenten mit @defer lazy zu laden und NgOptimizedImage für die LCP-Optimierung zu nutzen, um so eine nahtlose Benutzererfahrung mit reduzierter Latenz zu gewährleisten.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a otimizar as atualizações de componentes usando ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, carregar componentes pesados com @defer e aproveitar NgOptimizedImage para otimização do LCP, garantindo experiências de usuário sem interrupções com latência reduzida.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать обновления компонентов с помощью ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, отложенно загружать тяжелые компоненты с @defer и использовать NgOptimizedImage для оптимизации LCP, обеспечивая бесперебойный пользовательский опыт с уменьшенной задержкой.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على تحسين تحديثات المكونات باستخدام ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush وتحميل المكونات الثقيلة باستخدام @defer وتحسين NgOptimizedImage لتحسين نتائج LCP، مما يضمن تجربة المستخدم دون انقطاع مع تقليل التأخير."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing OnPush change detection for efficient component updates","Lazy loading deferrable views to enhance page load times","Optimizing images with NgOptimizedImage for improved LCP scores"],"zh":["实现 OnPush 变更检测以高效更新组件","延迟加载可延迟视图以提高页面加载速度","使用 NgOptimizedImage 优化图像以提高 LCP 得分"],"ja":["効率的なコンポーネントの更新のために OnPush 変更検出を実装する","ページの読み込み時間を向上させるために遅延可能なビューを遅延ロードする","LCP スコアを向上させるために NgOptimizedImage を使用して画像を最適化する"],"ko":["효율적인 컴포넌트 업데이트를 위한 OnPush 변경 감지 구현","페이지 로딩 시간을 개선하기 위한 지연 가능한 뷰의 지연 로딩","LCP 점수를 개선하기 위한 NgOptimizedImage를 사용한 이미지 최적화"],"es":["Implementación de la detección de cambios OnPush para actualizaciones de componentes eficientes","Carga diferida de vistas posponibles para mejorar los tiempos de carga de página","Optimización de imágenes con NgOptimizedImage para mejorar las puntuaciones de LCP"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de la détection de modifications OnPush pour des mises à jour de composants efficaces","Chargement différé de vues différables pour améliorer les temps de chargement de page","Optimisation des images avec NgOptimizedImage pour améliorer les scores de LCP"],"de":["Implementierung der OnPush-Änderungserkennung für effiziente Komponenten-Updates","Lazy-Laden von verschiebbaren Ansichten, um die Ladezeiten von Seiten zu verbessern","Optimierung von Bildern mit NgOptimizedImage, um die LCP-Bewertungen zu verbessern"],"pt":["Implementação da detecção de alterações OnPush para atualizações de componentes eficientes","Carregamento lento de visualizações adiáveis para melhorar os tempos de carregamento de página","Otimização de imagens com NgOptimizedImage para melhorar os resultados do LCP"],"ru":["Реализация обнаружения изменений OnPush для эффективных обновлений компонентов","Ленивая загрузка отложенных представлений для улучшения времени загрузки страницы","Оптимизация изображений с помощью NgOptimizedImage для улучшения результатов LCP"],"ar":["تنفيذ كشف التغييرات OnPush لتحديثات المكونات الفعالة","تحميل متأخر للمشاهد القابلة للتأجيل لتحسين أوقات تحميل الصفحة","تحسين الصور مع NgOptimizedImage لتحسين نتائج LCP"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Angular framework","Zoneless Angular preparation necessary","NgOptimizedImage dependency needed"],"zh":["需要 Angular 框架","Zoneless Angular 准备是必要的","需要 NgOptimizedImage 依赖"],"ja":["Angular フレームワークが必要","Zoneless Angular の準備が必要","NgOptimizedImage 依存関係が必要"],"ko":["Angular 프레임워크가 필요합니다","Zoneless Angular 준비가 필요합니다","NgOptimizedImage 의존성이 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere el marco de Angular","Preparación de Angular sin zona necesaria","Se requiere la dependencia de NgOptimizedImage"],"fr":["Nécessite le framework Angular","Préparation d''Angular sans zone nécessaire","Dépendance de NgOptimizedImage requise"],"de":["Benötigt das Angular-Framework","Vorbereitung von Angular ohne Zone erforderlich","NgOptimizedImage-Abhängigkeit erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige estrutura Angular","Preparação do Angular sem zona necessária","Dependência de NgOptimizedImage necessária"],"ru":["Требует框架 Angular","Необходима подготовка Angular без зоны","Требуется зависимость от NgOptimizedImage"],"ar":["يتطلب إطار Angular","التحضير بدون منطقة للانجولار ضروري","التع赖 على NgOptimizedImage ضروري"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"430b6d4b302f7276424b89ed0b11a8b59e9fb9c672db17b69b40a700266a1775","qualityScore":55}');
