,"AI 에이전트 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Agentes de IA","qué es un Agente de IA","alternative a Agentes de IA","Agentes de IA vs herramientas de machine learning","instalación de Agentes de IA","guía de configuración de Agentes de IA"],"fr":["comment utiliser les Agents d''IA","qu''est-ce qu''un Agent d''IA","alternative aux Agents d''IA","Agents d''IA vs outils de machine learning","installation des Agents d''IA","guide de configuration des Agents d''IA"],"de":["wie man AI-Agents verwendet","was ist ein AI-Agent","Alternative zu AI-Agents","AI-Agents vs Machine-Learning-Tools","Installation von AI-Agents","Einrichtungsanleitung für AI-Agents"],"pt":["como usar agente de ia","o que é agente de ia","agente de ia alternative","agente de ia vs competitors","instalar agente de ia","guia de configuração do agente de ia","desenvolvimento de funções de ai","validação de suporte de provedores"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агент","что такое ИИ Агент","ИИ Агент alternative","ИИ Агент vs конкуренты","установить ИИ Агент","руководство по настройке ИИ Агента","разработка функций ИИ","проверка поддержки провайдеров"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","بديل وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي مقابل المنافسين","تثبيت وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","دليل إعداد وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير دوال الذكاء الاصطناعي","تأكيد دعم المزودين"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"develop-ai-functions-example","description":"Develop examples for AI SDK functions. Use when creating, running, or modifying examples under examples/ai-functions/src to validate provider support, demonstrate features, or create test fixtures.","bodyPreview":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stre","body":"## AI Functions Examples\n\nThe `examples/ai-functions/` directory contains scripts for validating, testing, and iterating on AI SDK functions across providers.\n\n## Example Categories\n\nExamples are organized by AI SDK function in `examples/ai-functions/src/`:\n\n| Directory          | Purpose                                              |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `generate-text/`   | Non-streaming text generation with `generateText()`  |\n| `stream-text/`     | Streaming text generation with `streamText()`        |\n| `generate-object/` | Structured output generation with `generateObject()` |\n| `stream-object/`   | Streaming structured output with `streamObject()`    |\n| `agent/`           | `ToolLoopAgent` examples for agentic workflows       |\n| `embed/`           | Single embedding generation with `embed()`           |\n| `embed-many/`      | Batch embedding generation with `embedMany()`        |\n| `generate-image/`  | Image generation with `generateImage()`              |\n| `generate-speech/` | Text-to-speech with `generateSpeech()`               |\n| `transcribe/`      | Audio transcription with `transcribe()`              |\n| `rerank/`          | Document reranking with `rerank()`                   |\n| `middleware/`      | Custom middleware implementations                    |\n| `registry/`        | Provider registry setup and usage                    |\n| `telemetry/`       | OpenTelemetry integration                            |\n| `complex/`         | Multi-component examples (agents, routers)           |\n| `lib/`             | Shared utilities (not examples)                      |\n| `tools/`           | Reusable tool definitions                            |\n\n## File Naming Convention\n\nExamples follow the pattern: `{provider}-{feature}.ts`\n\n| Pattern                                  | Example                                    | Description                |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `{provider}.ts`                          | `openai.ts`                                | Basic provider usage       |\n| `{provider}-{feature}.ts`                | `openai-tool-call.ts`                      | Specific feature           |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}.ts`           | `amazon-bedrock-anthropic.ts`              | Provider with sub-provider |\n| `{provider}-{sub-provider}-{feature}.ts` | `google-vertex-anthropic-cache-control.ts` | Sub-provider with feature  |\n\n## Example Structure\n\nAll examples use the `run()` wrapper from `lib/run.ts` which:\n\n- Loads environment variables from `.env`\n- Provides error handling with detailed API error logging\n\n### Basic Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateText } from ''ai'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    prompt: ''Your prompt here.'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(result.text);\n  console.log(''Token usage:'', result.usage);\n  console.log(''Finish reason:'', result.finishReason);\n});\n```\n\n### Streaming Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { streamText } from ''ai'';\nimport { printFullStream } from ''../lib/print-full-stream'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = streamText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    prompt: ''Your prompt here.'',\n  });\n\n  await printFullStream({ result });\n});\n```\n\n### Tool Calling Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateText, tool } from ''ai'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateText({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    tools: {\n      myTool: tool({\n        description: ''Tool description'',\n        inputSchema: z.object({\n          param: z.string().describe(''Parameter description''),\n        }),\n        execute: async ({ param }) => {\n          return { result: `Processed: ${param}` };\n        },\n      }),\n    },\n    prompt: ''Use the tool to...'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(result, null, 2));\n});\n```\n\n### Structured Output Template\n\n```typescript\nimport { providerName } from ''@ai-sdk/provider-name'';\nimport { generateObject } from ''ai'';\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\nimport { run } from ''../lib/run'';\n\nrun(async () => {\n  const result = await generateObject({\n    model: providerName(''model-id''),\n    schema: z.object({\n      name: z.string(),\n      items: z.array(z.string()),\n    }),\n    prompt: ''Generate a...'',\n  });\n\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(result.object, null, 2));\n  console.log(''Token usage:'', result.usage);\n});\n```\n\n## Running Examples\n\nFrom the `examples/ai-functions` directory:\n\n```bash\npnpm tsx src/generate-text/openai.ts\npnpm tsx src/stream-text/openai-tool-call.ts\npnpm tsx src/agent/openai-generate.ts\n```\n\n## When to Write Examples\n\nWrite examples when:\n\n1. **Adding a new provider**: Create basic examples for each supported API (`generateText`, `streamText`, `generateObject`, etc.)\n\n2. **Implementing a new feature**: Demonstrate the feature with at least one provider example\n\n3. **Reproducing a bug**: Create an example that shows the issue for debugging\n\n4. **Adding provider-specific options**: Show how to use `providerOptions` for provider-specific settings\n\n5. **Creating test fixtures**: Use examples to generate API response fixtures (see `capture-api-response-test-fixture` skill)\n\n## Utility Helpers\n\nThe `lib/` directory contains shared utilities:\n\n| File                   | Purpose                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `run.ts`               | Error-handling wrapper with `.env` loading               |\n| `print.ts`             | Clean object printing (removes undefined values)         |\n| `print-full-stream.ts` | Colored streaming output for tool calls, reasoning, text |\n| `save-raw-chunks.ts`   | Save streaming chunks for test fixtures                  |\n| `present-image.ts`     | Display images in terminal                               |\n| `save-audio.ts`        | Save audio files to disk                                 |\n\n### Using print utilities\n\n```typescript\nimport { print } from ''../lib/print'';\n\n// Pretty print objects without undefined values\nprint(''Result:'', result);\nprint(''Usage:'', result.usage, { depth: 2 });\n```\n\n### Using printFullStream\n\n```typescript\nimport { printFullStream } from ''../lib/print-full-stream'';\n\nconst result = streamText({ ... });\nawait printFullStream({ result }); // Colored output for text, tool calls, reasoning\n```\n\n## Reusable Tools\n\nThe `tools/` directory contains reusable tool definitions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { weatherTool } from ''../tools/weather-tool'';\n\nconst result = await generateText({\n  model: openai(''gpt-4o''),\n  tools: { weather: weatherTool },\n  prompt: ''What is the weather in San Francisco?'',\n});\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Keep examples focused**: Each example should demonstrate one feature or use case\n\n2. **Use descriptive prompts**: Make it clear what the example is testing\n\n3. **Handle errors gracefully**: The `run()` wrapper handles this automatically\n\n4. **Use realistic model IDs**: Use actual model IDs that work with the provider\n\n5. **Add comments for complex logic**: Explain non-obvious code patterns\n\n6. **Reuse tools when appropriate**: Use `weatherTool` or create new reusable tools in `tools/`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:21:33.291Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced AI SDK function validation and testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级AI SDK函数验证和测试能力的AI代理。","ja":"高度なAI SDKの機能検証とテスト機能が必要なAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 AI SDK 함수 검증 및 테스트 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de validación y prueba de funciones de SDK de IA.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA nécessitant des capacités avancées de validation et de test de fonctions de SDK de IA.","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Funktionen zur Überprüfung und zum Testen von KI-SDK-Funktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de validação e teste de funções de SDK de IA.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности проверки и тестирования функций SDK ИИ.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتحقق واختبار وظائف SDK الاصطناعي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate and test AI SDK functions across providers using scripts in the `examples/ai-functions/` directory, supporting non-streaming text generation with `generateText()` and other AI functions via organized example categories.","zh":"使代理能够通过`examples/ai-functions/`目录中的脚本来验证和测试AI SDK函数，支持非流式文本生成，通过有组织的示例类别使用`generateText()`和其他AI函数。","ja":"エージェントが`examples/ai-functions/`ディレクトリ内のスクリプトを使用してAI SDKの機能を検証およびテストできるようにし、ストリーミング以外のテキスト生成をサポートし、`generateText()`およびその他のAI関数を組織化されたカテゴリの例を介して使用できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 `examples/ai-functions/` 디렉토리内の 스크립트를 사용하여 AI SDK 함수를 검증 및 테스트할 수 있도록 하며, 스트리밍이 아닌 텍스트 생성을 지원하며, `generateText()` 및 기타 AI 함수를 구성된 예제 카테고리에서 사용할 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar y probar funciones de SDK de IA a través de proveedores utilizando scripts en el directorio `examples/ai-functions/`, que admiten la generación de texto no en streaming con `generateText()` y otras funciones de IA a través de categorías de ejemplos organizadas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider et de tester les fonctions de SDK de IA à travers les fournisseurs en utilisant des scripts dans le répertoire `examples/ai-functions/`, qui prennent en charge la génération de texte non en streaming avec `generateText()` et d''autres fonctions de IA via des catégories d''exemples organisées.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, KI-SDK-Funktionen über Anbieter hinweg zu validieren und zu testen, indem Skripte im Verzeichnis `examples/ai-functions/` verwendet werden, die die nicht-streaming Textgenerierung mit `generateText()` und anderen KI-Funktionen über organisierte Beispielskategorien unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar e testar funções de SDK de IA em vários provedores usando scripts no diretório `examples/ai-functions/`, suportando geração de texto não em streaming com `generateText()` e outras funções de IA por meio de categorias de exemplos organizadas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять и тестировать функции SDK ИИ у различных поставщиков, используя скрипты в каталоге `examples/ai-functions/`, поддерживая генерацию текста без потоковой передачи с помощью `generateText()` и других функций ИИ через организованные категории примеров.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على التحقق من صحة وظائف SDK الاصطناعي وتجربتها عبر مزودي الخدمة باستخدام البرامج النصية في الدليل `examples/ai-functions/`، ودعم توليد النص غير المتدفق باستخدام `generateText()` وأدوات الاصطناعي الأخرى من خلال فئات الأمثلة المنظمة."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating AI SDK functions","Testing text generation capabilities","Iterating on AI functions across providers"],"zh":["验证AI SDK函数","测试文本生成能力","跨提供商迭代AI函数"],"ja":["AI SDKの機能を検証する","テキスト生成機能をテストする","提供者を横断してAI関数を反復する"],"ko":["AI SDK 함수를 검증하다","텍스트 생성 기능을 테스트하다","공급자를横断하여 AI 함수를 반복하다"],"es":["Validar funciones de SDK de IA","Probar capacidades de generación de texto","Iterar sobre funciones de IA a través de proveedores"],"fr":["Valider les fonctions de SDK de IA","Tester les capacités de génération de texte","Itérer sur les fonctions de IA à travers les fournisseurs"],"de":["KI-SDK-Funktionen überprüfen","Textgenerierungsfähigkeiten testen","Iterieren über KI-Funktionen über Anbieter hinweg"],"pt":["Validar funções de SDK de IA","Testar capacidades de geração de texto","Iterar sobre funções de IA em vários provedores"],"ru":["Проверка функций SDK ИИ","Тестирование возможностей генерации текста","Итерация по функциям ИИ у различных поставщиков"],"ar":["التحقق من صحة وظائف SDK الاصطناعي","تجربة إمكانات توليد النص","التكرار على أدوات الاصطناعي عبر مزودي الخدمة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to AI SDK functions","Limited to organized example categories in `examples/ai-functions/src/`"],"zh":["需要访问AI SDK函数","仅限于`examples/ai-functions/src/`中的有组织的示例类别"],"ja":["AI SDKの機能にアクセスする必要がある","`examples/ai-functions/src/`内の組織化されたカテゴリのみに限定される"],"ko":["AI SDK 함수에 액세스해야 함","`examples/ai-functions/src/`의 구성된 카테고리만으로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a funciones de SDK de IA","Limitado a categorías de ejemplos organizadas en `examples/ai-functions/src/`"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fonctions de SDK de IA","Limité aux catégories d''exemples organisées dans `examples/ai-functions/src/`"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf KI-SDK-Funktionen","Begrenzt auf organisierte Beispielskategorien in `examples/ai-functions/src/`"],"pt":["Requer acesso às funções de SDK de IA","Limitado a categorias de exemplos organizadas em `examples/ai-functions/src/`"],"ru":["Требует доступа к функциям SDK ИИ","Ограничен организованными категориями примеров в `examples/ai-functions/src/`"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى وظائف SDK الاصطناعي","محدود بالفئات المنظمة للأمثلة في `examples/ai-functions/src/`"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9d77f7652e8edda503bb95db8032db3ce781904c4444ec22ecdc307e3ac7fc0d","qualityScore":55}');
