الاعتمادات الدورية في مشاريع Elixir."},"features":{"en":["Detects cyclic dependencies using Elixir 1.19 or higher","Removes cyclic dependencies with explicit user requests","Verifies Elixir version using `elixir -v` or `mix run -e ''IO.inspect(System.version())''`","Stops and informs users if Elixir version is below 1.19","Uses `mix run` for cycle checks"],"zh":["支持 Elixir 1.19 或更高版本","检测和删除循环依赖","优化代码结构","使用 CLI 运行","与 Elixir 项目集成","提高代码可维护性"],"ja":["Elixir 1.19 以降をサポート","サイクル依存を検知して削除","コード構造の最適化","CLI での実行","Elixir プロジェクトとの統合","コードの保守性の向上"],"ko":["Elixir 1.19 이상 지원","순환 의존성을 발견하고 제거","코드 구조 최적화","CLI에서 실행","Elixir 프로젝트와의 통합","코드의 유지 보수성 향상"],"es":["Detección de dependencias cíclicas en proyectos Elixir","Eliminación de dependencias cíclicas con línea de comandos","Compatibilidad con Elixir 1.19 o superior","Verificación de versión de Elixir antes de ejecutar comandos","Soporte para comandos como ''check for cycles'' y ''remove cyclic dependencies''"],"fr":["Détection de dépendances cycliques dans les projets Elixir","Suppression de dépendances cycliques avec ligne de commande","Compatibilité avec Elixir 1.19 ou supérieur","Vérification de la version d''Elixir avant d''exécuter des commandes","Prise en charge des commandes comme ''check for cycles'' et ''remove cyclic dependencies''"],"de":["Erkennung zyklischer Abhängigkeiten in Elixir-Projekten","Entfernen zyklischer Abhängigkeiten mit Befehlszeile","Kompatibilität mit Elixir 1.19 oder höher","Überprüfung der Elixir-Version vor Ausführung von Befehlen","Unterstützung für Befehle wie ''check for cycles'' und ''remove cyclic dependencies''"],"pt":["Detecção de dependências cíclicas em projetos Elixir 1.19 ou superiores","Remoção de dependências cíclicas","Compatibilidade com Elixir 1.19 ou superior","Verificação de versão do Elixir","Suporte à linha de comando (CLI)"],"ru":["Обнаружение циклических зависимостей в проектах Elixir 1.19 или выше","Удаление циклических зависимостей","Совместимость с Elixir 1.19 или выше","Проверка версии Elixir","Поддержка командной строки (CLI)"],"ar":["الكشف عن الاعتمادات الدورية في مشاريع Elixir 1.19 أو أعلى","إزالة الاعتمادات الدورية","التوافق مع Elixir 1.19 أو أعلى","التحقق من إصدار Elixir","دعم سطر الأوامر (CLI)"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use elixir-cyclic-deps","elixir-cyclic-deps setup guide","elixir cyclic dependency removal","elixir 1.19 compatibility","ai agent for elixir development","elixir-cyclic-deps vs other dependency managers"],"zh":["Elixir 循环依赖检测","Elixir 项目优化","smol 编码代理","AI エージェント","Elixir 1.19","循环依赖删除","代码结构优化","CLI工具"],"ja":["Elixir サイクル依存解消","Elixir プロジェクト最適化","smol コーディング エージェント","AIエージェント","Elixir 1.19","サイクル依存削除","コード構造最適化","CLIツール"],"ko":["Elixir 순환 의존성 제거","Elixir 프로젝트 최적화","smol 코딩 에이전트","AI 에이전트","Elixir 1.19","순환 의존성 삭제","코드 구조 최적화","CLI 도구"],"es":["agentes de código","herramientas de línea de comandos","Elixir","dependencias cíclicas","eliminación de dependencias","detección de dependencias","Elixir 1.19","línea de comandos"],"fr":["agents de codage","outils de ligne de commande","Elixir","dépendances cycliques","suppression de dépendances","détection de dépendances","Elixir 1.19","ligne de commande"],"de":["Code-Agenten","Befehlszeilen-Tools","Elixir","zyklische Abhängigkeiten","Entfernen von Abhängigkeiten","Erkennung von Abhängigkeiten","Elixir 1.19","Befehlszeile"],"pt":["Elixir Cyclic Deps","dependências cíclicas","Elixir 1.19","CLI","agente de codificação","desenvolvimento de software","programação em Elixir"],"ru":["Elixir Cyclic Deps","циклические зависимости","Elixir 1.19","CLI","агент кодирования","разработка программного обеспечения","программирование на Elixir"],"ar":["Elixir Cyclic Deps","الاعتمادات الدورية","Elixir 1.19","CLI","عميل ترميز","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة بلغة Elixir"]}},"owner":"matteing","repo":"opal","repoPath":"matteing/opal","stars":18,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-25T08:11:08Z","topics":["agents","ai","ai-agents","cli","elixir","llm"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"elixir-cyclic-deps","description":"Detects and removes cyclic compile-time dependencies in Elixir codebases using mix xref, with minimal code changes. Use when the user explicitly asks to check for cycles, remove cyclic dependencies, or fix xref cycle failures. Requires Elixir 1.19 or higher for accurate results.","bodyPreview":"# Elixir Cyclic Dependencies\n\n## When to Use\n\nApply this skill only when the user **explicitly asks** to check or remove cyclic dependencies (e.g. \"check for cycles\", \"remove cyclic dependencies\", \"fix xref cycles\").\n\n## Prerequisite: Elixir Version\n\nCycle detection is correct only on **Elixir 1.19 or higher**. Before running any cycle checks:\n\n1. Verify version: `elixir -v` or inside the project run `mix run -e ''IO.inspect(System.version())''`.\n2. If the version is below 1.19, stop and inform th","body":"# Elixir Cyclic Dependencies\n\n## When to Use\n\nApply this skill only when the user **explicitly asks** to check or remove cyclic dependencies (e.g. \"check for cycles\", \"remove cyclic dependencies\", \"fix xref cycles\").\n\n## Prerequisite: Elixir Version\n\nCycle detection is correct only on **Elixir 1.19 or higher**. Before running any cycle checks:\n\n1. Verify version: `elixir -v` or inside the project run `mix run -e ''IO.inspect(System.version())''`.\n2. If the version is below 1.19, stop and inform the user that upgrading to Elixir 1.19+ is required for reliable cycle detection.\n\n## Detecting Cycles\n\nRun both commands from the project root. Start with a relaxed threshold, then tighten:\n\n```bash\nmix xref graph --format cycles --label compile-connected --fail-above 3\nmix xref graph --format cycles --label compile --fail-above 3\n```\n\n- **compile-connected**: cycles in the compile-time dependency graph (modules that compile in a cycle).\n- **compile**: same graph, different label; both should be run.\n- **--fail-above N**: exit code fails when cycle count is above N. Use `3` initially, goal is **0**.\n\nTo list cycles without failing (for inspection), omit `--fail-above` or set it high:\n\n```bash\nmix xref graph --format cycles --label compile-connected\nmix xref graph --format cycles --label compile\n```\n\n**Goal**: reach `--fail-above 0` for both commands (no cycles).\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. **Check Elixir version** (must be ≥ 1.19).\n2. **Establish baseline**: run both xref commands with `--fail-above 3` (or current project setting). Note cycle count and which modules appear in cycles.\n3. **Inspect cycles**: run without `--fail-above` to see full cycle output; identify the smallest set of edges (module A → module B) that, if removed, break cycles.\n4. **Plan minimal changeset**:\n   - Prefer breaking a single dependency (e.g. move shared code to a new module both can depend on) over large refactors.\n   - **Helper modules** are allowed if they yield the smallest change: extract shared logic into a new module that the cycle participants depend on, so the cycle is broken.\n   - Avoid duplication; follow existing repository guidelines (e.g. AGENTS.md, .cursor rules) and prior patterns in the codebase.\n5. **Implement**: make the chosen change, then re-run both xref commands with `--fail-above 0` (or gradually lower from 3 → 0).\n6. **Verify**: `mix compile --warnings-as-errors`, tests, and any project lint (e.g. `mix lint` or `mix cyclecheck` if defined).\n\n## Minimal-Change Strategies\n\n| Strategy                  | When to use                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Extract helper module** | Two or more modules in a cycle need the same logic; extract it to a new module that has no dependency back on the cycle.           |\n| **Move code down**        | Move a function from module A to module B so that A no longer depends on B (or vice versa), breaking the cycle.                    |\n| **Invert dependency**     | If A uses B and B uses A, see if one usage can be replaced by a callback, option, or data structure so only one direction remains. |\n| **Split module**          | One module has two distinct responsibilities and participates in two cycles; split into two modules to break cycles.               |\n\nChoose the option that removes cycles with the **least** code churn and no new duplication.\n\n## Project Integration\n\nIf the project has a `cyclecheck` (or similar) task in `mix.exs`, use it after changes:\n\n```bash\nmix cyclecheck\n```\n\nEnsure it runs both xref commands with the target `--fail-above 0` once cycles are cleared.\n\n## Summary Checklist\n\n- [ ] Elixir version ≥ 1.19 confirmed\n- [ ] Both `compile-connected` and `compile` xref cycle commands run\n- [ ] Goal: `--fail-above 0` for both\n- [ ] Minimal changeset (helper modules OK)\n- [ ] No code duplication; follows repo guidelines\n- [ ] `mix compile`, tests, and lint pass after changes\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:41:51.165Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Elixir Development Agents needing to detect and resolve cyclic dependencies in complex projects","zh":"非常适合需要检测和解决复杂项目中循环依赖的Elixir开发代理","ja":"Elixir開発エージェントが複雑なプロジェクトで循環依存関係を検出および解決する必要がある場合に最適","ko":"복잡한 프로젝트에서 순환 의존성을 검색하고 해결해야 하는 Elixir 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de Elixir que necesitan detectar y resolver dependencias cíclicas en proyectos complejos","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement Elixir qui ont besoin de détecter et de résoudre les dépendances cycliques dans des projets complexes","de":"Perfekt für Elixir-Entwicklungsagenten, die zyklische Abhängigkeiten in komplexen Projekten erkennen und lösen müssen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Elixir que precisam detectar e resolver dependências cíclicas em projetos complexos","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки Elixir, которым необходимо обнаруживать и решать циклические зависимости в сложных проектах","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى اكتشاف وحل الإعتماديات الدورية في مشاريع معقدة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure compatibility with Elixir 1.19 or higher by detecting and removing cyclic dependencies, utilizing Elixir''s built-in cycle detection capabilities and mix tasks","zh":"使代理能够通过检测和删除循环依赖来确保与Elixir 1.19或更高版本的兼容性，利用Elixir的内置循环检测功能和mix任务","ja":"Elixir 1.19以上との互換性を確保するために、循環依存関係を検出して削除することをエージェントに可能にし、Elixirの組み込みのサイクル検出機能とmixタスクを利用","ko":"에이전트가 Elixir의 내장 사이클 감지 기능과 믹스 태스크를 사용하여 순환 종속성을 검색하고 제거함으로써 Elixir 1.19 이상과의 호환성을 보장하도록 합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes garantizar la compatibilidad con Elixir 1.19 o superior detectando y eliminando dependencias cíclicas, utilizando las capacidades de detección de ciclos integradas de Elixir y las tareas de mix","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir la compatibilité avec Elixir 1.19 ou supérieur en détectant et en supprimant les dépendances cycliques, en utilisant les capacités de détection de cycle intégrées d''Elixir et les tâches de mix","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Kompatibilität mit Elixir 1.19 oder höher zu gewährleisten, indem sie zyklische Abhängigkeiten erkennen und entfernen, wobei sie die integrierten Zyklus-Erkennungsfunktionen von Elixir und die Mix-Aufgaben nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a compatibilidade com o Elixir 1.19 ou superior, detectando e removendo dependências cíclicas, utilizando as capacidades de detecção de ciclo incorporadas do Elixir e tarefas mix","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить совместимость с Elixir 1.19 или выше, обнаруживая и удаляя циклические зависимости, используя встроенные возможности обнаружения циклов Elixir и задачи mix","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على ضمان التوافق مع إصدار Elixir 1.19 أو أعلى من خلال اكتشاف وإزالة الإعتماديات الدورية، استخدام القدرات المدمجة للكشف عن الدورة في Elixir ومهام Mix"},"useCases":{"en":["Detecting cyclic dependencies in Elixir projects","Removing xref cycles for improved project stability","Validating Elixir version for correct cycle detection"],"zh":["检测Elixir项目中的循环依赖","删除xref循环以提高项目稳定性","验证Elixir版本以进行正确的循环检测"],"ja":["Elixirプロジェクトで循環依存関係を検出","xrefサイクルを削除してプロジェクトの安定性を向上","サイクル検出のためにElixirバージョンを検証"],"ko":["Elixir 프로젝트에서 순환 종속성을 검색","xref 사이클을 제거하여 프로젝트 안정성을 향상","순환 감지를 위해 Elixir 버전을 확인"],"es":["Detección de dependencias cíclicas en proyectos de Elixir","Eliminación de ciclos de referencia para una mayor estabilidad del proyecto","Validación de la versión de Elixir para una detección de ciclos correcta"],"fr":["Détection de dépendances cycliques dans les projets Elixir","Suppression des cycles de référence pour améliorer la stabilité du projet","Validation de la version d''Elixir pour une détection de cycle correcte"],"de":["Erkennung zyklischer Abhängigkeiten in Elixir-Projekten","Entfernen von Referenzzyklen für eine verbesserte Projektstabilität","Überprüfung der Elixir-Version für eine korrekte Zykluserkennung"],"pt":["Detecção de dependências cíclicas em projetos Elixir","Remoção de ciclos xref para melhorar a estabilidade do projeto","Validação da versão do Elixir para detecção correta de ciclo"],"ru":["Обнаружение циклических зависимостей в проектах Elixir","Удаление циклов xref для улучшения стабильности проекта","Проверка версии Elixir для правильного обнаружения цикла"],"ar":["اكتشاف الإعتماديات الدورية في مشاريع Elixir","إزالة دورات Xref لتحسين استقرار المشروع","التحقق من إصدار Elixir للكشف الدوري الصحيح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Elixir 1.19 or higher","Explicit user request to check or remove cyclic dependencies"],"zh":["需要Elixir 1.19或更高版本","需要用户明确请求检查或删除循环依赖"],"ja":["Elixir 1.19以上が必要","循環依存関係をチェックまたは削除するための明示的なユーザー要求"],"ko":["Elixir 1.19 이상 필요","순환 종속성을 확인 또는 제거하기 위한 명시적 사용자 요청"],"es":["Requiere Elixir 1.19 o superior","Solicitud explícita del usuario para comprobar o eliminar dependencias cíclicas"],"fr":["Nécessite Elixir 1.19 ou supérieur","Demande explicite de l''utilisateur pour vérifier ou supprimer les dépendances cycliques"],"de":["Benötigt Elixir 1.19 oder höher","Explizite Benutzeranfrage zum Überprüfen oder Entfernen zyklischer Abhängigkeiten"],"pt":["Exige Elixir 1.19 ou superior","Solicitação explícita do usuário para verificar ou remover dependências cíclicas"],"ru":["Требует Elixir 1.19 или выше","Явный запрос пользователя на проверку или удаление циклических зависимостей"],"ar":["يتطلب Elixir 1.19 أو أعلى","طلب明حي من المستخدم للتحقق أو إزالة الإعتماديات الدورية"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7dfa7784b5f0410e779d01655e7ba709178453bd124c7b905cd33d9831bbc9d8","qualityScore":54}');
