processus de validation de la fonctionnalité et des performances des applications mobiles","de":"Mobile-App-Tests sind der Prozess der Überprüfung der Funktionalität und Leistung von Mobile-Apps","pt":"Teste de aplicativos móveis é o processo de avaliar a qualidade e o desempenho de aplicativos móveis","ru":"Тестирование мобильных приложений - это процесс оценки качества и производительности мобильных приложений","ar":"اختبار التطبيقات المحمولة هو عملية تقييم جودة وأداء التطبيقات المحمولة"},"features":{"en":["Implements unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing for mobile applications","Supports automating UI testing across iOS and Android using Jest and Detox","Enables performance testing and optimization for mobile apps","Facilitates integration testing with backend services using OpenAPI","Allows for regression testing before releases"],"zh":["使用 React Native 和 Detox 进行 UI 测试","实现单元测试和集成测试","性能测试和优化","支持多服务器和 OpenAPI","跨 iOS 和 Android 进行自动化 UI 测试"],"ja":["React Native と Detox を使用した UI テスト","ユニットテストと統合テストの実装","パフォーマンステストと最適化","マルチサーバーと OpenAPI のサポート","iOS と Android 跨っての自動化 UI テスト"],"ko":["React Native와 Detox를 사용한 UI 테스트","단위 테스트 및 통합 테스트 구현","성능 테스트 및 최적화","다중 서버 및 OpenAPI 지원","iOS 및 Android를跨って 자동화 UI 테스트"],"es":["Implementación de tests unitarios con Jest","Tests de interfaz de usuario con Detox","Tests de integración con servicios backend","Pruebas de rendimiento y optimización","Tests de regresión antes de lanzamientos"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre de tests unitaires avec Jest","Tests d''interface utilisateur avec Detox","Tests d''intégration avec des services backend","Tests de performances et d''optimisation","Tests de régression avant les sorties"],"de":["Implementierung von Unit-Tests mit Jest","UI-Tests mit Detox","Integrationstests mit Backend-Services","Leistungsprüfungen und -optimierung","Rückfalltests vor Veröffentlichungen"],"pt":["Testes unitários e de UI com React Native e Jest","Testes de desempenho e otimização com Flutter","Integração com serviços de backend com OpenAPI","Testes de regressão antes de lançamentos","Suporte a múltiplos servidores com 1Panel"],"ru":["Юнит-тесты и тесты UI с помощью React Native и Jest","Тесты производительности и оптимизация с помощью Flutter","Интеграция с сервисами бэкенда с помощью OpenAPI","Тесты регрессии перед релизами","Поддержка нескольких серверов с помощью 1Panel"],"ar":["اختبارات الوحدوية وواجهة المستخدم مع React Native و Jest","اختبارات الأداء وتحسين الأداء مع Flutter","التكامل مع خدمات الخوادم الخلفية مع OpenAPI","اختبارات الانحدار قبل الإصدارات","دعم الخوادم المتعددة مع 1Panel"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use mobile-app-testing","mobile-app-testing setup guide","what is mobile-app-testing","mobile-app-testing alternative","mobile-app-testing vs Appium","mobile-app-testing install","mobile-app-testing for Flutter","mobile-app-testing for iOS and Android","mobile-app-testing best practices"],"zh":["移动应用测试","React Native","Detox","单元测试","UI 测试","集成测试","性能测试","OpenAPI","多服务器支持"],"ja":["モバイルアプリテスト","React Native","Detox","ユニットテスト","UI テスト","統合テスト","パフォーマンステスト","OpenAPI","マルチサーバーサポート"],"ko":["모바일 앱 테스트","React Native","Detox","단위 테스트","UI 테스트","통합 테스트","성능 테스트","OpenAPI","다중 서버 지원"],"es":["pruebas de aplicaciones móviles","React Native","Jest","Detox","tests unitarios","tests de interfaz de usuario","tests de integración","pruebas de rendimiento","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["tests d''applications mobiles","React Native","Jest","Detox","tests unitaires","tests d''interface utilisateur","tests d''intégration","tests de performances","développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Mobile-App-Tests","React Native","Jest","Detox","Unit-Tests","UI-Tests","Integrationstests","Leistungsprüfungen","Mobile-App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["testes de aplicativos móveis","desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis","testes unitários","testes de UI","testes de desempenho","Flutter","React Native","OpenAPI","1Panel"],"ru":["тестирование мобильных приложений","разработка мобильных приложений","юнит-тесты","тесты UI","тесты производительности","Flutter","React Native","OpenAPI","1Panel"],"ar":["اختبار التطبيقات المحمولة","تطوير التطبيقات المحمولة","اختبارات الوحدوية","اختبارات واجهة المستخدم","اختبارات الأداء","Flutter","React Native","OpenAPI","1Panel"]}},"owner":"IsKenKenYa","repo":"1Panel-Client","repoPath":"IsKenKenYa/1Panel-Client","stars":12,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-24T16:40:52Z","topics":["1panel","android","dart","de-v-o-p-s","devops","devops-tools","flutter","flutter-app","ios","mobile-app","openapi","server-management","unofficial-client"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"mobile-app-testing","description":"Comprehensive mobile app testing strategies for iOS and Android. Covers unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, performance testing, and test automation with Detox, Appium, and XCTest.","bodyPreview":"# Mobile App Testing\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement comprehensive testing strategies for mobile applications including unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating reliable mobile applications with test coverage\n- Automating UI testing across iOS and Android\n- Performance testing and optimization\n- Integration testing with backend services\n- Regression testing before releases\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **React Native Testing with Jest & Detox**\n\n```javascr","body":"# Mobile App Testing\n\n## Overview\n\nImplement comprehensive testing strategies for mobile applications including unit tests, UI tests, integration tests, and performance testing.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Creating reliable mobile applications with test coverage\n- Automating UI testing across iOS and Android\n- Performance testing and optimization\n- Integration testing with backend services\n- Regression testing before releases\n\n## Instructions\n\n### 1. **React Native Testing with Jest & Detox**\n\n```javascript\n// Unit test with Jest\nimport { calculate } from ''../utils/math'';\n\ndescribe(''Math utilities'', () => {\n  test(''should add two numbers'', () => {\n    expect(calculate.add(2, 3)).toBe(5);\n  });\n\n  test(''should handle negative numbers'', () => {\n    expect(calculate.add(-2, 3)).toBe(1);\n  });\n});\n\n// Component unit test\nimport React from ''react'';\nimport { render, screen } from ''@testing-library/react-native'';\nimport { UserProfile } from ''../components/UserProfile'';\n\ndescribe(''UserProfile Component'', () => {\n  test(''renders user name correctly'', () => {\n    const mockUser = { id: ''1'', name: ''John Doe'', email: ''john@example.com'' };\n    render(<UserProfile user={mockUser} />);\n\n    expect(screen.getByText(''John Doe'')).toBeTruthy();\n  });\n\n  test(''handles missing user gracefully'', () => {\n    render(<UserProfile user={null} />);\n    expect(screen.getByText(/no user data/i)).toBeTruthy();\n  });\n});\n\n// E2E Testing with Detox\ndescribe(''Login Flow E2E Test'', () => {\n  beforeAll(async () => {\n    await device.launchApp();\n  });\n\n  beforeEach(async () => {\n    await device.reloadReactNative();\n  });\n\n  it(''should login successfully with valid credentials'', async () => {\n    await waitFor(element(by.id(''emailInput'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n\n    await element(by.id(''emailInput'')).typeText(''user@example.com'');\n    await element(by.id(''passwordInput'')).typeText(''password123'');\n    await element(by.id(''loginButton'')).multiTap();\n\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Home Feed'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n  });\n\n  it(''should show error with invalid credentials'', async () => {\n    await element(by.id(''emailInput'')).typeText(''invalid@example.com'');\n    await element(by.id(''passwordInput'')).typeText(''wrongpass'');\n    await element(by.id(''loginButton'')).multiTap();\n\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(/invalid credentials/i)))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(5000);\n  });\n\n  it(''should navigate between tabs'', async () => {\n    await element(by.id(''profileTab'')).tap();\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Profile'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(2000);\n\n    await element(by.id(''homeTab'')).tap();\n    await waitFor(element(by.text(''Home Feed'')))\n      .toBeVisible()\n      .withTimeout(2000);\n  });\n});\n```\n\n### 2. **iOS Testing with XCTest**\n\n```swift\nimport XCTest\n@testable import MyApp\n\nclass UserViewModelTests: XCTestCase {\n  var viewModel: UserViewModel!\n  var mockNetworkService: MockNetworkService!\n\n  override func setUp() {\n    super.setUp()\n    mockNetworkService = MockNetworkService()\n    viewModel = UserViewModel(networkService: mockNetworkService)\n  }\n\n  func testFetchUserSuccess() async {\n    let expectedUser = User(id: UUID(), name: \"John\", email: \"john@example.com\")\n    mockNetworkService.mockUser = expectedUser\n\n    await viewModel.fetchUser(id: expectedUser.id)\n\n    XCTAssertEqual(viewModel.user?.name, \"John\")\n    XCTAssertNil(viewModel.errorMessage)\n    XCTAssertFalse(viewModel.isLoading)\n  }\n\n  func testFetchUserFailure() async {\n    mockNetworkService.shouldFail = true\n\n    await viewModel.fetchUser(id: UUID())\n\n    XCTAssertNil(viewModel.user)\n    XCTAssertNotNil(viewModel.errorMessage)\n    XCTAssertFalse(viewModel.isLoading)\n  }\n}\n\nclass MockNetworkService: NetworkService {\n  var mockUser: User?\n  var shouldFail = false\n\n  override func fetch<T: Decodable>(\n    _: T.Type,\n    from endpoint: String\n  ) async throws -> T {\n    if shouldFail {\n      throw NetworkError.unknown\n    }\n    return mockUser as! T\n  }\n}\n\n// UI Test\nclass LoginUITests: XCTestCase {\n  override func setUp() {\n    super.setUp()\n    continueAfterFailure = false\n    XCUIApplication().launch()\n  }\n\n  func testLoginFlow() {\n    let app = XCUIApplication()\n\n    let emailTextField = app.textFields[\"emailInput\"]\n    let passwordTextField = app.secureTextFields[\"passwordInput\"]\n    let loginButton = app.buttons[\"loginButton\"]\n\n    emailTextField.tap()\n    emailTextField.typeText(\"user@example.com\")\n\n    passwordTextField.tap()\n    passwordTextField.typeText(\"password123\")\n\n    loginButton.tap()\n\n    let homeText = app.staticTexts[\"Home Feed\"]\n    XCTAssertTrue(homeText.waitForExistence(timeout: 5))\n  }\n\n  func testNavigationBetweenTabs() {\n    let app = XCUIApplication()\n    let profileTab = app.tabBars.buttons[\"Profile\"]\n    let homeTab = app.tabBars.buttons[\"Home\"]\n\n    profileTab.tap()\n    XCTAssertTrue(app.staticTexts[\"Profile\"].exists)\n\n    homeTab.tap()\n    XCTAssertTrue(app.staticTexts[\"Home\"].exists)\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 3. **Android Testing with Espresso**\n\n```kotlin\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass UserViewModelTest {\n  private lateinit var viewModel: UserViewModel\n  private val mockApiService = mock<ApiService>()\n\n  @Before\n  fun setUp() {\n    viewModel = UserViewModel(mockApiService)\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun fetchUserSuccess() = runTest {\n    val expectedUser = User(\"1\", \"John\", \"john@example.com\")\n    `when`(mockApiService.getUser(\"1\")).thenReturn(expectedUser)\n\n    viewModel.fetchUser(\"1\")\n\n    assertEquals(expectedUser.name, viewModel.user.value?.name)\n    assertEquals(null, viewModel.errorMessage.value)\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun fetchUserFailure() = runTest {\n    `when`(mockApiService.getUser(\"1\"))\n      .thenThrow(IOException(\"Network error\"))\n\n    viewModel.fetchUser(\"1\")\n\n    assertEquals(null, viewModel.user.value)\n    assertNotNull(viewModel.errorMessage.value)\n  }\n}\n\n// UI Test with Espresso\n@RunWith(AndroidJUnit4::class)\nclass LoginActivityTest {\n  @get:Rule\n  val activityRule = ActivityScenarioRule(LoginActivity::class.java)\n\n  @Test\n  fun testLoginWithValidCredentials() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.emailInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"user@example.com\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.passwordInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"password123\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.loginButton))\n      .perform(click())\n\n    onView(withText(\"Home\"))\n      .check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun testLoginWithInvalidCredentials() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.emailInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"invalid@example.com\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.passwordInput))\n      .perform(typeText(\"wrongpassword\"))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.loginButton))\n      .perform(click())\n\n    onView(withText(containsString(\"Invalid credentials\")))\n      .check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  fun testNavigationBetweenTabs() {\n    onView(withId(R.id.profileTab)).perform(click())\n    onView(withText(\"Profile\")).check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n\n    onView(withId(R.id.homeTab)).perform(click())\n    onView(withText(\"Home\")).check(matches(isDisplayed()))\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 4. **Performance Testing**\n\n```swift\nimport XCTest\n\nclass PerformanceTests: XCTestCase {\n  func testListRenderingPerformance() {\n    let viewModel = ItemsViewModel()\n    viewModel.items = (0..<1000).map { i in\n      Item(id: UUID(), title: \"Item \\(i)\", price: Double(i))\n    }\n\n    measure {\n      _ = viewModel.items.filter { $0.price > 50 }\n    }\n  }\n\n  func testNetworkResponseTime() {\n    let networkService = NetworkService()\n\n    measure {\n      let expectation = XCTestExpectation(description: \"Fetch user\")\n\n      Task {\n        do {\n          _ = try await networkService.fetch(User.self, from: \"/users/test\")\n          expectation.fulfill()\n        } catch {\n          XCTFail(\"Network request failed\")\n        }\n      }\n\n      wait(for: [expectation], timeout: 10)\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n### ✅ DO\n- Write tests for business logic first\n- Use dependency injection for testability\n- Mock external API calls\n- Test both success and failure paths\n- Automate UI testing for critical flows\n- Run tests on real devices\n- Measure performance on target devices\n- Keep tests isolated and independent\n- Use meaningful test names\n- Maintain >80% code coverage\n\n### ❌ DON''T\n- Skip testing UI-critical flows\n- Use hardcoded test data\n- Ignore performance regressions\n- Test implementation details\n- Make tests flaky or unreliable\n- Skip testing on actual devices\n- Ignore accessibility testing\n- Create interdependent tests\n- Test without mocking APIs\n- Deploy untested code\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:44:56.271Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Quality Assurance Agents focused on mobile application development, seeking to implement comprehensive testing strategies","zh":"适合专注于移动应用开发的质量保证代理，旨在实施全面测试策略","ja":"モバイルアプリケーション開発に焦点を当てた品質保証エージェントにとって最適であり、包括的なテスト戦略を実施することを目指している","ko":"모바일 애플리케이션 개발에 중점을 둔 품질 보증 에이전트에게 적합하며, 종합적인 테스트 전략을 구현하고자 하는 경우","es":"Ideal para agentes de aseguramiento de la calidad centrados en el desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles, que buscan implementar estrategias de prueba exhaustivas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''assurance qualité axés sur le développement d''applications mobiles, cherchant à mettre en œuvre des stratégies de test exhaustives","de":"Ideal für Qualitätsicherungsagenten, die sich auf die Entwicklung mobiler Anwendungen konzentrieren und umfassende Teststrategien umsetzen möchten","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Garantia de Qualidade focados no desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis, buscando implementar estratégias de teste abrangentes","ru":"Идеально для агентов по обеспечению качества, ориентированных на разработку мобильных приложений, стремящихся реализовать комплексные стратегии тестирования","ar":"مثالي لأعضاء فريق ضمان الجودة الذين يركزون على تطوير تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول، والذين يسعون إلى تنفيذ استراتيجيات اختبار شاملة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate UI testing across iOS and Android using Jest and Detox, ensuring reliable and high-performance mobile applications through unit tests, integration tests, and performance testing","zh":"赋予代理人使用Jest和Detox跨iOS和Android自动化UI测试的能力，确保通过单元测试、集成测试和性能测试实现可靠且高性能的移动应用程序","ja":"JestとDetoxを使用して、iOSとAndroidのUIテストを自動化するエージェントの能力を提供し、単体テスト、統合テスト、パフォーマンステストを通じて信頼性が高く、高パフォーマンスのモバイルアプリケーションを実現する","ko":"에이전트가 Jest와 Detox를 사용하여 iOS와 Android의 UI 테스트를 자동화할 수 있는 능력을 제공하여, 유닛 테스트, 통합 테스트, 성능 테스트를 통해 안정적이고 고성능의 모바일 애플리케이션을 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las pruebas de interfaz de usuario en iOS y Android utilizando Jest y Detox, garantizando aplicaciones móviles confiables y de alto rendimiento a través de pruebas unitarias, pruebas de integración y pruebas de rendimiento","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les tests d''interface utilisateur sur iOS et Android en utilisant Jest et Detox, garantissant des applications mobiles fiables et hautes performances grâce à des tests unitaires, des tests d''intégration et des tests de performance","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Benutzeroberflächentests für iOS und Android mithilfe von Jest und Detox zu automatisieren, und stellt so zuverlässige und hochleistungsfähige mobile Anwendungen durch Unit-Tests, Integrationstests und Leistungsprüfungen sicher","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar testes de UI em iOS e Android usando Jest e Detox, garantindo aplicativos móveis confiáveis e de alto desempenho por meio de testes unitários, testes de integração e testes de desempenho","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность автоматизировать тестирование UI в iOS и Android с помощью Jest и Detox, обеспечивая надежные и высокопроизводительные мобильные приложения посредством юнит-тестов, тестов интеграции и тестов производительности","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من Automation اختبار الواجهة الرسومية على نظامي iOS و Android باستخدام Jest و Detox، مما يضمن تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول الموثوقة وعالية الأداء من خلال الاختبارات الوحدوية واختبارات التكامل واختبارات الأداء"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating UI testing for cross-platform compatibility","Conducting performance testing and optimization for mobile apps","Implementing regression testing before releases to ensure app stability"],"zh":["为跨平台兼容性自动化UI测试","进行移动应用程序的性能测试和优化","在发布前实施回归测试以确保应用程序稳定性"],"ja":["クロスプラットフォームの互換性のためのUIテストの自動化","モバイルアプリケーションのパフォーマンステストと最適化","リリース前に回帰テストを実施してアプリの安定性を確保する"],"ko":["크로스 플랫폼 호환성을 위한 UI 테스트 자동화","모바일 애플리케이션의 성능 테스트 및 최적화","릴리즈 전에 회귀 테스트를 실시하여 애플리케이션의 안정성을 보장"],"es":["Automatizar las pruebas de interfaz de usuario para la compatibilidad entre plataformas","Realizar pruebas de rendimiento y optimización para aplicaciones móviles","Implementar pruebas de regresión antes de las versiones para garantizar la estabilidad de la aplicación"],"fr":["Automatiser les tests d''interface utilisateur pour la compatibilité multiplateforme","Effectuer des tests de performance et d''optimisation pour les applications mobiles","Mettre en œuvre des tests de régression avant les versions pour assurer la stabilité de l''application"],"de":["Automatisieren von Benutzeroberflächentests für die Kompatibilität zwischen Plattformen","Durchführen von Leistungs- und Optimierungstests für mobile Anwendungen","Implementieren von Regressionsprüfungen vor den Veröffentlichungen, um die Stabilität der Anwendung sicherzustellen"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de UI para compatibilidade entre plataformas","Realizar testes de desempenho e otimização para aplicativos móveis","Implementar testes de regressão antes dos lançamentos para garantir a estabilidade do aplicativo"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование UI для обеспечения совместимости между платформами","Проводить тесты производительности и оптимизацию для мобильных приложений","Реализовывать тесты регрессии перед выпусками для обеспечения стабильности приложения"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار الواجهة الرسومية لتحقيق التوافق بين المنصات","إجراء اختبارات الأداء والتحسين لتطبيقات الهاتف المحمول","تنفيذ اختبارات الانحدار قبل الإصدارات لضمان استقرار التطبيق"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React Native environment for Jest and Detox testing","Limited to mobile application testing scope"],"zh":["需要React Native环境用于Jest和Detox测试","仅限移动应用程序测试范围"],"ja":["JestとDetoxのテストにはReact Native環境が必要","モバイルアプリケーションのテスト範囲に限定"],"ko":["Jest와 Detox 테스트를 위해 React Native 환경이 필요","모바일 애플리케이션 테스트 범위에 한정"],"es":["Requiere un entorno React Native para las pruebas con Jest y Detox","Limitado al ámbito de pruebas de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React Native pour les tests avec Jest et Detox","Limité à la portée des tests d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Benötigt eine React-Native-Umgebung für Tests mit Jest und Detox","Begrenzt auf den Bereich der mobilen Anwendungstests"],"pt":["Exige ambiente React Native para testes Jest e Detox","Limitado ao escopo de teste de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["Требует среды React Native для тестирования Jest и Detox","Ограничен областью тестирования мобильных приложений"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React Native لاختبار Jest و Detox","محدود بمجال اختبار تطبيقات الهاتف المحمول"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"656add9094129451d3606c2712db0a052093d74d43053bb4450ba277a39118f7","qualityScore":54}');
