와 품질에 대한 통찰력을 제공하는 도구입니다","es":"edn-analyzer es un analizador de plantillas EDN para gráficos de bases de datos Logseq","fr":"edn-analyzer est un analyseur de modèles EDN pour les graphiques de bases de données Logseq","de":"edn-analyzer ist ein Analyse-Tool für EDN-Vorlagen für Logseq-Datenbank-Graphen","pt":"O EDN Analyzer é uma ferramenta de análise de estrutura para bases de dados Logseq que analisa arquivos de modelo EDN e fornece insights sobre a estrutura e qualidade.","ru":"ИИ Агент EDN Analyzer - это инструмент для анализа структуры базы данных Logseq, который анализирует файлы шаблонов EDN и предоставляет информацию о структуре и качестве.","ar":"تطبيق EDN Analyzer هو أداة لتحليل البنية للقواعد البيانية Logseq التي تحليل ملفات القوالب EDN وتوفر رؤى حول البنية وجودة."},"features":{"en":["Performs structure analysis, including class and property counting","Identifies class hierarchies and inheritance chains in EDN templates","Maps property-to-class relationships for better understanding","Generates structure reports for Logseq database optimization","Conducts quality checks, including finding orphaned classes"],"zh":["结构分析：计数类和属性、识别类层次和继承链","质量检查：找到孤立类、分析模块分布","生成结构报告","识别类-属性关系","分析 EDN 模板文件"],"ja":["構造分析：クラスとプロパティのカウント、クラス階層と継承チェーンの識別","品質チェック：孤立クラスの検出、モジュール分布の分析","構造レポートの生成","クラス-プロパティ関係の識別","EDN テンプレートファイルの分析"],"ko":["구조 분석: 클래스와 속성의 카운트, 클래스 계층과 상속 체인의 식별","품질 검사: 고립된 클래스의検出, 모듈 분포의 분석","구조 보고서의 생성","클래스-속성 관계의 식별","EDN 템플릿 파일의 분석"],"es":["Análisis de estructura de plantillas EDN","Identificación de jerarquías y cadenas de herencia de clases","Generación de informes sobre la estructura de módulos","Detección de clases huérfanas","Análisis de la calidad de las plantillas EDN","Asignación de propiedades a clases"],"fr":["Analyse de la structure des modèles EDN","Identification des hiérarchies et des chaînes d''héritage de classes","Génération de rapports sur la structure des modules","Détection de classes orphelines","Analyse de la qualité des modèles EDN","Affectation de propriétés à des classes"],"de":["Strukturanalyse von EDN-Vorlagen","Identifizierung von Klassen-Hierarchien und Vererbungsketten","Erstellung von Berichten über die Modulstruktur","Erkennung von Waisen-Klassen","Qualitätsanalyse von EDN-Vorlagen","Zuweisung von Eigenschaften zu Klassen"],"pt":["Análise de estrutura: contagem de classes e propriedades","Identificação de hierarquias e cadeias de herança de classes","Mapeamento de relações entre propriedades e classes","Análise de distribuição de módulos","Geração de relatórios de estrutura"],"ru":["Анализ структуры: подсчет классов и свойств","Идентификация иерархий и цепочек наследования классов","Отображение отношений между свойствами и классами","Анализ распределения модулей","Генерация отчетов о структуре"],"ar":["تحليل البنية: تعداد الفئات والخصائص","تحديد الهياكل والتركات الوراثية للفئات","خريطة العلاقات بين الخصائص والفئات","تحليل توزيع الوحدات","توليد تقارير البنية"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use edn-analyzer","edn-analyzer setup guide","Logseq database structure analysis","edn-analyzer vs other Logseq tools","edn-analyzer install","what is edn-analyzer","edn-analyzer alternative","edn-analyzer for AI agents","EDN template analysis"],"zh":["edn-analyzer","Logseq 数据库","结构分析","质量检查","EDN 模板文件","AI 工具","数据分析","数据库优化"],"ja":["edn-analyzer","Logseq データベース","構造分析","品質チェック","EDN テンプレートファイル","AI エージェント","データ分析","データベース最適化"],"ko":["edn-analyzer","Logseq 데이터베이스","구조 분석","품질 검사","EDN 템플릿 파일","AI 에이전트","데이터 분석","데이터베이스 최적화"],"es":["edn-analyzer","Logseq","análisis de estructura","plantillas EDN","gráficos de bases de datos","herramientas de desarrollo","edn-analyzer configuración","Logseq desarrollo","desarrollo de bases de datos"],"fr":["edn-analyzer","Logseq","analyse de structure","modèles EDN","graphiques de bases de données","outils de développement","configuration edn-analyzer","développement Logseq","développement de bases de données"],"de":["edn-analyzer","Logseq","Strukturanalyse","EDN-Vorlagen","Datenbank-Graphen","Entwicklungstools","edn-analyzer-Konfiguration","Logseq-Entwicklung","Datenbank-Entwicklung"],"pt":["EDN Analyzer","análise de estrutura","Logseq","ferramenta de análise","qualidade de dados","análise de modelo EDN","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ИИ Агент EDN Analyzer","анализ структуры","Logseq","инструмент анализа","качество данных","анализ шаблонов EDN","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки"],"ar":["تطبيق EDN Analyzer","تحليل البنية","Logseq","أداة تحليل","جودة البيانات","تحليل قوالب EDN","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"C0ntr0lledCha0s","repo":"logseq-template-graph","repoPath":"C0ntr0lledCha0s/logseq-template-graph","stars":5,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-23T16:12:58Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"edn-analyzer","description":"Deep EDN template analyzer for Logseq database graphs. Analyzes template structure, counts classes/properties, finds orphaned items, checks quality, and compares variants. Use when analyzing template files, finding issues, or comparing different template versions.","bodyPreview":"# EDN Analyzer Skill\n\nYou are an EDN template analyzer for Logseq database graphs. Your role is to deeply analyze EDN template files and provide insights about structure, quality, and potential issues.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### 1. Structure Analysis\n- Count classes and properties\n- Identify class hierarchies and inheritance chains\n- Map property-to-class relationships\n- Analyze module distribution\n- Generate structure reports\n\n### 2. Quality Checks\n- Find orphaned classes (no parent, not Thing)\n- Fi","body":"# EDN Analyzer Skill\n\nYou are an EDN template analyzer for Logseq database graphs. Your role is to deeply analyze EDN template files and provide insights about structure, quality, and potential issues.\n\n## Capabilities\n\n### 1. Structure Analysis\n- Count classes and properties\n- Identify class hierarchies and inheritance chains\n- Map property-to-class relationships\n- Analyze module distribution\n- Generate structure reports\n\n### 2. Quality Checks\n- Find orphaned classes (no parent, not Thing)\n- Find orphaned properties (not assigned to any class)\n- Detect duplicate IDs or titles\n- Check for missing required fields\n- Validate cardinality usage patterns\n\n### 3. Distribution Analysis\n- Cardinality distribution (`:one` vs `:many`)\n- Property type distribution (`:default`, `:node`, `:date`, `:url`, `:number`)\n- Class size distribution (properties per class)\n- Module size balance\n\n### 4. Comparison\n- Compare different template variants\n- Show differences between builds\n- Track template growth over time\n- Identify variant-specific features\n\n## Analysis Workflow\n\nWhen the user asks you to analyze a template:\n\n1. **Read the template file(s)**\n   - Use the Read tool to load the EDN file\n   - Parse the `:properties` and `:classes` sections\n\n2. **Perform requested analysis**\n   - Count items\n   - Build relationship maps\n   - Identify issues\n   - Calculate statistics\n\n3. **Generate clear report**\n   - Use tables for structured data\n   - Highlight warnings and suggestions\n   - Provide actionable recommendations\n   - Show examples where helpful\n\n4. **Offer follow-up actions**\n   - Fix orphaned items\n   - Rebalance modules\n   - Update documentation\n   - Create issues for problems\n\n## Example Analyses\n\n### Find Orphaned Classes\n```\nUser: \"Analyze the full template and show orphaned classes\"\n\nSteps:\n1. Read build/logseq_db_Templates_full.edn\n2. Extract all classes\n3. Check each class for :build/class-parent\n4. Identify classes without parent (except Thing and Agent)\n5. Report findings with suggestions\n```\n\n### Compare Variants\n```\nUser: \"Compare the full and CRM templates\"\n\nSteps:\n1. Read both template files\n2. Count classes and properties in each\n3. Identify CRM-specific items\n4. Show size differences\n5. Highlight unique features\n```\n\n### Analyze Property Distribution\n```\nUser: \"Show me the distribution of property types\"\n\nSteps:\n1. Read template file\n2. Extract all properties\n3. Group by :logseq.property/type\n4. Count each type\n5. Show as table and percentage\n```\n\n### Module Health Check\n```\nUser: \"Check if modules are balanced\"\n\nSteps:\n1. Read all source/*/properties.edn and source/*/classes.edn\n2. Count items per module\n3. Calculate module sizes\n4. Identify outliers (too big/small)\n5. Suggest reorganization if needed\n```\n\n## Output Format\n\n### For Statistics\nUse tables:\n```\n📊 Template Statistics\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nTotal Classes: 632\nTotal Properties: 1,033\n\nProperty Types:\n┌──────────────┬───────┬─────────┐\n│ Type         │ Count │ Percent │\n├──────────────┼───────┼─────────┤\n│ :default     │   620 │  60.0%  │\n│ :node        │   280 │  27.1%  │\n│ :date        │    89 │   8.6%  │\n│ :url         │    32 │   3.1%  │\n│ :number      │    12 │   1.2%  │\n└──────────────┴───────┴─────────┘\n```\n\n### For Issues\nUse warnings:\n```\n⚠️  Issues Found: 3\n\n1. Orphaned Classes (2)\n   - Schedule (in intangible module)\n     → Suggestion: Add :build/class-parent :user.class/Intangible\n\n   - ProductCategory (in product module)\n     → Suggestion: Add :build/class-parent :user.class/DefinedTerm\n\n2. Large Module (1)\n   - misc/ module: 82 classes (61% of total)\n     → Suggestion: Split into focused modules:\n       • communication/ (EmailMessage, Message, etc.)\n       • medical/ (MedicalCondition, Drug, etc.)\n       • financial/ (Invoice, PaymentCard, etc.)\n```\n\n### For Comparisons\nUse side-by-side tables:\n```\n📋 Variant Comparison\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n┌──────────────┬──────┬─────┬────────┬──────────┐\n│ Variant      │ Size │ Cls │ Props  │ Modules  │\n├──────────────┼──────┼─────┼────────┼──────────┤\n│ Full         │ 497K │ 632 │ 1,033  │ All (11) │\n│ CRM          │ 298K │   8 │   240  │ 4        │\n│ Research     │ 317K │  22 │   247  │ 5        │\n│ Content      │ 285K │  18 │   228  │ 4        │\n│ Events       │ 302K │  24 │   252  │ 5        │\n└──────────────┴──────┴─────┴────────┴──────────┘\n```\n\n## Tools You''ll Use\n\n- **Read**: Load EDN template files\n- **Grep**: Search for specific patterns in templates\n- **Glob**: Find template files\n- **Bash**: Run analysis scripts if needed\n\n## Important Notes\n\n- Always validate EDN structure before analysis\n- Handle large files carefully (15K+ lines)\n- Provide specific line numbers when reporting issues\n- Suggest fixes, don''t just report problems\n- Consider the modular architecture when analyzing\n\n## Example Interactions\n\n### Basic Analysis\n```\nUser: \"Analyze build/logseq_db_Templates_full.edn\"\n\nYou:\n1. Read the file\n2. Count classes and properties\n3. Analyze structure\n4. Generate comprehensive report\n5. Highlight any issues\n6. Offer to fix problems\n```\n\n### Deep Dive\n```\nUser: \"Find all properties with :db.cardinality/many\"\n\nYou:\n1. Read template\n2. Filter properties by cardinality\n3. Group by module\n4. Show which classes use them\n5. Analyze usage patterns\n```\n\n### Cross-Template Analysis\n```\nUser: \"What''s unique to the CRM template?\"\n\nYou:\n1. Read full template\n2. Read CRM template\n3. Identify CRM-only classes/properties\n4. Show what was excluded\n5. Explain why CRM is optimized\n```\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- Accurate counts and statistics\n- Clear, actionable recommendations\n- Fast analysis (< 30 seconds for most queries)\n- Helpful visualizations (tables, percentages)\n- Proactive problem detection\n- Specific file paths and line numbers\n\n---\n\n**When activated, you become an expert EDN template analyzer focused on providing deep insights into Logseq database graph templates.**\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T06:54:22.192Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Logseq Database Agents needing in-depth EDN template analysis and optimization.","zh":"适合需要对 Logseq Database Agents 进行深入 EDN 模板分析和优化的场景。","ja":"Logseq Database Agents に対して深い EDN テンプレート分析と最適化が必要な場合に最適です。","ko":"Logseq Database Agents에 대한 심층적인 EDN 템플릿 분석 및 최적화가 필요한 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de base de datos Logseq que necesitan un análisis y optimización en profundidad de plantillas EDN.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de base de données Logseq qui ont besoin d''une analyse et d''une optimisation approfondies de modèles EDN.","de":"Perfekt für Logseq-Datenbankagenten, die eine umfassende Analyse und Optimierung von EDN-Vorlagen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Banco de Dados Logseq que precisam de análise e otimização em profundidade de modelos de EDN.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов базы данных Logseq, требующих глубокого анализа и оптимизации шаблонов EDN.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكالات قاعدة بيانات Logseq التي تحتاج إلى تحليل وضبط قوالب EDN بشكل عميق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze EDN template files, providing insights into structure and quality, and identifying potential issues through class hierarchy analysis and property-to-class relationship mapping, utilizing Logseq database graphs.","zh":"赋予代理分析 EDN 模板文件的能力，提供有关结构和质量的见解，并通过类层次分析和属性到类关系映射来识别潜在问题，利用 Logseq 数据库图。","ja":"エージェントに EDN テンプレートファイルを分析する能力を与え、構造と品質に関する洞察を提供し、クラス階層分析とプロパティーからクラスへの関係マッピングを通じて潜在的な問題を特定し、Logseq データベースグラフを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 EDN 템플릿 파일을 분석할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 구조와 품질에 대한 통찰력을 제공하고 클래스 계층 분석 및 속성에서 클래스로의 관계 매핑을 통해 잠재적인 문제를 식별하며 Logseq 데이터베이스 그래프를 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar archivos de plantillas EDN, proporcionando información sobre la estructura y la calidad, e identificando posibles problemas a través del análisis de la jerarquía de clases y el mapeo de la relación de propiedades a clases, utilizando gráficos de base de datos Logseq.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les fichiers de modèles EDN, fournissant des informations sur la structure et la qualité, et identifiant les problèmes potentiels grâce à l''analyse de la hiérarchie des classes et au mappage de la relation propriété-classe, en utilisant les graphiques de base de données Logseq.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, EDN-Vorlagendateien zu analysieren und Erkenntnisse über Struktur und Qualität zu liefern, sowie potenzielle Probleme durch Klassenhierarchieanalyse und Eigenschaft-zu-Klasse-Zuordnung zu identifizieren, unter Verwendung von Logseq-Datenbankgraphen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar arquivos de modelo de EDN, fornecendo insights sobre estrutura e qualidade, e identificando problemas potenciais por meio da análise da hierarquia de classes e mapeamento de relação de propriedade para classe, utilizando gráficos de banco de dados Logseq.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать файлы шаблонов EDN, предоставляя информацию о структуре и качестве, и выявляя потенциальные проблемы посредством анализа иерархии классов и сопоставления отношений свойства с классом, используя графы базы данных Logseq.","ar":"تمكّن الوكالات من تحليل ملفات قوالب EDN، وتقديم رؤى حول الهيكل والجودة، وتحديد المشاكل المحتملة من خلال تحليل هرمية الطبقات وتنسيق العلاقة بين الخاصية والفئة، باستخدام رسومات قاعدة بيانات Logseq."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing EDN template structure for optimization","Identifying orphaned classes in Logseq databases","Generating structure reports for EDN template files"],"zh":["分析 EDN 模板结构以进行优化","在 Logseq 数据库中识别孤立的类","为 EDN 模板文件生成结构报告"],"ja":["最適化のための EDN テンプレート構造の分析","Logseq データベース内の孤立したクラスの特定","EDN テンプレートファイルの構造レポートの生成"],"ko":["최적화를 위한 EDN 템플릿 구조 분석","Logseq 데이터베이스 내의 고립된 클래스 식별","EDN 템플릿 파일의 구조 보고서 생성"],"es":["Análisis de la estructura de plantillas EDN para optimización","Identificación de clases huérfanas en bases de datos Logseq","Generación de informes de estructura para archivos de plantillas EDN"],"fr":["Analyse de la structure de modèles EDN pour l''optimisation","Identification de classes orphelines dans les bases de données Logseq","Génération de rapports de structure pour les fichiers de modèles EDN"],"de":["Analyse der Struktur von EDN-Vorlagen für die Optimierung","Identifizierung von Waisenklassen in Logseq-Datenbanken","Erstellung von Strukturberichten für EDN-Vorlagendateien"],"pt":["Analisar a estrutura do modelo de EDN para otimização","Identificar classes órfãs em bancos de dados Logseq","Gerar relatórios de estrutura para arquivos de modelo de EDN"],"ru":["Анализировать структуру шаблона EDN для оптимизации","Определять孤анные классы в базах данных Logseq","Генерировать отчеты о структуре для файлов шаблонов EDN"],"ar":["تحليل هيكل قوالب EDN للتحسين","تحديد الطبقات اليتمية في قواعد بيانات Logseq","إنتاج تقارير هيكلية لملفات قوالب EDN"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to EDN template files","Specific to Logseq database graphs","Limited to EDN template analysis"],"zh":["需要访问 EDN 模板文件","特定于 Logseq 数据库图","仅限 EDN 模板分析"],"ja":["EDN テンプレートファイルへのアクセスが必要","Logseq データベースグラフに特定","EDN テンプレート分析のみ"],"ko":["EDN 템플릿 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요","Logseq 데이터베이스 그래프에 특정","EDN 템플릿 분석만"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos de plantillas EDN","Específico para gráficos de base de datos Logseq","Limitado al análisis de plantillas EDN"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux fichiers de modèles EDN","Spécifique aux graphiques de base de données Logseq","Limité à l''analyse de modèles EDN"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf EDN-Vorlagendateien","Spezifisch für Logseq-Datenbankgraphen","Begrenzt auf die Analyse von EDN-Vorlagen"],"pt":["Requer acesso a arquivos de modelo de EDN","Específico para gráficos de banco de dados Logseq","Limitado à análise de modelos de EDN"],"ru":["Требует доступа к файлам шаблонов EDN","Специфичен для графов базы данных Logseq","Ограничен анализом шаблонов EDN"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى ملفات قوالب EDN","محدد لرسومات قاعدة بيانات Logseq","محدود بتحليل قوالب EDN"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"5c53ec6029b0d83ad25e271377864bb62eb88527b903f991e62c76f7769e9060","qualityScore":54}');
